(110133, 4814, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea and a very cute shot, but there is a flaw As you have stated in the title, it''s a protective mother and although not human, she is still their mother  therefore, the other two must be her children, and they are also in the shot; so I think it breaks the rules of the challenge.  I hope that doesn''t sound a too pedantic Apart from that, the picture itself is really good  love the expression on mums face</td>', 'This is a great idea and a very cute shot, but there is a flaw As you have stated in the title, it''s a protective mother and although not human, she is still their mother  therefore, the other two must be her children, and they are also in the shot; so I think it breaks the rules of the challenge.  I hope that doesn''t sound a too pedantic Apart from that, the picture itself is really good  love the expression on mums face', '2002-08-29 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
