(110137, 4814, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  I wonder if you will get comments about not having children in your photo.  cause technically, these are her children.  Don''t really matter, it''s still a great photo and i have to commend you on getting that close up of a photo of animals.  I wonder where these deer are from, for some reason they look a bit different from our deer.  Maybe it''s just the angle.  Who knows.  I love the framing on this photo, and the lighting is nice.  I like the contrast of the bright grass in the back, and the dark grass in the front.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cute.  I wonder if you will get comments about not having children in your photo.  cause technically, these are her children.  Don''t really matter, it''s still a great photo and i have to commend you on getting that close up of a photo of animals.  I wonder where these deer are from, for some reason they look a bit different from our deer.  Maybe it''s just the angle.  Who knows.  I love the framing on this photo, and the lighting is nice.  I like the contrast of the bright grass in the back, and the dark grass in the front.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-30 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
