(110180, 4816, 3080, '<td valign="top">You will have to forgive me if I''m not exactly sure what''s going on here.  I see a suction cup santa, that looks like he might be driving a sleigh, indicated by the antlers coming out of santas head.  There are other little santas hanging from a tree and some google-eye x-ray glasses.  I think the angle could have been better, to maybe show the "story" a bit better.  The santa in the front is really dark and covers up most of what is going on in the background.  Just because I don''t get it, doesn''t mean you didn''t though.  I mean, I wasn''t there, so without seeing everything, it''s just hard for me to see.  I think it depicts childhood (for most kids)  very well, by including santa in there.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You will have to forgive me if I''m not exactly sure what''s going on here.  I see a suction cup santa, that looks like he might be driving a sleigh, indicated by the antlers coming out of santas head.  There are other little santas hanging from a tree and some google-eye x-ray glasses.  I think the angle could have been better, to maybe show the "story" a bit better.  The santa in the front is really dark and covers up most of what is going on in the background.  Just because I don''t get it, doesn''t mean you didn''t though.  I mean, I wasn''t there, so without seeing everything, it''s just hard for me to see.  I think it depicts childhood (for most kids)  very well, by including santa in there.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
