(110188, 4817, 3469, '<td valign="top">Nicely done as a picture. However the link with childhood as a picture is weak and depends entirely on the setting in this challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done as a picture. However the link with childhood as a picture is weak and depends entirely on the setting in this challenge.', '2002-08-26 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110189, 4817, 1674, '<td valign="top">Great composition</td>', 'Great composition', '2002-08-26 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110190, 4817, 3002, '<td valign="top">What does this have to do with ''childhood''?</td>', 'What does this have to do with ''childhood''?', '2002-08-26 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110191, 4817, 2858, '<td valign="top">What, no swings? Actually, that''s what I like about this photograph. It''s understated, a bit dreamy with the soft focus and it''s not prescriptive - any number of memories could be evoked by this. Some might say this doesn''t fit the challenge but that''s only if you don''t use your imagination. In my top ten.</td>', 'What, no swings? Actually, that''s what I like about this photograph. It''s understated, a bit dreamy with the soft focus and it''s not prescriptive - any number of memories could be evoked by this. Some might say this doesn''t fit the challenge but that''s only if you don''t use your imagination. In my top ten.', '2002-08-27 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110192, 4817, 1024, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this photo.  There is something hauntingly familiar with it... maybe a memory from my childhood?  Great job.  9 BAMartin</td>', 'I keep coming back to this photo.  There is something hauntingly familiar with it... maybe a memory from my childhood?  Great job.  9 BAMartin', '2002-08-27 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110193, 4817, 2928, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for atmospherics in a shot and you have captured the element perfectly.  It meets the challenge in an unusual way  after all, the easiest way to lose your children is to leave the door open.  The purist voter may pull the lighting apart or find something wrong with the composition or focus, but personally, I like the whole effect.  It creates a surreal effect (10)</td>', 'I''m a sucker for atmospherics in a shot and you have captured the element perfectly.  It meets the challenge in an unusual way  after all, the easiest way to lose your children is to leave the door open.  The purist voter may pull the lighting apart or find something wrong with the composition or focus, but personally, I like the whole effect.  It creates a surreal effect (10)', '2002-08-27 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110194, 4817, 2817, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how this pertains to childhood but it is sort of nice. Maybe if you moved a little bit there wouldn''t have been such a glare from the light.</td>', 'I am not sure how this pertains to childhood but it is sort of nice. Maybe if you moved a little bit there wouldn''t have been such a glare from the light.', '2002-08-27 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110195, 4817, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this photo.  That glow from the outside light is most excellent :)  I''m not sure that I understand the relationship between this image and childhood, but I''m still scoring well simply because I think this is a great photo... good work! = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'I love the lighting in this photo.  That glow from the outside light is most excellent :)  I''m not sure that I understand the relationship between this image and childhood, but I''m still scoring well simply because I think this is a great photo... good work! = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110196, 4817, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-27 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110197, 4817, 2752, '<td valign="top">very lovely..nice play of soft light,wood, door and the blue waste basket...looks very welcoming</td>', 'very lovely..nice play of soft light,wood, door and the blue waste basket...looks very welcoming', '2002-08-28 01:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110198, 4817, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT shot, but I''m having trouble seeing the challenge here... Am I missing something obvious?  I''ll revisit this a few times and see if I can tell where you were coming from... Feel free to PM me if I''m missing something obvious... myqyl</td>', 'This is a GREAT shot, but I''m having trouble seeing the challenge here... Am I missing something obvious?  I''ll revisit this a few times and see if I can tell where you were coming from... Feel free to PM me if I''m missing something obvious... myqyl', '2002-08-28 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110199, 4817, 1666, '<td valign="top">Interpretation of the challenge 2/4<br/>Technical Aspects 2/4<br/>WOW Factor 1/2<br/>Total 5</td>', 'Interpretation of the challenge 2/4Technical Aspects 2/4WOW Factor 1/2Total 5', '2002-08-28 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110200, 4817, 3601, '<td valign="top">It''s too realistic( dirty door and blue basket)</td>', 'It''s too realistic( dirty door and blue basket)', '2002-08-28 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110201, 4817, 2247, '<td valign="top">Way too much light glare from outside.  And the door is fuzzy.  The table and chair is beautiful.  If only your whole were like the chair and table. . . .</td>', 'Way too much light glare from outside.  And the door is fuzzy.  The table and chair is beautiful.  If only your whole were like the chair and table. . . .', '2002-08-29 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110202, 4817, 2909, '<td valign="top">How many times I heard "Were you born in a barn?"  Good imagination.........</td>', 'How many times I heard "Were you born in a barn?"  Good imagination.........', '2002-08-29 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110203, 4817, 1054, '<td valign="top">LOL, how true!  I can hear my mother yelling at me!  The outside light is a bit blown out, of course this is a difficult lighting combination.</td>', 'LOL, how true!  I can hear my mother yelling at me!  The outside light is a bit blown out, of course this is a difficult lighting combination.', '2002-08-29 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110204, 4817, 2798, '<td valign="top">Love that bright light out there. Interesting angle too. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Love that bright light out there. Interesting angle too. 8 - floyd', '2002-08-30 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110205, 4817, 3080, '<td valign="top">"You weren''t raised in a barn...shut that door!"  Definately a part of my childhood, thats for sure.  Great job of capturing that moment.  I''m not one for exaggerated bright spots, or shadows, but I must say I think it works here.  I think the bright sun draws attention to the fact that the door is open.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', '"You weren''t raised in a barn...shut that door!"  Definately a part of my childhood, thats for sure.  Great job of capturing that moment.  I''m not one for exaggerated bright spots, or shadows, but I must say I think it works here.  I think the bright sun draws attention to the fact that the door is open.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-30 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110206, 4817, 2279, '<td valign="top">A little more natural light inside would have helped a little. Like maybe opening a window or something. Just seems a little too dark inside. 6.</td>', 'A little more natural light inside would have helped a little. Like maybe opening a window or something. Just seems a little too dark inside. 6.', '2002-08-31 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110207, 4817, 1827, '<td valign="top">Ever since I received low votes (without explanation) on a photo that I liked a great deal, I have made it my habit to try to explain my votes, especially if they are low.  These are the thoughts of one person; use what you can, disregard the rest.<br/><br/>Primarily, I found this photo visually unappealing.  The over-exposed bit toward the top I think was intentional, but it was a distraction for me.  Arguably, it is your focal point - since the photo is titled Open Door.  Yet, there''s nothing there that I can see to draw me out.  Perhaps, the contrast of a dark house versus bright day outside, but it just didn''t work for me.  Perhaps if there''d been a blue sky or evidence of other kids playing outside, or something to draw me out. <br/><br/>I hope it''s clear that I''m not trying to alter how you composed the photo; only explain why it didn''t appeal to me.  2, just-married</td>', 'Ever since I received low votes (without explanation) on a photo that I liked a great deal, I have made it my habit to try to explain my votes, especially if they are low.  These are the thoughts of one person; use what you can, disregard the rest.Primarily, I found this photo visually unappealing.  The over-exposed bit toward the top I think was intentional, but it was a distraction for me.  Arguably, it is your focal point - since the photo is titled Open Door.  Yet, there''s nothing there that I can see to draw me out.  Perhaps, the contrast of a dark house versus bright day outside, but it just didn''t work for me.  Perhaps if there''d been a blue sky or evidence of other kids playing outside, or something to draw me out. I hope it''s clear that I''m not trying to alter how you composed the photo; only explain why it didn''t appeal to me.  2, just-married', '2002-09-01 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110208, 4817, 2641, '<td valign="top">Nice Soft light! Very nice! Good Luck!</td>', 'Nice Soft light! Very nice! Good Luck!', '2002-09-02 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110209, 4819, 772, '<td valign="top">I believe this photo does a better job of describing ''parenthood'' rather than childhood :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I believe this photo does a better job of describing ''parenthood'' rather than childhood :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110210, 4819, 1360, '<td valign="top">This photo looks like not a lot of thought was put into it.  4 -lennier</td>', 'This photo looks like not a lot of thought was put into it.  4 -lennier', '2002-08-26 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110211, 4819, 327, '<td valign="top">Me too. Nice visual shot. Score 6 Justine</td>', 'Me too. Nice visual shot. Score 6 Justine', '2002-08-26 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110212, 4819, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the angle - either want to be MORE of an angle or properly infront of it. <br/>Kavey</td>', 'Not sure about the angle - either want to be MORE of an angle or properly infront of it. Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110213, 4819, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice snapshot.  Well focused, framing works well enough, (gray sky or washed out? can''t tell, so not a points issue).  Not fond of the idea that your addition to this photo is the title and not much else.  Probably should have cropped a little tighter, to eliminate the rest of the other billboard.  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice snapshot.  Well focused, framing works well enough, (gray sky or washed out? can''t tell, so not a points issue).  Not fond of the idea that your addition to this photo is the title and not much else.  Probably should have cropped a little tighter, to eliminate the rest of the other billboard.  6 Swash', '2002-08-26 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110214, 4819, 3075, '<td valign="top">Nice modern touch you gave to this challenge! Funny how you get to think of this!<br/></td>', 'Nice modern touch you gave to this challenge! Funny how you get to think of this!', '2002-08-26 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110215, 4819, 1827, '<td valign="top">The commentary in the title is interesting, but the photo doesn''t say it all by itself to me.  IMO, the angle of the sign didn''t add to this picture; lined up nicely would have appealed to me more.  Also, lighting changes could have been helpful, but then we can''t expect you to control mother nature.  5, just-married</td>', 'The commentary in the title is interesting, but the photo doesn''t say it all by itself to me.  IMO, the angle of the sign didn''t add to this picture; lined up nicely would have appealed to me more.  Also, lighting changes could have been helpful, but then we can''t expect you to control mother nature.  5, just-married', '2002-08-27 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110216, 4819, 2199, '<td valign="top">Creative idea -- I might like the composition better if your angle were lower (looking up at an angle to see the billboard). The area around the billboard really isn''t adding anything to the composition....that''s why I mention that it might be good to experiment with how the billboard fills the frame.</td>', 'Creative idea -- I might like the composition better if your angle were lower (looking up at an angle to see the billboard). The area around the billboard really isn''t adding anything to the composition....that''s why I mention that it might be good to experiment with how the billboard fills the frame.', '2002-08-27 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110217, 4819, 3580, '<td valign="top">what have you done to make this already exsisting sign, be viewed in a new way?</td>', 'what have you done to make this already exsisting sign, be viewed in a new way?', '2002-08-28 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110218, 4819, 2295, '<td valign="top">Subject is appropriate.  Might have look better if you were angled a bit more straight on with the sign.  Lighting is OK.  Focus is OK.</td>', 'Subject is appropriate.  Might have look better if you were angled a bit more straight on with the sign.  Lighting is OK.  Focus is OK.', '2002-08-28 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110219, 4819, 1748, '<td valign="top">scary aint it</td>', 'scary aint it', '2002-08-28 19:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110220, 4819, 2643, '<td valign="top">Cool!  McGruff!</td>', 'Cool!  McGruff!', '2002-08-29 04:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110221, 4819, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 3,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 3,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-08-29 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110222, 4819, 3080, '<td valign="top">Take a bite out of crime.  If the internet was the worst thing we had to worry about with our kids, it would be a good world.  DARE, McGruff, and Smokey were all popular when I was  young.  Might not have thought much about them then, other than they were pretty cool talking animals, but the "older wiser" me sees that these were an important part of keeping us safe.  This is a great childhood photo.  lighting and placement are great.  This photo is good without the head on angle.  great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Take a bite out of crime.  If the internet was the worst thing we had to worry about with our kids, it would be a good world.  DARE, McGruff, and Smokey were all popular when I was  young.  Might not have thought much about them then, other than they were pretty cool talking animals, but the "older wiser" me sees that these were an important part of keeping us safe.  This is a great childhood photo.  lighting and placement are great.  This photo is good without the head on angle.  great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110223, 4819, 2279, '<td valign="top">This seems more like a snapshot to me. 5.</td>', 'This seems more like a snapshot to me. 5.', '2002-08-31 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110224, 4819, 1054, '<td valign="top">While the billboard is interesting, the overall composition of the photograph really isn''t.  There''s really nothing worthwhile here except the billboard itself, which is someone else''s work.</td>', 'While the billboard is interesting, the overall composition of the photograph really isn''t.  There''s really nothing worthwhile here except the billboard itself, which is someone else''s work.', '2002-09-02 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110225, 4819, 3120, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2002-09-06 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(110226, 4820, 1826, '<td valign="top">I like the way you shot this from the perspective of a small child.</td>', 'I like the way you shot this from the perspective of a small child.', '2002-08-26 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110227, 4820, 3317, '<td valign="top">nice low perspective.</td>', 'nice low perspective.', '2002-08-26 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110228, 4820, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the idea and low viewpoint and the candles have come out well. The background and right hand side are too dark and the tablecloth in the foreground. <br/>Kavey</td>', 'Like the idea and low viewpoint and the candles have come out well. The background and right hand side are too dark and the tablecloth in the foreground. Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110229, 4820, 2223, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective, i want to see the cake!</td>', 'interesting perspective, i want to see the cake!', '2002-08-26 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110230, 4820, 772, '<td valign="top">Birthday parties are a great memory of childhood for me :)  I also like the angle you have presented here that looks like a small child''s view :) Good work... - jmsetzler</td>', 'Birthday parties are a great memory of childhood for me :)  I also like the angle you have presented here that looks like a small child''s view :) Good work... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110231, 4820, 3554, '<td valign="top">Consider your title a little more.  I think "Special Day" would work better than Zack''s special day.</td>', 'Consider your title a little more.  I think "Special Day" would work better than Zack''s special day.', '2002-08-27 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110232, 4820, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-27 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110233, 4820, 806, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been cropped tighter without losing the perspective that was so well captured here (from the child''s point of view). Good idea.</td>', 'I think this could have been cropped tighter without losing the perspective that was so well captured here (from the child''s point of view). Good idea.', '2002-08-29 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110234, 4820, 2643, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit gloomy.</td>', 'Looks a bit gloomy.', '2002-08-29 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110235, 4820, 2928, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of an empty set on a children''s TV show  that isn''t a criticism by the way.  I like the atmosphere created by the candles and the lighting and the feeling that there''s nobody around to witness the scene.  It has a lonely feel - almost like it''s pretending to be happy.  The angle is very clever  it creates the illusion of a stage curtain rather than household curtains and this adds to the surreal effect.  I have to say, this is a great shot.  I may not have interpreted this shot as you intended, but then I might :o)  Sometimes the guessing is as much fun as the challenge itself  This picture has had me looking at it for ages, so, it has made me think (10)</td>', 'This reminds me of an empty set on a children''s TV show  that isn''t a criticism by the way.  I like the atmosphere created by the candles and the lighting and the feeling that there''s nobody around to witness the scene.  It has a lonely feel - almost like it''s pretending to be happy.  The angle is very clever  it creates the illusion of a stage curtain rather than household curtains and this adds to the surreal effect.  I have to say, this is a great shot.  I may not have interpreted this shot as you intended, but then I might :o)  Sometimes the guessing is as much fun as the challenge itself  This picture has had me looking at it for ages, so, it has made me think (10)', '2002-08-29 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110236, 4820, 2042, '<td valign="top">good lighting</td>', 'good lighting', '2002-08-30 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110237, 4820, 2857, '<td valign="top">The photographer''s son must be very smart and attractive.</td>', 'The photographer''s son must be very smart and attractive.', '2002-08-30 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110238, 4820, 3419, '<td valign="top">Good perspective - a child''s eye view. A little too dark on one side, and too light on the other. Good focus for the lighting conditions though.</td>', 'Good perspective - a child''s eye view. A little too dark on one side, and too light on the other. Good focus for the lighting conditions though.', '2002-08-30 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110239, 4820, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately depicts childhood.  I like the concept behind this, however the angle is a little odd.  I think I would like to have seen more of the cake and on top of the table.  You captured the candles very nicely, and the whole "birthday" theme is very clear.  I wish the lighting were constant throughout the photo.  It seems darker on the right than it is on the left.  Overall great idea.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Definately depicts childhood.  I like the concept behind this, however the angle is a little odd.  I think I would like to have seen more of the cake and on top of the table.  You captured the candles very nicely, and the whole "birthday" theme is very clear.  I wish the lighting were constant throughout the photo.  It seems darker on the right than it is on the left.  Overall great idea.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110240, 4820, 2279, '<td valign="top">I wish it was a little lighter in the room. 6.</td>', 'I wish it was a little lighter in the room. 6.', '2002-09-01 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110241, 4822, 92, '<td valign="top">I was hoping to see some emotion this week and you showed just that. = 9 Shiiizzzam</td>', 'I was hoping to see some emotion this week and you showed just that. = 9 Shiiizzzam', '2002-08-26 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110242, 4822, 2862, '<td valign="top">this is a very arresting shot, dark and painful meaning very effectively protrayed by the crack in the doorway, by the contrast. I like how the light plumes fade into the dark</td>', 'this is a very arresting shot, dark and painful meaning very effectively protrayed by the crack in the doorway, by the contrast. I like how the light plumes fade into the dark', '2002-08-26 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110243, 4822, 2668, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a sad concept of childhood.</td>', 'Wow, what a sad concept of childhood.', '2002-08-26 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110244, 4822, 1507, '<td valign="top">...... this is depressing voting for this week''s challenges, but let me tel you this, this one was original.</td>', '...... this is depressing voting for this week''s challenges, but let me tel you this, this one was original.', '2002-08-26 05:56:00.000000', NULL, 1);
