(110248, 4822, 117, '<td valign="top">I am getting the feeling like our parents treated us like shi? belts and closets my stepfather made me strip and he used a metal pancake turner on me so my ass would welt up</td>', 'I am getting the feeling like our parents treated us like shi? belts and closets my stepfather made me strip and he used a metal pancake turner on me so my ass would welt up', '2002-08-26 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
