(110284, 4822, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting twist to childhood.  Just goes to show that not all are the same.  The idea behind this photo is great.  I like how the light shines in and how it''s lit like that, however t he color is odd to me.  It looks liek it''s been really post edited.  I could be wrong.  Maybe it was taken with night vision.  I''m not sure what those photos look like, so who am I to say?  nice photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting twist to childhood.  Just goes to show that not all are the same.  The idea behind this photo is great.  I like how the light shines in and how it''s lit like that, however t he color is odd to me.  It looks liek it''s been really post edited.  I could be wrong.  Maybe it was taken with night vision.  I''m not sure what those photos look like, so who am I to say?  nice photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
