(110305, 4823, 2928, '<td valign="top">Oh, wicked shot.  I love it It has everything this one; its a superb angle giving the shot a really good sense of scale, lighting is spot on and  most importantly  you have paid great attention to detail, right down to the puddle.  The way the background slopes away gives the scene the final cutting edge.  It was well worth the effort of going on location  it really makes the difference Great shot, good luck (10)</td>', 'Oh, wicked shot.  I love it It has everything this one; its a superb angle giving the shot a really good sense of scale, lighting is spot on and  most importantly  you have paid great attention to detail, right down to the puddle.  The way the background slopes away gives the scene the final cutting edge.  It was well worth the effort of going on location  it really makes the difference Great shot, good luck (10)', '2002-09-01 04:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
