(110314, 4825, 2204, '<td valign="top">A puppet, how clever.  Something I never did quite understand as a child and not as an adult either....except for pinocchio.  Good photo with two small exceptions....The small white dot in the background on the lower left and the lighting shine on Mrs. Myrtle''s face.  =8 syamjonimi ;''-D</td>', 'A puppet, how clever.  Something I never did quite understand as a child and not as an adult either....except for pinocchio.  Good photo with two small exceptions....The small white dot in the background on the lower left and the lighting shine on Mrs. Myrtle''s face.  =8 syamjonimi ;''-D', '2002-08-28 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110315, 4825, 3080, '<td valign="top">She is very beautiful.  I love the colors in her dress.  Is that a bunny in her basket?  I like how she is set off to the right like that and the background brings her out of the picture perfectly.  There is a white spot in the bottom left corner that looks like a blemish.  Lighting is great and the angle is also very good. Great job portraying childhood. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'She is very beautiful.  I love the colors in her dress.  Is that a bunny in her basket?  I like how she is set off to the right like that and the background brings her out of the picture perfectly.  There is a white spot in the bottom left corner that looks like a blemish.  Lighting is great and the angle is also very good. Great job portraying childhood. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-28 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
