(110381, 4827, 2223, '<td valign="top">i like the colors and the way it makes me feel like i''m going down..weeeeee!!</td>', 'i like the colors and the way it makes me feel like i''m going down..weeeeee!!', '2002-08-29 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110382, 4827, 3419, '<td valign="top">I would be too, at that steep angle!! Good composition, focus and color.</td>', 'I would be too, at that steep angle!! Good composition, focus and color.', '2002-08-30 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110383, 4827, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint and angle producing great abstract lines, shapes and colour.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Great viewpoint and angle producing great abstract lines, shapes and colour.7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110384, 4827, 640, '<td valign="top">This slide was not actually very tall or steep. I wanted to try to re-create (exagerate?) memories I had of an unusually tall slide which, as a child I was afraid to go down. Thanks for your great comments. Although my over all score wasn''t so great I feel I imparted the feeling I wanted to, and that''s what its all about!</td>', 'This slide was not actually very tall or steep. I wanted to try to re-create (exagerate?) memories I had of an unusually tall slide which, as a child I was afraid to go down. Thanks for your great comments. Although my over all score wasn''t so great I feel I imparted the feeling I wanted to, and that''s what its all about!', '2002-09-02 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(110385, 4828, 1360, '<td valign="top">Oh now that''s cute.   5 -lennier</td>', 'Oh now that''s cute.   5 -lennier', '2002-08-26 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110386, 4828, 3075, '<td valign="top">Wow, funny composition and very, very sharp and vibrant colors!<br/></td>', 'Wow, funny composition and very, very sharp and vibrant colors!', '2002-08-26 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110387, 4828, 2279, '<td valign="top">Is he one that escaped from the circus? The colors are so bright in this photo. Good job. 7.</td>', 'Is he one that escaped from the circus? The colors are so bright in this photo. Good job. 7.', '2002-08-27 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110388, 4828, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice Color, nice photo, too posed for my taste</td>', 'Nice Color, nice photo, too posed for my taste', '2002-08-27 06:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110389, 4828, 749, '<td valign="top">''n dechnegol da , namyn deimladau bachigyn fflatia. Chyfnewidiad i mewn bysgota ( atfydd chan a darostwng atalnoda yn disgwyl i fyny? ) ai yn cyfnewid ''r ddyfnder chan barc at canola hychwaneg acha ''r arwedda would chyfnertha liven i fyny ''r ergyd. 6<br/><br/>Technically good, but feels a little bit flat - a change in angle (perhaps from a lower point looking up?) or changing the DOF to focus more on the bear would help liven up the shot. 6.<br/>- Manic -</td>', '''n dechnegol da , namyn deimladau bachigyn fflatia. Chyfnewidiad i mewn bysgota ( atfydd chan a darostwng atalnoda yn disgwyl i fyny? ) ai yn cyfnewid ''r ddyfnder chan barc at canola hychwaneg acha ''r arwedda would chyfnertha liven i fyny ''r ergyd. 6Technically good, but feels a little bit flat - a change in angle (perhaps from a lower point looking up?) or changing the DOF to focus more on the bear would help liven up the shot. 6.- Manic -', '2002-08-28 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110390, 4828, 2909, '<td valign="top">cute, but m bear never rode my tricycle...................</td>', 'cute, but m bear never rode my tricycle...................', '2002-08-29 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110391, 4828, 2042, '<td valign="top">nice colours</td>', 'nice colours', '2002-08-30 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110392, 4828, 2798, '<td valign="top">Framing is very central. Colour and contrast are good - perhaps pushed a little too far. Good subject. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Framing is very central. Colour and contrast are good - perhaps pushed a little too far. Good subject. 7 - floyd', '2002-08-30 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110393, 4828, 3080, '<td valign="top">The angle and positioning in this photo are great.  I like how you have the bear riding on the bike, rather than just a photo of a bike, or a photo of a bear.    Great job of making him stay on the bike.  The lighting and color are excelent.  I would have removed the 2 dead leaves toward the bottom of the photo.  Not a huge deal, but better to look at.   very nice clarity.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The angle and positioning in this photo are great.  I like how you have the bear riding on the bike, rather than just a photo of a bike, or a photo of a bear.    Great job of making him stay on the bike.  The lighting and color are excelent.  I would have removed the 2 dead leaves toward the bottom of the photo.  Not a huge deal, but better to look at.   very nice clarity.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-30 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110394, 4828, 3087, '<td valign="top">Did you ever read books in the Teddy Eddy series? This is so reminiscent of the photos in the books that it really strikes me. My teddy eddy is not so new looking as the one in this photo though ;)<br/>Nice bright colours and clean background.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Did you ever read books in the Teddy Eddy series? This is so reminiscent of the photos in the books that it really strikes me. My teddy eddy is not so new looking as the one in this photo though ;)Nice bright colours and clean background.7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110395, 4828, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 3,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?10,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 3,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110396, 4829, 3313, '<td valign="top">Very clever. One feels totally dwarfed by the surroundings.</td>', 'Very clever. One feels totally dwarfed by the surroundings.', '2002-08-26 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110397, 4829, 3540, '<td valign="top">Better than most.  good comp &amp; color<br/></td>', 'Better than most.  good comp & color', '2002-08-26 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110398, 4829, 327, '<td valign="top">Hee hee, well done. Everyone, everything is bigger. Great shot good perspective. Score 6 Justine.</td>', 'Hee hee, well done. Everyone, everything is bigger. Great shot good perspective. Score 6 Justine.', '2002-08-26 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110399, 4829, 2279, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of this picture and the colors are really neat too. 7.</td>', 'I like the angle of this picture and the colors are really neat too. 7.', '2002-08-26 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110400, 4829, 3208, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I think the photo may have be more effective with a personinstead of a building, but a good attempt at something other than a teddy-bear or swing shot!</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I think the photo may have be more effective with a personinstead of a building, but a good attempt at something other than a teddy-bear or swing shot!', '2002-08-27 06:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110401, 4829, 1005, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you were going after, but don''t you think you got down a little too low?  (seems like crawing height...)  I would suggest cropping above the chicken wire fence, too.  7 Swash</td>', 'I think I see what you were going after, but don''t you think you got down a little too low?  (seems like crawing height...)  I would suggest cropping above the chicken wire fence, too.  7 Swash', '2002-08-27 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110402, 4829, 3102, '<td valign="top">That would have to be one heck of a short kid...!</td>', 'That would have to be one heck of a short kid...!', '2002-08-27 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110403, 4829, 2752, '<td valign="top">good composition..I like the play of lines,softness of the plants and the metal of the fenc.</td>', 'good composition..I like the play of lines,softness of the plants and the metal of the fenc.', '2002-08-28 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110404, 4829, 2586, '<td valign="top">Good image; interesting angle. Nice composition with the fence, flowers and house. Nice colors. This image only speaks of childhood because of the title but what the heck. 8 Journey</td>', 'Good image; interesting angle. Nice composition with the fence, flowers and house. Nice colors. This image only speaks of childhood because of the title but what the heck. 8 Journey', '2002-08-29 04:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110405, 4829, 2798, '<td valign="top">Only one tiny criticism - that dead looking leaf on the left. Other than that I love it. Great light and angle. Colours are good too. A polarising filter might have given you a slightly bluer sky (perhaps not given that you''re pointing almost straight up). Excellent work - love it. 9 - floyd</td>', 'Only one tiny criticism - that dead looking leaf on the left. Other than that I love it. Great light and angle. Colours are good too. A polarising filter might have given you a slightly bluer sky (perhaps not given that you''re pointing almost straight up). Excellent work - love it. 9 - floyd', '2002-08-29 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110406, 4829, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the different elements, the repetitive patterns of the fence, the organic sunflowers and the blocky modern form of the building. Great viewpoint.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'I like the different elements, the repetitive patterns of the fence, the organic sunflowers and the blocky modern form of the building. Great viewpoint.7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110407, 4829, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, without the title, I would not automatically think "childhood" when I saw this.  However, I do understand the reference and am considering this to have "met the challenge".  The angle is great for the purpose.  Definately has the "through a childs eyes" look to it.  The lighting is great and the sky is perfect.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I have to admit, without the title, I would not automatically think "childhood" when I saw this.  However, I do understand the reference and am considering this to have "met the challenge".  The angle is great for the purpose.  Definately has the "through a childs eyes" look to it.  The lighting is great and the sky is perfect.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-31 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110408, 4829, 3111, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture.... I would have pruned the dead leaf out first and taken out the plant stake.  Were we ever that short?</td>', 'Wonderful picture.... I would have pruned the dead leaf out first and taken out the plant stake.  Were we ever that short?', '2002-09-01 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110409, 4829, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 3,<br/>Total Averaged Rating4.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 3,Total Averaged Rating4.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110410, 4829, 3419, '<td valign="top">To all of those who took the time to add their comments to their voting scores, thank you very much. Considering that I took this shot without any planning, I think I did pretty well. I''m encouraged to continue posting my efforts.</td>', 'To all of those who took the time to add their comments to their voting scores, thank you very much. Considering that I took this shot without any planning, I think I did pretty well. I''m encouraged to continue posting my efforts.', '2002-09-02 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(110411, 4830, 2997, '<td valign="top">Playgrounds have sure changed since I was a kid.  Your title is almost believeable.<br/>You centered the shot nicely.  The horizon is just the slightest bit off level.</td>', 'Playgrounds have sure changed since I was a kid.  Your title is almost believeable.You centered the shot nicely.  The horizon is just the slightest bit off level.', '2002-08-27 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110412, 4830, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the viewpoint, shapes and colours.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Love the viewpoint, shapes and colours.5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110413, 4830, 2437, '<td valign="top">bright colors is good</td>', 'bright colors is good', '2002-08-28 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110414, 4830, 3080, '<td valign="top">This might have had more visual impact if you had taken one small step to the left.  That would have centered the large center pole directly in the middle of the stairs. This is a really neat piece of playground equipment.  Lots of different activities. The colors are nice and the lighting was great for this shot.  I would play around with trying to center everything in the frame.  It''s only off a slight bit, but enough to make me feel crooked.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This might have had more visual impact if you had taken one small step to the left.  That would have centered the large center pole directly in the middle of the stairs. This is a really neat piece of playground equipment.  Lots of different activities. The colors are nice and the lighting was great for this shot.  I would play around with trying to center everything in the frame.  It''s only off a slight bit, but enough to make me feel crooked.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-28 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110415, 4830, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-29 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110416, 4830, 3495, '<td valign="top">Image appears very bright.</td>', 'Image appears very bright.', '2002-08-29 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110417, 4830, 806, '<td valign="top">LOL! Very funny! Can''t wait to see who''s this is. Perspective and exposure, good. Childhood idea, good.</td>', 'LOL! Very funny! Can''t wait to see who''s this is. Perspective and exposure, good. Childhood idea, good.', '2002-09-01 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110418, 4830, 2279, '<td valign="top">Wow how cool, the whole thing is covered. Always nice and shady on that one. Nice shot. 6.</td>', 'Wow how cool, the whole thing is covered. Always nice and shady on that one. Nice shot. 6.', '2002-09-01 20:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110419, 4831, 2997, '<td valign="top">Love the idea.  The focus ended up distracting away from your main subject.</td>', 'Love the idea.  The focus ended up distracting away from your main subject.', '2002-08-26 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110420, 4831, 327, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Score 7 Kee</td>', 'Good photo. Score 7 Kee', '2002-08-26 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110421, 4831, 881, '<td valign="top">My only remark concerning this otherwise excellent photo is that I think the whole "buggy" should have been in focus.</td>', 'My only remark concerning this otherwise excellent photo is that I think the whole "buggy" should have been in focus.', '2002-08-26 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110422, 4831, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is quite a lego collection.  Very nice color in the photo.  I lke how the buggy is in the foreground and it fades to the back with softer focus.  Lighting and angle are great.   I love how the logos fill the whole frame.  Great way to make a "pile" of toys look really great.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is quite a lego collection.  Very nice color in the photo.  I lke how the buggy is in the foreground and it fades to the back with softer focus.  Lighting and angle are great.   I love how the logos fill the whole frame.  Great way to make a "pile" of toys look really great.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110423, 4831, 3323, '<td valign="top">I want fewer blue legos surrounding the vehicle.</td>', 'I want fewer blue legos surrounding the vehicle.', '2002-08-26 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110424, 4831, 3102, '<td valign="top">When I was a kid, there were, like, two different Lego pieces.  A red piece with four little pegs, and a red piece with six little pegs on it.  Oh, and a little two-peg window, too.  Ah, how times have changed!  Nice shot.</td>', 'When I was a kid, there were, like, two different Lego pieces.  A red piece with four little pegs, and a red piece with six little pegs on it.  Oh, and a little two-peg window, too.  Ah, how times have changed!  Nice shot.', '2002-08-26 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110425, 4831, 3002, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2002-08-26 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110426, 4831, 2667, '<td valign="top">great idea. nice shot too. the only thing that bothers me is the propeller being out of focus. looks like you lost the depth of field right there! color and composition are good though.  (7)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'great idea. nice shot too. the only thing that bothers me is the propeller being out of focus. looks like you lost the depth of field right there! color and composition are good though.  (7)  ~mcmurma', '2002-08-27 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110427, 4831, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cluttered.  Short DOF does not include the whole buggy.  I wouldn''t mind the background out of focus, but I need the subject to be there (see the propeller?)<br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Cluttered.  Short DOF does not include the whole buggy.  I wouldn''t mind the background out of focus, but I need the subject to be there (see the propeller?)8 Swash', '2002-08-27 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110428, 4831, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?9,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?9,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-27 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110429, 4831, 3580, '<td valign="top">beutiful colors and depth of feild</td>', 'beutiful colors and depth of feild', '2002-08-28 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110430, 4831, 1826, '<td valign="top">That''s alot of legos!</td>', 'That''s alot of legos!', '2002-08-28 08:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110431, 4831, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good colour and like that the lego fills the frame. The main item is just a little low within the frame.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Good colour and like that the lego fills the frame. The main item is just a little low within the frame.6, Kavey', '2002-08-28 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110432, 4831, 2172, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, good cropping.  Ahh wish it was all in focus...Just Kidding!  good use of dof.  Good work!  7<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Very colorful, good cropping.  Ahh wish it was all in focus...Just Kidding!  good use of dof.  Good work!  7Ruthann', '2002-08-28 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110433, 4831, 806, '<td valign="top">Clear, crisp, vibrant. Good composition and DOF.</td>', 'Clear, crisp, vibrant. Good composition and DOF.', '2002-08-29 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110434, 4831, 3615, '<td valign="top">Dobar kolorit</td>', 'Dobar kolorit', '2002-08-29 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110435, 4831, 2261, '<td valign="top">You have filled this shot very well. The cropping is spot on. Nice bright sharp colours.</td>', 'You have filled this shot very well. The cropping is spot on. Nice bright sharp colours.', '2002-08-29 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110436, 4831, 368, '<td valign="top">great colors and DOF .. brings back lotsa memories! great job - 8 - ayme</td>', 'great colors and DOF .. brings back lotsa memories! great job - 8 - ayme', '2002-08-29 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110437, 4831, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a superb shot technically; the lighting and exposure are spot on and its great use of macro.  But, I think that the composition lacks something.  It seems to me like everything in the shot merges together taking the eye away from the central theme.  On the positive side, its an interesting and well thought out image  Good luck</td>', 'This is a superb shot technically; the lighting and exposure are spot on and its great use of macro.  But, I think that the composition lacks something.  It seems to me like everything in the shot merges together taking the eye away from the central theme.  On the positive side, its an interesting and well thought out image  Good luck', '2002-09-01 04:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110438, 4831, 2279, '<td valign="top">Lots of colors which I like but theres no where for me to rest my eyes on anything. 6.</td>', 'Lots of colors which I like but theres no where for me to rest my eyes on anything. 6.', '2002-09-01 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110439, 4834, 2279, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little too dark for me and maybe a little cropped off the top. But the idea and the rest is good. 6.</td>', 'The colors are a little too dark for me and maybe a little cropped off the top. But the idea and the rest is good. 6.', '2002-08-26 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110440, 4834, 327, '<td valign="top">WOnderful idea, nice shot. Score 6 Kee</td>', 'WOnderful idea, nice shot. Score 6 Kee', '2002-08-26 08:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110441, 4834, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good light and colors.  Definitely makes me think of my childhood. I find the dark upper part to be distracting, and think I would have left out the whole upper part, and concentrated more on the horse.  Overall, I think the photo really conveys the mood, and I can almost hear the music.  lhall</td>', 'Good light and colors.  Definitely makes me think of my childhood. I find the dark upper part to be distracting, and think I would have left out the whole upper part, and concentrated more on the horse.  Overall, I think the photo really conveys the mood, and I can almost hear the music.  lhall', '2002-08-26 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110442, 4834, 3313, '<td valign="top">Everything is there but the composition could (maybe not, I wasn''t there) be improved: it''s a bit too symetrical to my liking.</td>', 'Everything is there but the composition could (maybe not, I wasn''t there) be improved: it''s a bit too symetrical to my liking.', '2002-08-26 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110443, 4834, 3080, '<td valign="top">This photo scored high with me due to the great angle and beautiful framing.  The lighting is good, the "roof" is a bit dark, but most likely unavoidable.  Beautiful horses and great detail on the carousel.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This photo scored high with me due to the great angle and beautiful framing.  The lighting is good, the "roof" is a bit dark, but most likely unavoidable.  Beautiful horses and great detail on the carousel.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110444, 4834, 2223, '<td valign="top">i like this one!! im waiting for them to start moving! my fave so far.</td>', 'i like this one!! im waiting for them to start moving! my fave so far.', '2002-08-26 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1);
