(110449, 4834, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Was the merry-go-round moving?  I can''t tell.  A sense of motion would be nice.  The head and body appear very clear, but the feet seem like they are not.  9 Swash</td>', 'Nice shot!  Was the merry-go-round moving?  I can''t tell.  A sense of motion would be nice.  The head and body appear very clear, but the feet seem like they are not.  9 Swash', '2002-08-30 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110450, 4834, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well composed and good colours, though a little red. Would like to see a little movement represented - pan with foreground horse to keep him in focus and background moving? Tthough I''ve never been able to pan well myself and perhaps you thought of that and just didn''t want that image? So I''m just talking about my preferences in what I''d like to see.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Well composed and good colours, though a little red. Would like to see a little movement represented - pan with foreground horse to keep him in focus and background moving? Tthough I''ve never been able to pan well myself and perhaps you thought of that and just didn''t want that image? So I''m just talking about my preferences in what I''d like to see.7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
