(110473, 4835, 3178, '<td valign="top">I like the quality of the light on the cookies. I''m not sure you wanted quite as much contrast as you got between the part of the table above the cookies, and the part to the left. To me, I think you got about as much emotional milage out of a milk and cookies still life as you could get. 7.</td>', 'I like the quality of the light on the cookies. I''m not sure you wanted quite as much contrast as you got between the part of the table above the cookies, and the part to the left. To me, I think you got about as much emotional milage out of a milk and cookies still life as you could get. 7.', '2002-08-30 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110474, 4835, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great saturated colours - particularly like the red background. Cropping in close is what makes the composition really work fore me - it makes the curve of the plate and the shape of the glass more abstract too. I bet you didn''t even save any cookies to share with us did you? No? Of course not... sheesh, the selfishness of you photographer people just knows no bounds! Mutter mutter!<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Great saturated colours - particularly like the red background. Cropping in close is what makes the composition really work fore me - it makes the curve of the plate and the shape of the glass more abstract too. I bet you didn''t even save any cookies to share with us did you? No? Of course not... sheesh, the selfishness of you photographer people just knows no bounds! Mutter mutter!7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
