(110494, 4837, 3080, '<td valign="top">When I was a kid, I saved all these wrappers, saving up for the pendant, or the ball cap.  They were long since forgotten, and stored away in a box somewhere when I was cleaning my room.  A few months ago, I found them.  They are the original wrappers, and I had hundreds of them.  I''d return a pop bottle for deposite and be able to get 2 pieces a week.  Anyway...lol.  This definately reminds me of childhood.  The angle and focus are great.  Lighting is good, but the glare on the front couple pieces is a bit distracting. Otherwise, great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'When I was a kid, I saved all these wrappers, saving up for the pendant, or the ball cap.  They were long since forgotten, and stored away in a box somewhere when I was cleaning my room.  A few months ago, I found them.  They are the original wrappers, and I had hundreds of them.  I''d return a pop bottle for deposite and be able to get 2 pieces a week.  Anyway...lol.  This definately reminds me of childhood.  The angle and focus are great.  Lighting is good, but the glare on the front couple pieces is a bit distracting. Otherwise, great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
