(110521, 4838, 3554, '<td valign="top">Would give this a higher mark but I think it goes against the spirit of representing childhood without having a child in the picture.  Technically this isn''t a child (just a statue of one) but... Good composition though the title is overused.</td>', 'Would give this a higher mark but I think it goes against the spirit of representing childhood without having a child in the picture.  Technically this isn''t a child (just a statue of one) but... Good composition though the title is overused.', '2002-08-27 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110522, 4838, 3080, '<td valign="top">The frame and the angling are good.  I like the angle of the little boy, but the string in relation to the edge of the photo is crooked.  That''s just me being picky though.  This is a very nicely executed photo.  I loved fishing when I was little.  The lighting is beautiful for this.  You did a great job of keeping glare and reflection off the little boy.  Very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The frame and the angling are good.  I like the angle of the little boy, but the string in relation to the edge of the photo is crooked.  That''s just me being picky though.  This is a very nicely executed photo.  I loved fishing when I was little.  The lighting is beautiful for this.  You did a great job of keeping glare and reflection off the little boy.  Very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
