(110542, 4839, 2798, '<td valign="top">There''s something wrong with the light here but I''m having trouble with what it is. It seems well lit and dark all at the same time. Perhaps use auto-levels in your graphics package to see if that improves things. Anyway - it''s a good subject matter and I love the tablecloth. Really gives it an old feeling. - floyd</td>', 'There''s something wrong with the light here but I''m having trouble with what it is. It seems well lit and dark all at the same time. Perhaps use auto-levels in your graphics package to see if that improves things. Anyway - it''s a good subject matter and I love the tablecloth. Really gives it an old feeling. - floyd', '2002-08-30 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
