(110547, 4840, 3317, '<td valign="top">somebody told me it''s a good idea to have things around the edges of the photograph, partially cut off, something about leading the eyes towards the edge and out of the frame. i was always centering the subject, was told show just enough to give meaning, no more. so the swings and the hobby-horse thingies are a little cut in your picture, and that might be a good thing.</td>', 'somebody told me it''s a good idea to have things around the edges of the photograph, partially cut off, something about leading the eyes towards the edge and out of the frame. i was always centering the subject, was told show just enough to give meaning, no more. so the swings and the hobby-horse thingies are a little cut in your picture, and that might be a good thing.', '2002-08-26 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110548, 4840, 3075, '<td valign="top">Sharp picture. Nice repeating swings! Too bad the front swing isn''t in the picture all the way.</td>', 'Sharp picture. Nice repeating swings! Too bad the front swing isn''t in the picture all the way.', '2002-08-26 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
