(110552, 4840, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot :)  This photo, like many others I see, could possibly have a higher impact if taken from a lower angle... like from the viewpoint of a child.  Children see things from a different perspective than we do :) Making your photo from that same perspective could possibly create a higher impact in this challenge... good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting shot :)  This photo, like many others I see, could possibly have a higher impact if taken from a lower angle... like from the viewpoint of a child.  Children see things from a different perspective than we do :) Making your photo from that same perspective could possibly create a higher impact in this challenge... good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110553, 4840, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and nice angles to the frames. <br/>I find the partially included horset things, the blue material at the left and the fence at the back distracting to the image of the swings themselves.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Lovely colours and nice angles to the frames. I find the partially included horset things, the blue material at the left and the fence at the back distracting to the image of the swings themselves.5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
