(110584, 4844, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this one! The colours and shapes evoke childhood without being really blatant. I loved cutting and folding paper as a kid, so it really appeals to me. The composition is beautiful.</td>', 'I love this one! The colours and shapes evoke childhood without being really blatant. I loved cutting and folding paper as a kid, so it really appeals to me. The composition is beautiful.', '2002-09-01 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110585, 4844, 3080, '<td valign="top">Is this that shiny origami paper?  This is a really neat idea, however with the patterns on the paper dolls, I think the background might be a tad bit too busy.  I''m not sure how you set this up, but I think that either a non textured solid or multicolored background would have been less busy.  It''s interesting how the shadows of the dolls are on the background like that.  Great depiction of childhood.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Is this that shiny origami paper?  This is a really neat idea, however with the patterns on the paper dolls, I think the background might be a tad bit too busy.  I''m not sure how you set this up, but I think that either a non textured solid or multicolored background would have been less busy.  It''s interesting how the shadows of the dolls are on the background like that.  Great depiction of childhood.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110586, 4844, 2279, '<td valign="top">Looks like this was made in the 70s. I like the color contrast of this shot. 7.</td>', 'Looks like this was made in the 70s. I like the color contrast of this shot. 7.', '2002-09-01 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
