(110588, 4845, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a VERY nice photo.. I love the color choices and the composition is also excellent... this is DEFINITELY a keeper.  In the spirit of this particular challenge, I believe this photo fails.  It does not contain a whole child, but just part of a child.  I think this is borderline and I feel sure that you will receive other similar comments this week... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a VERY nice photo.. I love the color choices and the composition is also excellent... this is DEFINITELY a keeper.  In the spirit of this particular challenge, I believe this photo fails.  It does not contain a whole child, but just part of a child.  I think this is borderline and I feel sure that you will receive other similar comments this week... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110589, 4845, 2862, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, the overall color theme gives a contemplative mood to the whole thing, the sand on the foot ties in with the texture of the terrycloth towel,I''d like to see it just a little bit farther off from the subject, though.</td>', 'I like this picture, the overall color theme gives a contemplative mood to the whole thing, the sand on the foot ties in with the texture of the terrycloth towel,I''d like to see it just a little bit farther off from the subject, though.', '2002-08-26 03:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110590, 4845, 2586, '<td valign="top">It was my understanding that children shouldn''t appear in the submission.? This is a nice image though and I like the sepia toning. The emphasis seems to be though on the foot of the mother. If I wanted to be a stickler about it I would say this conveys motherhood more than childhood. 6 Journey</td>', 'It was my understanding that children shouldn''t appear in the submission.? This is a nice image though and I like the sepia toning. The emphasis seems to be though on the foot of the mother. If I wanted to be a stickler about it I would say this conveys motherhood more than childhood. 6 Journey', '2002-08-26 03:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110591, 4845, 1666, '<td valign="top">Great photo! But I am only giving a 1 because it does not meet the challenge IMO.</td>', 'Great photo! But I am only giving a 1 because it does not meet the challenge IMO.', '2002-08-26 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110592, 4845, 3390, '<td valign="top">...but there is a child in the photo</td>', '...but there is a child in the photo', '2002-08-26 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110593, 4845, 3313, '<td valign="top">Nice picture (good in sepia) but I feel that although it''s only a foot, and a small one :-), it is still showing a child in the picture.</td>', 'Nice picture (good in sepia) but I feel that although it''s only a foot, and a small one :-), it is still showing a child in the picture.', '2002-08-26 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110594, 4845, 3542, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but it does make me think childhood without children.</td>', 'Great picture, but it does make me think childhood without children.', '2002-08-26 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110595, 4845, 117, '<td valign="top">nice photo but what</td>', 'nice photo but what', '2002-08-26 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110596, 4845, 3102, '<td valign="top">I would have to argue that the picture does indeed include a child... maybe not a whole child... but a child...</td>', 'I would have to argue that the picture does indeed include a child... maybe not a whole child... but a child...', '2002-08-26 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110597, 4845, 3002, '<td valign="top">Excuse me, but that IS a CHILD''S foot in the photo.  There are not supposed to be children in the photo.</td>', 'Excuse me, but that IS a CHILD''S foot in the photo.  There are not supposed to be children in the photo.', '2002-08-26 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110598, 4845, 1827, '<td valign="top">Although I really like this photo, it''s a stretch of the challenge for me.  I know you''re probably fed up with hearing that, but there it is again.  Sorry.  I like the sepia decision.  I really like the sandiness on the feet.  I like the bright spot on the top of the adult foot and I like the texture in the towel.  The child''s foot doesn''t even really bother me, although I think technically, it shouldn''t be there in a tight challenge interpretation.  What bothers me is that I don''t see childhood in the photo.  Still, I''ll think on it, and may come back.  6 for now.  just-married</td>', 'Although I really like this photo, it''s a stretch of the challenge for me.  I know you''re probably fed up with hearing that, but there it is again.  Sorry.  I like the sepia decision.  I really like the sandiness on the feet.  I like the bright spot on the top of the adult foot and I like the texture in the towel.  The child''s foot doesn''t even really bother me, although I think technically, it shouldn''t be there in a tight challenge interpretation.  What bothers me is that I don''t see childhood in the photo.  Still, I''ll think on it, and may come back.  6 for now.  just-married', '2002-08-26 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110599, 4845, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat photo but I have to take points off for a child in the photo. Good job though otherwise. 5.</td>', 'This is a really neat photo but I have to take points off for a child in the photo. Good job though otherwise. 5.', '2002-08-27 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110600, 4845, 3208, '<td valign="top">Well, I am not sure if a child''s foot is within the rules but I guess I don''t care too much!  I like the sepia tone of this photo and it brings out the sun and sand well (in my view).  Well done.</td>', 'Well, I am not sure if a child''s foot is within the rules but I guess I don''t care too much!  I like the sepia tone of this photo and it brings out the sun and sand well (in my view).  Well done.', '2002-08-27 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110601, 4845, 3273, '<td valign="top">Surely that small foot belongs to a child?!  Nice photo though, good coloring and definition.</td>', 'Surely that small foot belongs to a child?!  Nice photo though, good coloring and definition.', '2002-08-27 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110602, 4845, 472, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT photo.  i thnk you werent supposed to have a child in the pic though.. since we were all thusly limited, so should you be. sorry.</td>', 'EXCELLENT photo.  i thnk you werent supposed to have a child in the pic though.. since we were all thusly limited, so should you be. sorry.', '2002-08-27 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110603, 4845, 2923, '<td valign="top">I thought no child in the photo is allowed?</td>', 'I thought no child in the photo is allowed?', '2002-08-27 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110604, 4845, 1054, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photograph, but I think fails to meet the spirit, if not the letter, of not including a child in the photograph.</td>', 'This is an excellent photograph, but I think fails to meet the spirit, if not the letter, of not including a child in the photograph.', '2002-08-27 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110605, 4845, 2858, '<td valign="top">Great composition, texture, balance, contrast. Excellent. Nitpick : it would be even more perfect if the toes in the foreground were in focus. But, top ten anyway.</td>', 'Great composition, texture, balance, contrast. Excellent. Nitpick : it would be even more perfect if the toes in the foreground were in focus. But, top ten anyway.', '2002-08-27 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110606, 4845, 3080, '<td valign="top">I am not clear on the rules of this challenge, it says no children in the photo, however you have a childs foot in the photo.  I am not sure if that inclueds parts of children or not.  I would THINK it also means no children body parts as well, but since it''s not really clear on that, who am I to judge?  So, setting that aside, I like this idea behind this photo.  I like the color and the angle.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I am not clear on the rules of this challenge, it says no children in the photo, however you have a childs foot in the photo.  I am not sure if that inclueds parts of children or not.  I would THINK it also means no children body parts as well, but since it''s not really clear on that, who am I to judge?  So, setting that aside, I like this idea behind this photo.  I like the color and the angle.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110607, 4845, 3087, '<td valign="top">For all that I love the detail of the sand on the big foot, I do have this fear of naked feet (I know I know) and I am finding it REALLY hard to look at those toe nails. I am persevering for short bursts at a time and writing this in Word to copy paste it into the comment box. :)<br/>The child''s foot seems a bit of an afterthought in terms of positioning and might be better without the towel/ trouser over the leg. I''d also prefer the background to be consistent on either side...<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'For all that I love the detail of the sand on the big foot, I do have this fear of naked feet (I know I know) and I am finding it REALLY hard to look at those toe nails. I am persevering for short bursts at a time and writing this in Word to copy paste it into the comment box. :)The child''s foot seems a bit of an afterthought in terms of positioning and might be better without the towel/ trouser over the leg. I''d also prefer the background to be consistent on either side...5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110608, 4845, 671, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but I think I see a child..............  8</td>', 'Great picture, but I think I see a child..............  8', '2002-08-27 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110609, 4845, 2199, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition -- I love the lighting, and the variety of textures here.</td>', 'Wonderful composition -- I love the lighting, and the variety of textures here.', '2002-08-27 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110610, 4845, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot. Hope you don''t get marked down for including a child''s foot *gasp*  :o)  Nice lighting and composition. Only complaint is that fuzzy toe since the rest of the shot is in such nice, crisp focus.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot. Hope you don''t get marked down for including a child''s foot *gasp*  :o)  Nice lighting and composition. Only complaint is that fuzzy toe since the rest of the shot is in such nice, crisp focus.', '2002-08-28 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110611, 4845, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but isn''t that a child in it?</td>', 'Very nice shot, but isn''t that a child in it?', '2002-08-28 04:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110612, 4845, 3018, '<td valign="top">This picture is nice and I like the colos, but you''re using kid''s feet and that''s breaking the rules of this challenge.</td>', 'This picture is nice and I like the colos, but you''re using kid''s feet and that''s breaking the rules of this challenge.', '2002-08-28 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110613, 4845, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, especially the sepia, however, I do not consider it to be within the spirit of the challenge -(without having a child in your picture). lhall</td>', 'I really like this photo, especially the sepia, however, I do not consider it to be within the spirit of the challenge -(without having a child in your picture). lhall', '2002-08-28 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110614, 4845, 2997, '<td valign="top">This shot and subject are wonderful.  I don''t quite see how it fits the challenge, but I could easily see this as a photo in a gallery of an accomplished professional.  I''d advise you have it enlarged and hang it prominently in your home.</td>', 'This shot and subject are wonderful.  I don''t quite see how it fits the challenge, but I could easily see this as a photo in a gallery of an accomplished professional.  I''d advise you have it enlarged and hang it prominently in your home.', '2002-08-29 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110615, 4845, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 2,<br/>Total Averaged Rating4.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 2,Total Averaged Rating4.   Autool', '2002-08-29 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110616, 4845, 1024, '<td valign="top">This image works very well in sepia.  Great childhood photo.  7  BAMartin</td>', 'This image works very well in sepia.  Great childhood photo.  7  BAMartin', '2002-08-29 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110617, 4845, 2123, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot but the challenge clearly stated "without children".  Sorry</td>', 'It''s a nice shot but the challenge clearly stated "without children".  Sorry', '2002-08-29 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110618, 4845, 2798, '<td valign="top">Uh - oh - part of a child here. Otherwise it''s a great photo. Why doesnt jr''s foot have sand on it too? Would have linked the two together. Love the sepia tone. Nice focus and interesting light. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Uh - oh - part of a child here. Otherwise it''s a great photo. Why doesnt jr''s foot have sand on it too? Would have linked the two together. Love the sepia tone. Nice focus and interesting light. 8 - floyd', '2002-08-30 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110619, 4845, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between a grown foot and a young foot, but wasn''t the challenge w/o children?  I''m probably being picky.  Parts of me thinks this is a sepia shot and parts think it''s really color, I guess I can''t tell.  This is an interesting shot and very well done, focus is great. Ouch on the cropped toes.  6 Swash</td>', 'I like the contrast between a grown foot and a young foot, but wasn''t the challenge w/o children?  I''m probably being picky.  Parts of me thinks this is a sepia shot and parts think it''s really color, I guess I can''t tell.  This is an interesting shot and very well done, focus is great. Ouch on the cropped toes.  6 Swash', '2002-08-30 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110620, 4845, 2261, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it meant to be FEET? Great photo in any case. The detail is superb and the composition is excellent.8-Martin</td>', 'Isn''t it meant to be FEET? Great photo in any case. The detail is superb and the composition is excellent.8-Martin', '2002-08-31 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110621, 4845, 640, '<td valign="top">Uh, oh, I see a child (his/her foot). Otherwise, nice concept.</td>', 'Uh, oh, I see a child (his/her foot). Otherwise, nice concept.', '2002-09-01 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110622, 4845, 806, '<td valign="top">Very emotive!</td>', 'Very emotive!', '2002-09-01 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110623, 4845, 2427, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I like the monochrome.</td>', 'Good idea.  I like the monochrome.', '2002-09-01 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110624, 4845, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful photo, but I''m not sure if it meets the "no children" part of the challenge. I still love it. The texturing of that sand on the toes is very well done! Sepia works very well here. I''m going to give it 10 anyway!! - lisae</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful photo, but I''m not sure if it meets the "no children" part of the challenge. I still love it. The texturing of that sand on the toes is very well done! Sepia works very well here. I''m going to give it 10 anyway!! - lisae', '2002-09-01 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110625, 4845, 3247, '<td valign="top">Child''s foot?<br/></td>', 'Child''s foot?', '2002-09-01 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110626, 4846, 2003, '<td valign="top">when did you sneak into my house?</td>', 'when did you sneak into my house?', '2002-08-26 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110627, 4846, 2279, '<td valign="top">This looks a lot like my room now. The flash is a little much in the mirror though. 5.</td>', 'This looks a lot like my room now. The flash is a little much in the mirror though. 5.', '2002-08-26 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110628, 4846, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hey, how did you get into my room!!!<br/>Definitely conveys childhood but as a photograph isn''t visually attractive to me. <br/>Kavey</td>', 'Hey, how did you get into my room!!!Definitely conveys childhood but as a photograph isn''t visually attractive to me. Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110629, 4846, 327, '<td valign="top">lol Heard that, said that!! LOL Very nice. Score 7 Kee</td>', 'lol Heard that, said that!! LOL Very nice. Score 7 Kee', '2002-08-26 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110630, 4846, 1005, '<td valign="top">I get more of a sense of a messy grown up, but I will take this at face value.  No, it needs more "kiddy" stuff.  It sure is a mess.  7 Swash</td>', 'I get more of a sense of a messy grown up, but I will take this at face value.  No, it needs more "kiddy" stuff.  It sure is a mess.  7 Swash', '2002-08-26 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110631, 4846, 3426, '<td valign="top">Some will say this is more ''teenager'' that little kid, but it''s all childhood, and frankly, looks just like my room always did.  Good capture.</td>', 'Some will say this is more ''teenager'' that little kid, but it''s all childhood, and frankly, looks just like my room always did.  Good capture.', '2002-08-26 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110632, 4846, 2223, '<td valign="top">OMG! looks like my old room!</td>', 'OMG! looks like my old room!', '2002-08-26 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110633, 4846, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can sure relate to that one... come to think of it, that''s one thing I never really grew out of :)  My only criticism would be that this doesn''t necessarily speak to "childhood" since the items in the photo could easily depict slobs of any age, with the exception of the Harry Potter thing on the TV, which is pretty hard to make out...</td>', 'I can sure relate to that one... come to think of it, that''s one thing I never really grew out of :)  My only criticism would be that this doesn''t necessarily speak to "childhood" since the items in the photo could easily depict slobs of any age, with the exception of the Harry Potter thing on the TV, which is pretty hard to make out...', '2002-08-26 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110634, 4846, 1827, '<td valign="top">The idea is good.  Certainly that makes me remember my adolescence, but the photo itself was not composed well I thought.  Unfortunately I don''t have many thoughts on improvements.  I''ll think and perhaps come back to it.  4, just-married</td>', 'The idea is good.  Certainly that makes me remember my adolescence, but the photo itself was not composed well I thought.  Unfortunately I don''t have many thoughts on improvements.  I''ll think and perhaps come back to it.  4, just-married', '2002-08-26 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110635, 4846, 3208, '<td valign="top">Is this a student dig?  Where are the toys?  Anyway, an interesting idea.</td>', 'Is this a student dig?  Where are the toys?  Anyway, an interesting idea.', '2002-08-27 04:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110636, 4846, 133, '<td valign="top">OH MY!</td>', 'OH MY!', '2002-08-27 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110637, 4846, 3554, '<td valign="top">Titling is tough but an important part of the piece.  A better title would have helped.  Perhaps "Finding the Floor"</td>', 'Titling is tough but an important part of the piece.  A better title would have helped.  Perhaps "Finding the Floor"', '2002-08-27 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110638, 4846, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?5,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?5,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-08-27 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110639, 4846, 1003, '<td valign="top">oooooh thats pretty bad.</td>', 'oooooh thats pretty bad.', '2002-08-27 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110640, 4846, 2752, '<td valign="top">looks familiar..maybe a little too cluttered for the space..great  idea though.</td>', 'looks familiar..maybe a little too cluttered for the space..great  idea though.', '2002-08-28 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110641, 4846, 1042, '<td valign="top">memories....sigh.....</td>', 'memories....sigh.....', '2002-08-28 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110642, 4846, 2172, '<td valign="top">Yep, that was me alright!  Perhaps a different angle and less flash reflection.  6<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Yep, that was me alright!  Perhaps a different angle and less flash reflection.  6Ruthann', '2002-08-28 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110643, 4846, 3313, '<td valign="top">What a mess ! It certainly does look like my son''s bedroom :-) The pity is that there is no way one can take a beautiful shot of a scene like this. Well done for conveying childhood though. =5</td>', 'What a mess ! It certainly does look like my son''s bedroom :-) The pity is that there is no way one can take a beautiful shot of a scene like this. Well done for conveying childhood though. =5', '2002-08-29 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110644, 4846, 1826, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh, I can just hear my mother yelling. :)</td>', 'This made me laugh, I can just hear my mother yelling. :)', '2002-08-29 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(110645, 4846, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your photo is a bit cluttered. LOL!  Sorry...had to be said.  And, with that said.  Great depiction of childhood.  Lighting angle and focus are great for this photo.  congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your photo is a bit cluttered. LOL!  Sorry...had to be said.  And, with that said.  Great depiction of childhood.  Lighting angle and focus are great for this photo.  congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110646, 4847, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice....love everything......just ........well ya cut his ears off. OVer all well done. Score 6 Kee</td>', 'Very nice....love everything......just ........well ya cut his ears off. OVer all well done. Score 6 Kee', '2002-08-26 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110647, 4847, 3313, '<td valign="top">Pity the ears and foot got cut off.</td>', 'Pity the ears and foot got cut off.', '2002-08-26 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110648, 4847, 3542, '<td valign="top">Love the title!</td>', 'Love the title!', '2002-08-26 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110649, 4847, 2158, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid your title really doesn''t go with the expression on the bunny''s face.</td>', 'I''m afraid your title really doesn''t go with the expression on the bunny''s face.', '2002-08-26 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110650, 4847, 2279, '<td valign="top">Wow that Bugs is really messed up. Really good job on the layout. 8.</td>', 'Wow that Bugs is really messed up. Really good job on the layout. 8.', '2002-08-27 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110651, 4847, 3102, '<td valign="top">Poor Bugs!  Great composition; my only criticism would be the slightly unnatural shadow around his neck.</td>', 'Poor Bugs!  Great composition; my only criticism would be the slightly unnatural shadow around his neck.', '2002-08-27 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110652, 4847, 2752, '<td valign="top">very clever and well shot</td>', 'very clever and well shot', '2002-08-28 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110653, 4847, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-29 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110654, 4847, 3495, '<td valign="top">How did you get the lighting so well washed out.</td>', 'How did you get the lighting so well washed out.', '2002-08-29 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110655, 4847, 554, '<td valign="top">I love this shot but wish the ears and foot were complete.  Still, I will use this for wallpaper from time to time.</td>', 'I love this shot but wish the ears and foot were complete.  Still, I will use this for wallpaper from time to time.', '2002-08-29 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110656, 4847, 3087, '<td valign="top">Sweet, nice and crisp with clean background - like the arrangement of the line, and the break in it.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Sweet, nice and crisp with clean background - like the arrangement of the line, and the break in it.7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110657, 4847, 3320, '<td valign="top">I do not like the picture in a sense that it does not ''appeal'' to me at all ... but at least it shows creativity, very good work with thee shadows/colors/reflection .... I like that you did not seem having autocolor or autocontrast too much. I do not like the picture but good work 6</td>', 'I do not like the picture in a sense that it does not ''appeal'' to me at all ... but at least it shows creativity, very good work with thee shadows/colors/reflection .... I like that you did not seem having autocolor or autocontrast too much. I do not like the picture but good work 6', '2002-09-01 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
