(110659, 4847, 3080, '<td valign="top">definately a traumatic experience for a child.  Great depiction of that.  I think I would like to have seen the ears and the foot more and not cut out of the photo.  I''m not sure if the red on the left hand of the rabbit is suposed to by symbolic of something, or if it''s just there.  Lighting and angle are good.  Nice different view of childhood.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'definately a traumatic experience for a child.  Great depiction of that.  I think I would like to have seen the ears and the foot more and not cut out of the photo.  I''m not sure if the red on the left hand of the rabbit is suposed to by symbolic of something, or if it''s just there.  Lighting and angle are good.  Nice different view of childhood.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
