(110687, 4848, 3102, '<td valign="top">This was actually my first idea, and I actually dug a rope (and a tire, for a tire swing) out of the garage, and trudged through the woods along a river to get a shot of it.  I just couldn''t get an angle I liked, and besides I was getting muddy!  You did a nice job of capturing what I was trying for.</td>', 'This was actually my first idea, and I actually dug a rope (and a tire, for a tire swing) out of the garage, and trudged through the woods along a river to get a shot of it.  I just couldn''t get an angle I liked, and besides I was getting muddy!  You did a nice job of capturing what I was trying for.', '2002-08-27 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
