(110696, 4848, 1856, '<td valign="top">This is great..maybe a tad too yellow.  I wish there were some clothes hanging on the bush to the right to indicate someone is there.  Lisa</td>', 'This is great..maybe a tad too yellow.  I wish there were some clothes hanging on the bush to the right to indicate someone is there.  Lisa', '2002-08-29 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110697, 4848, 2928, '<td valign="top">Superb This does it for me.  It really evokes fond memories  mostly of being cold and wet, but fond nonetheless :)  I can just imagine running full tilt and jumping for all I''m worth at that rope Ooops  forgot my age for a moment.  I can''t fault the shot, as I say, it works for me Thanks for the memory (10)</td>', 'Superb This does it for me.  It really evokes fond memories  mostly of being cold and wet, but fond nonetheless :)  I can just imagine running full tilt and jumping for all I''m worth at that rope Ooops  forgot my age for a moment.  I can''t fault the shot, as I say, it works for me Thanks for the memory (10)', '2002-08-29 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
