(110702, 4848, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot/memory.  I would have loved some motion in this shot, but then you''d have "children" in the shot and panned for that.  How about this:  take the shot just after a person "hit the water" type thing.  No people visible, motion and water effects!  (All godd stuff!!!)  Still this is very nice.  9 Swash</td>', 'Wonderful shot/memory.  I would have loved some motion in this shot, but then you''d have "children" in the shot and panned for that.  How about this:  take the shot just after a person "hit the water" type thing.  No people visible, motion and water effects!  (All godd stuff!!!)  Still this is very nice.  9 Swash', '2002-08-30 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110703, 4848, 1003, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2002-08-30 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110704, 4848, 772, '<td valign="top">There used to be a rope swing similar to this across the lake from my home when i was young..  When you would swing out over the water, you HAD to let go or you would come back and hit the tree :) Good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'There used to be a rope swing similar to this across the lake from my home when i was young..  When you would swing out over the water, you HAD to let go or you would come back and hit the tree :) Good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-31 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110705, 4848, 117, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the voting and comments. I was not pleased myself about the way the rope hung either. I debated and changed the photo and other photos of the same thing but came up with this version. When I would try and tilt the rope left a couple of degrees then crop I would lose pixels and the image was not as clear. Even in other photos that I took the rope hung the same way and I am going back just to where I took the picture for curiosity to see if the rope hangs that way. For as the sky being hazy it was humid and we were getting a lot of smoke from the Oregon fires.</td>', 'Thanks for the voting and comments. I was not pleased myself about the way the rope hung either. I debated and changed the photo and other photos of the same thing but came up with this version. When I would try and tilt the rope left a couple of degrees then crop I would lose pixels and the image was not as clear. Even in other photos that I took the rope hung the same way and I am going back just to where I took the picture for curiosity to see if the rope hangs that way. For as the sky being hazy it was humid and we were getting a lot of smoke from the Oregon fires.', '2002-09-02 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(110706, 4849, 3050, '<td valign="top">Came THIS close to commenting on the lack of focus.  Good job!</td>', 'Came THIS close to commenting on the lack of focus.  Good job!', '2002-08-26 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110707, 4849, 3402, '<td valign="top">good idea.</td>', 'good idea.', '2002-08-26 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110708, 4849, 2279, '<td valign="top">My favorite kind of photography is light streaks but this really doesn''t work for me.  5.</td>', 'My favorite kind of photography is light streaks but this really doesn''t work for me.  5.', '2002-08-26 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110709, 4849, 2586, '<td valign="top">What my eye sees above all are those white squiggly things and I have no idea what they are or what they are meant to convey. I like the low angle of this image to transport  the viewer into the world of thesmall child. Also suppose the image is so blurred to convey the feelings of confusion and anxiety of the child going to the doctor. Yet, the blurriness is overdone for my taste. Prelim: 6 Journey</td>', 'What my eye sees above all are those white squiggly things and I have no idea what they are or what they are meant to convey. I like the low angle of this image to transport  the viewer into the world of thesmall child. Also suppose the image is so blurred to convey the feelings of confusion and anxiety of the child going to the doctor. Yet, the blurriness is overdone for my taste. Prelim: 6 Journey', '2002-08-26 03:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110710, 4849, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, done well. Score 7 Kee</td>', 'Cute idea, done well. Score 7 Kee', '2002-08-26 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110711, 4849, 2199, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea -- hope people don''t beat you up too bad because of the blur/focus. Excellent work and will initially vote you high and take another look later in the week. Ok....reviewing all of my voting for the week and I still like your photo very much. I guess I can relate as I was almost blind until I got my glasses around the age of 11! One of my favorites for the week -- 10. LanSnake</td>', 'Very creative idea -- hope people don''t beat you up too bad because of the blur/focus. Excellent work and will initially vote you high and take another look later in the week. Ok....reviewing all of my voting for the week and I still like your photo very much. I guess I can relate as I was almost blind until I got my glasses around the age of 11! One of my favorites for the week -- 10. LanSnake', '2002-08-26 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110712, 4849, 82, '<td valign="top">Cute idea ... blurry "before" picture of the ophthalmologist.  A child would certainly see it from the low angle, too.  I do want a bit more color -- something else to capture the eye (no pun intended).</td>', 'Cute idea ... blurry "before" picture of the ophthalmologist.  A child would certainly see it from the low angle, too.  I do want a bit more color -- something else to capture the eye (no pun intended).', '2002-08-26 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
