(110744, 4851, 3080, '<td valign="top">To me, this photo brings back a memory of chasing butterflies.  I don''t know what it means to you, but it''s good enough for me.  The photo is very nicely done.  I like the angle this was taken at and the lighting was very good for the photo.  I didn''t know butterflies ate oranges.  I guess you learn something new every day.  It is unfortunate that the sign is inthe background.  That''s not your fault, just an observation.  Maybe this could be tried somewhere else, to see about getting a more natural background.  I realize that this may have been taken in a butterfly garden, so maybe these are non native butterfiles to where ever the photo was taken.  Anyway, very nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'To me, this photo brings back a memory of chasing butterflies.  I don''t know what it means to you, but it''s good enough for me.  The photo is very nicely done.  I like the angle this was taken at and the lighting was very good for the photo.  I didn''t know butterflies ate oranges.  I guess you learn something new every day.  It is unfortunate that the sign is inthe background.  That''s not your fault, just an observation.  Maybe this could be tried somewhere else, to see about getting a more natural background.  I realize that this may have been taken in a butterfly garden, so maybe these are non native butterfiles to where ever the photo was taken.  Anyway, very nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110745, 4851, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit dark, but nice composition and color. Score 6 Kee</td>', 'Looks a bit dark, but nice composition and color. Score 6 Kee', '2002-08-26 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110746, 4851, 811, '<td valign="top">if there had been some way to increase the contrast between the wings of the butterfly on the left and background, this would have been kickin''.  It is still a good picture though. karmat</td>', 'if there had been some way to increase the contrast between the wings of the butterfly on the left and background, this would have been kickin''.  It is still a good picture though. karmat', '2002-08-26 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
