(110800, 4853, 2337, '<td valign="top">Eeeek! A mouse!  :) Great shot...</td>', 'Eeeek! A mouse!  :) Great shot...', '2002-08-27 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110801, 4853, 2437, '<td valign="top">cropped too much</td>', 'cropped too much', '2002-08-28 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110802, 4853, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp.</td>', 'Nice and sharp.', '2002-08-29 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110803, 4853, 3080, '<td valign="top">very fuzzy mickey.  I like the angle on this "through a childs eyes"  lighting and placement are also great.  the sky is beautiful for the background.  great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'very fuzzy mickey.  I like the angle on this "through a childs eyes"  lighting and placement are also great.  the sky is beautiful for the background.  great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110804, 4854, 2279, '<td valign="top">I like the color difference between the b&amp;w ones and the bus, but the background is a little busy for me. 6.</td>', 'I like the color difference between the b&w ones and the bus, but the background is a little busy for me. 6.', '2002-08-26 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110805, 4854, 3111, '<td valign="top">Good composition, nice use of black and white to make the yellow stand out.  The 1:18''s stand out and make me wonder why they are there,....</td>', 'Good composition, nice use of black and white to make the yellow stand out.  The 1:18''s stand out and make me wonder why they are there,....', '2002-08-26 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110806, 4854, 82, '<td valign="top">The distortion in this image reminds me of being underwater.  I do like the relative gray of everything but the school bus -- a natural effect rather than a saturation adjustment -- but it''s a bit eerie.  No fault there, really, but it doesn''t invoke a sense of childhood for me.  Mine was bright.</td>', 'The distortion in this image reminds me of being underwater.  I do like the relative gray of everything but the school bus -- a natural effect rather than a saturation adjustment -- but it''s a bit eerie.  No fault there, really, but it doesn''t invoke a sense of childhood for me.  Mine was bright.', '2002-08-26 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110807, 4854, 2752, '<td valign="top">good DOF and I like the angle.</td>', 'good DOF and I like the angle.', '2002-08-26 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110808, 4854, 1644, '<td valign="top">Good job shooting through the glass. I like the slanted look, too.</td>', 'Good job shooting through the glass. I like the slanted look, too.', '2002-08-26 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110809, 4854, 2223, '<td valign="top">i dont understand the title, are these for sale and the kids are begging for it??</td>', 'i dont understand the title, are these for sale and the kids are begging for it??', '2002-08-26 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110810, 4854, 772, '<td valign="top">I was one of those kids that was dragged screaming from the toy store :)  I, too many times, got my ''reprimand'' right there in front of God and everyone :)  Good shot... - jmsetzler</td>', 'I was one of those kids that was dragged screaming from the toy store :)  I, too many times, got my ''reprimand'' right there in front of God and everyone :)  Good shot... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110811, 4854, 3087, '<td valign="top">I find the reflections in the window distracting (though they may be exactly the element the next person adores, so just my preference).<br/>Like the angle - feels like when you''re walking past a shop and trying to linger, being dragged along forward and getting that last longing glimpse over your shoulder.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I find the reflections in the window distracting (though they may be exactly the element the next person adores, so just my preference).Like the angle - feels like when you''re walking past a shop and trying to linger, being dragged along forward and getting that last longing glimpse over your shoulder.5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110812, 4854, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-08-27 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110813, 4854, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is at an odd angle.  I''m not saying it''s bad, or good.  I haven''t figured that out yet.  I am curious as to why you chose this angle.  Sometimes different is good.  Sometimes it makes you feel like you''re going to slide out of your chairl.  I think it''s ok for this photo.  The yellow of the bus stands out well with the greys/whites and blacks of the rest of the photo.  I wish there wasn''t glare and reflection on the boxes in the background, but probaby couldn''t be avoided, especially since this looks like it was taken through glass to begin with.  You definately caught the childhood in this photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is at an odd angle.  I''m not saying it''s bad, or good.  I haven''t figured that out yet.  I am curious as to why you chose this angle.  Sometimes different is good.  Sometimes it makes you feel like you''re going to slide out of your chairl.  I think it''s ok for this photo.  The yellow of the bus stands out well with the greys/whites and blacks of the rest of the photo.  I wish there wasn''t glare and reflection on the boxes in the background, but probaby couldn''t be avoided, especially since this looks like it was taken through glass to begin with.  You definately caught the childhood in this photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110814, 4854, 3627, '<td valign="top">Can I? Can I? Can I?</td>', 'Can I? Can I? Can I?', '2002-08-30 03:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110815, 4854, 3616, '<td valign="top">Okay I get it...</td>', 'Okay I get it...', '2002-08-30 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110816, 4855, 2923, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photograph but I don''t know what it has to do with childhood... maybe someone has spent a lot of time playing in the shed?????  :)  I guess i can see it, certainly NOT a depressing photo (the light and color wouldn''t mean he was LOCKED in it).  So i''ll give the originality as 7 and technical as 8, rounded up to an 8 points.</td>', 'It''s a good photograph but I don''t know what it has to do with childhood... maybe someone has spent a lot of time playing in the shed?????  :)  I guess i can see it, certainly NOT a depressing photo (the light and color wouldn''t mean he was LOCKED in it).  So i''ll give the originality as 7 and technical as 8, rounded up to an 8 points.', '2002-08-26 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110817, 4855, 82, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Iike the colors, both the black (dark green?) of the door itself, and the lighter colors reflected it in.  I love cracked paint and the feeling of "old," emphasized by the old-fashioned padlock.</td>', 'Great shot!  Iike the colors, both the black (dark green?) of the door itself, and the lighter colors reflected it in.  I love cracked paint and the feeling of "old," emphasized by the old-fashioned padlock.', '2002-08-26 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110818, 4855, 3448, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo! I don''t see the connection to "childhood" as clearly as some of the other submissions, but this one still gets high marks. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful photo! I don''t see the connection to "childhood" as clearly as some of the other submissions, but this one still gets high marks. 9.', '2002-08-26 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110819, 4855, 3313, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo ... but the link to childhood is not obvious to me.</td>', 'Very nice photo ... but the link to childhood is not obvious to me.', '2002-08-26 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110820, 4855, 3075, '<td valign="top">Mmm..looks like dad hid his dangerous stuff behind this door right ?<br/>Nice sharp picture, like the reflection on the door!<br/>Makes me curious what is behind that, well-locked, door. So it''s an intriguing picture.</td>', 'Mmm..looks like dad hid his dangerous stuff behind this door right ?Nice sharp picture, like the reflection on the door!Makes me curious what is behind that, well-locked, door. So it''s an intriguing picture.', '2002-08-26 19:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110821, 4855, 117, '<td valign="top">excellant shot and editing</td>', 'excellant shot and editing', '2002-08-26 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110822, 4855, 1644, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, the colors are very cool. I don''t really know what it has to do with childhood... but I like it anyway.</td>', 'I like the picture, the colors are very cool. I don''t really know what it has to do with childhood... but I like it anyway.', '2002-08-26 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110823, 4855, 2223, '<td valign="top">ok, this is a really nice picture with all the colors reflected on the door, but childhood?? i dont know.</td>', 'ok, this is a really nice picture with all the colors reflected on the door, but childhood?? i dont know.', '2002-08-26 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110824, 4855, 1827, '<td valign="top">Were you peeking into my childhood?  Definitely had some grand times in the forbidden shed and in the pear tree right above it where we ate unripe pears until sick to our stomachs and were inevitably found out by our body''s betrayal of our secret rendezvous.  Funny how parents seem to know everything.<br/><br/>I LOVE the reflection of the grass and sky on the door.  The texture on the door adds interest.  I only wish the focus on the lock was less soft.  There''s a tutorial on unsharpen mask that I learned a lot from that might help in this case, unless the softness was intentional.  8 for now, will review again.  just-married</td>', 'Were you peeking into my childhood?  Definitely had some grand times in the forbidden shed and in the pear tree right above it where we ate unripe pears until sick to our stomachs and were inevitably found out by our body''s betrayal of our secret rendezvous.  Funny how parents seem to know everything.I LOVE the reflection of the grass and sky on the door.  The texture on the door adds interest.  I only wish the focus on the lock was less soft.  There''s a tutorial on unsharpen mask that I learned a lot from that might help in this case, unless the softness was intentional.  8 for now, will review again.  just-married', '2002-08-26 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110825, 4855, 3102, '<td valign="top">Um... are the children locked inside?</td>', 'Um... are the children locked inside?', '2002-08-26 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110826, 4855, 3002, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this shot contains NOTHING that suggests the challenge theme.  Excellent shot of a DOOR though.</td>', 'Sorry, this shot contains NOTHING that suggests the challenge theme.  Excellent shot of a DOOR though.', '2002-08-26 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110827, 4855, 2586, '<td valign="top">I''m not altogether sure how this relates to childhood? Was this shed used for playing or was it used to lock up the kids when they behaved badly? I don''t know and it doesn''t really matter all that much to me. It''s a good image. The composition is all right; colors are beautiful. Prelim: 7 Journey Final score: 8  Journey</td>', 'I''m not altogether sure how this relates to childhood? Was this shed used for playing or was it used to lock up the kids when they behaved badly? I don''t know and it doesn''t really matter all that much to me. It''s a good image. The composition is all right; colors are beautiful. Prelim: 7 Journey Final score: 8  Journey', '2002-08-27 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110828, 4855, 2667, '<td valign="top">this is so cool. the reflections in the door are just awesome. the challenge connection seems a bit weak, but hey, i like the shot a lot. (revised 8/29. kept coming back to this one, my favorite this week. raising score to 10) (10)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'this is so cool. the reflections in the door are just awesome. the challenge connection seems a bit weak, but hey, i like the shot a lot. (revised 8/29. kept coming back to this one, my favorite this week. raising score to 10) (10)  ~mcmurma', '2002-08-27 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110829, 4855, 2279, '<td valign="top">Wow now that is a really neat picture. The colors of the reflection look really intense and the darkness on the rightside of the shed gives the picture a scary feeling but balances with the green. Good job. 9.</td>', 'Wow now that is a really neat picture. The colors of the reflection look really intense and the darkness on the rightside of the shed gives the picture a scary feeling but balances with the green. Good job. 9.', '2002-08-27 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110830, 4855, 3044, '<td valign="top">very nice. cool reflections. great colors. 8</td>', 'very nice. cool reflections. great colors. 8', '2002-08-27 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110831, 4855, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph.  The reflections are great and I really understand how it meets the challenge.  Good work.  BAMartin</td>', 'I love this photograph.  The reflections are great and I really understand how it meets the challenge.  Good work.  BAMartin', '2002-08-27 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110832, 4855, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo.  I love the way the green and blue reflections play off the black paint.  I''m glad this didn''t go black and white, even though it probably looks good that way too :)  Kids are fascinated with things and places that they don''t have access to.  This is an excellent representation of that as well... I wonder if you took any closeup photos of that old lock?  That lock carries quite a bit of intrigue for me on its own... great shot = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a very nice photo.  I love the way the green and blue reflections play off the black paint.  I''m glad this didn''t go black and white, even though it probably looks good that way too :)  Kids are fascinated with things and places that they don''t have access to.  This is an excellent representation of that as well... I wonder if you took any closeup photos of that old lock?  That lock carries quite a bit of intrigue for me on its own... great shot = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110833, 4855, 3580, '<td valign="top">beautiful i mean beautiful photo. doesnt invoke childhood, i have to subtract points</td>', 'beautiful i mean beautiful photo. doesnt invoke childhood, i have to subtract points', '2002-08-28 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110834, 4855, 2337, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic shot, but I had a hard time relating it to the challenge... I''m assuming that either it refers to a childhood locked in a shed, or a child''s curiousity as to what is in the shed... Great image none the less...</td>', 'This is a fantastic shot, but I had a hard time relating it to the challenge... I''m assuming that either it refers to a childhood locked in a shed, or a child''s curiousity as to what is in the shed... Great image none the less...', '2002-08-28 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110835, 4855, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great light!</td>', 'Great light!', '2002-08-28 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110836, 4855, 3540, '<td valign="top">Good shot, not so sure how topic-worthy it is.</td>', 'Good shot, not so sure how topic-worthy it is.', '2002-08-28 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110837, 4855, 2752, '<td valign="top">great shot and composition..is this the woodshed?</td>', 'great shot and composition..is this the woodshed?', '2002-08-28 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110838, 4855, 811, '<td valign="top">Powerful colors and message.  karmat</td>', 'Powerful colors and message.  karmat', '2002-08-28 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110839, 4855, 3035, '<td valign="top">i luv this pic - the color is beautiful and the hieght of the shot is perfect - low enough to make you think and realize it''s a child''s height but not overstated to blow you away with "you''re a kid stupid" what a thoughtful pic! 9</td>', 'i luv this pic - the color is beautiful and the hieght of the shot is perfect - low enough to make you think and realize it''s a child''s height but not overstated to blow you away with "you''re a kid stupid" what a thoughtful pic! 9', '2002-08-28 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110840, 4855, 2361, '<td valign="top">I can understand how SOME moinority of people would recognise this as part of a traumatic childhood, but as a photograph it does NOT tell that story in any way.  Therefore, I cannot see how this meets the challenge.  1 Jak</td>', 'I can understand how SOME moinority of people would recognise this as part of a traumatic childhood, but as a photograph it does NOT tell that story in any way.  Therefore, I cannot see how this meets the challenge.  1 Jak', '2002-08-29 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110841, 4855, 3251, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. THe color reflections work very well for me. This is one of my top picks this week.</td>', 'Very nice composition. THe color reflections work very well for me. This is one of my top picks this week.', '2002-08-29 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110842, 4855, 2204, '<td valign="top">i wasn''t aware the dreded shed door could look so deceivingly good.  Very well done.  =9 syamjonimi ;''-D</td>', 'i wasn''t aware the dreded shed door could look so deceivingly good.  Very well done.  =9 syamjonimi ;''-D', '2002-08-29 04:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110843, 4855, 2928, '<td valign="top">The lighting and compositional aspects of this shot are great and it has a foreboding atmosphere. It creates a great sense of evoked childlike curiosity  what''s locked in the shed? Is it a dead body? Or could it be a fierce rat?  Superb idea  if I''m on the ball of course  and well executed. (10)</td>', 'The lighting and compositional aspects of this shot are great and it has a foreboding atmosphere. It creates a great sense of evoked childlike curiosity  what''s locked in the shed? Is it a dead body? Or could it be a fierce rat?  Superb idea  if I''m on the ball of course  and well executed. (10)', '2002-08-29 07:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(110844, 4855, 1856, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo.  I love this!  The lines, sheen, reflection, composition are awesome.  Weak on the topic though....sorry.  8 Lisa</td>', 'Incredible photo.  I love this!  The lines, sheen, reflection, composition are awesome.  Weak on the topic though....sorry.  8 Lisa', '2002-08-29 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1);
