(110845, 4855, 2798, '<td valign="top">Like the reflections a lot. Not so sure about the framing. Nice light though. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Like the reflections a lot. Not so sure about the framing. Nice light though. 7 - floyd', '2002-08-29 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
