(110868, 4856, 3080, '<td valign="top">I almost did an easter egg hunt.  Glad I didn''t, yours is so much better than my idea.  I love the colors and the angle.  The background adds so much to this also.  Very pretty.  The upper left of the photo seems to have a hazy kind of look.  Otherwise, very nice photo. Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I almost did an easter egg hunt.  Glad I didn''t, yours is so much better than my idea.  I love the colors and the angle.  The background adds so much to this also.  Very pretty.  The upper left of the photo seems to have a hazy kind of look.  Otherwise, very nice photo. Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
