(110898, 4857, 3080, '<td valign="top">I can totally relate.  My 2 year old has close to 200 little hot wheels cars and They are EVERYWHERE.  I pulled 2 out of the dryer yesterday.  This is a great depiction of childhood.  I have the feeling someone is going to comment on how they are "unorganized" or how it''s "just a pile of cars".  I think you did it PERFECTLY.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  Childhood isn''t about organized lines of cars or toys, it''s about piles and messes.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I can totally relate.  My 2 year old has close to 200 little hot wheels cars and They are EVERYWHERE.  I pulled 2 out of the dryer yesterday.  This is a great depiction of childhood.  I have the feeling someone is going to comment on how they are "unorganized" or how it''s "just a pile of cars".  I think you did it PERFECTLY.  I wouldn''t change a thing.  Childhood isn''t about organized lines of cars or toys, it''s about piles and messes.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
