(110923, 4859, 3080, '<td valign="top">These look like they were frozen and when they were taken out of the freezer, they frosted up a bit and it''s hard to read the labels.  These definately remind me of childhood.  My son eats these like they are going out of style.  the angle and lighting are nice.  you did a good job of keeping reflection and glare off the pops.  You may have wanted to mix the colors up a bit.  I''d like to see another one of those blue ones seperating the 3 reds on the right.  The blue one almost seems to glow.  If you haven''t seen it already, you might want to check out guybrowme''s "Cool, fruity, fun" photo in the Advertisement challenge.  Kind of similar to this one.  I like them both.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'These look like they were frozen and when they were taken out of the freezer, they frosted up a bit and it''s hard to read the labels.  These definately remind me of childhood.  My son eats these like they are going out of style.  the angle and lighting are nice.  you did a good job of keeping reflection and glare off the pops.  You may have wanted to mix the colors up a bit.  I''d like to see another one of those blue ones seperating the 3 reds on the right.  The blue one almost seems to glow.  If you haven''t seen it already, you might want to check out guybrowme''s "Cool, fruity, fun" photo in the Advertisement challenge.  Kind of similar to this one.  I like them both.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
