(110994, 4864, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks delish.  I love how you can still see the milk on the cookie.  Great job of taking a photo through glass.  That can often be tricky, but looks like you''ve mastered it.  No reflection, no glare!  The clarity and angle are perfect.  This photo screams childhood.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks delish.  I love how you can still see the milk on the cookie.  Great job of taking a photo through glass.  That can often be tricky, but looks like you''ve mastered it.  No reflection, no glare!  The clarity and angle are perfect.  This photo screams childhood.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
