(111019, 4866, 133, '<td valign="top">This would have been appropriate for the subject were it not for your title, which makes me give it another conotation all together.  But it is a nice clear photo.</td>', 'This would have been appropriate for the subject were it not for your title, which makes me give it another conotation all together.  But it is a nice clear photo.', '2002-08-27 07:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111020, 4866, 3469, '<td valign="top">I can see the idea ''and then we went to the park where you had the swings''. Still the picture is lacking that something extra to make it a winner in my eye.</td>', 'I can see the idea ''and then we went to the park where you had the swings''. Still the picture is lacking that something extra to make it a winner in my eye.', '2002-08-27 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111021, 4866, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the title, the angle, the use of black and white.</td>', 'I like the title, the angle, the use of black and white.', '2002-08-27 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111022, 4866, 2204, '<td valign="top">One of the better swing pictures this challenge....</td>', 'One of the better swing pictures this challenge....', '2002-08-28 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111023, 4866, 1856, '<td valign="top">one of my favorite swing shots!  great compositon, textures, and use of b&amp;w.  the title isn''t quite fitting as the swings don''t exactly look thrilling at the moment :P 8 Lisa</td>', 'one of my favorite swing shots!  great compositon, textures, and use of b&w.  the title isn''t quite fitting as the swings don''t exactly look thrilling at the moment :P 8 Lisa', '2002-08-29 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111024, 4866, 3495, '<td valign="top">Loved the B&amp;W, repeating subject, very nostalgic and good link to the topic</td>', 'Loved the B&W, repeating subject, very nostalgic and good link to the topic', '2002-08-29 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111025, 4866, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a very nice shot, and definitely one of the better composed "swing" shots in the challenge. one of the things i''ve noticed missing from all of them is a sense of action. i know the challenge didn''t allow any children in the shots, but even if one of these swings was held out a bit on an angle to show that it was in use sometime recently, it might add a lot more feeling to the image. all of the swing images being so static almost seems like one of those kidnapping prevention posters or something. they seem so desolate and depressing. but technically, this was very well done, and i dig the use of black and white. good job (and sorry to single yours out for expressing my feelings about the swing shots, i just feel this one probably could have really benefited from some action.)</td>', 'this is a very nice shot, and definitely one of the better composed "swing" shots in the challenge. one of the things i''ve noticed missing from all of them is a sense of action. i know the challenge didn''t allow any children in the shots, but even if one of these swings was held out a bit on an angle to show that it was in use sometime recently, it might add a lot more feeling to the image. all of the swing images being so static almost seems like one of those kidnapping prevention posters or something. they seem so desolate and depressing. but technically, this was very well done, and i dig the use of black and white. good job (and sorry to single yours out for expressing my feelings about the swing shots, i just feel this one probably could have really benefited from some action.)', '2002-08-29 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111026, 4866, 2199, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, and use of black and white. By far, my favorite swing photograph this week -- excellent!  9 LanSnake</td>', 'Beautiful composition, and use of black and white. By far, my favorite swing photograph this week -- excellent!  9 LanSnake', '2002-08-29 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111027, 4866, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows in this.  I have to wonder why you went with black and white.  However, I like it.  Maybe I would like to see a comparrison of the color to the black and white, just to see, but I think it works well here.  You have a very nice angle on the swings.  I like the benches in the back.  Great job and good  luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the shadows in this.  I have to wonder why you went with black and white.  However, I like it.  Maybe I would like to see a comparrison of the color to the black and white, just to see, but I think it works well here.  You have a very nice angle on the swings.  I like the benches in the back.  Great job and good  luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111028, 4866, 2667, '<td valign="top">this is a nice composition and is one of my favorite swing pics. i like the black and white as well, but the groundcover looks a bit harsh.  (6)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'this is a nice composition and is one of my favorite swing pics. i like the black and white as well, but the groundcover looks a bit harsh.  (6)  ~mcmurma', '2002-08-30 03:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111029, 4866, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective - this works well in B/W - I imagine some of the items further in the background could be much more distracting in colour - in B/W they are unobtrusive.<br/>Nice strong light and shadows.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Nice perspective - this works well in B/W - I imagine some of the items further in the background could be much more distracting in colour - in B/W they are unobtrusive.Nice strong light and shadows.7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111030, 4866, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice angle/perspective. Good contrast.</td>', 'Nice angle/perspective. Good contrast.', '2002-09-01 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111031, 4866, 3111, '<td valign="top">Excellent Composition... Interesting that you made it B&amp;W... look at the similar shots in this challenge... maybe the contrast between mulch and swings would have been interesting?  Doesn''t affect my score that there are others like yours in the challenge....</td>', 'Excellent Composition... Interesting that you made it B&W... look at the similar shots in this challenge... maybe the contrast between mulch and swings would have been interesting?  Doesn''t affect my score that there are others like yours in the challenge....', '2002-09-01 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
