(111185, 4878, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  Great job of capturing a childhood moment.  Looking at this photo, which seems to be just a play area for kids, I was thinking that with the way childhood is today, I''m surprised we didnt get a photo or 2 of daycare.  The lighting for this photo is great and I love the angle.  The colors jump right out.  This isn''t your fault, but I think who ever runs this place should paint that ugly green pole to match the rest of the place. lol.  great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  Great job of capturing a childhood moment.  Looking at this photo, which seems to be just a play area for kids, I was thinking that with the way childhood is today, I''m surprised we didnt get a photo or 2 of daycare.  The lighting for this photo is great and I love the angle.  The colors jump right out.  This isn''t your fault, but I think who ever runs this place should paint that ugly green pole to match the rest of the place. lol.  great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-30 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
