(111226, 4881, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty interesting photo.  It''s neat how the lines are created in the reflections like that.  I''m not sure if this has anything to do with most childhoods, however, I am sure it means something to you, so that counts.  Color-wise, it''s not very exciting, but I''m sure it wouldn''t have the same effect if it were in color.  Frame placement is great and focus is good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a pretty interesting photo.  It''s neat how the lines are created in the reflections like that.  I''m not sure if this has anything to do with most childhoods, however, I am sure it means something to you, so that counts.  Color-wise, it''s not very exciting, but I''m sure it wouldn''t have the same effect if it were in color.  Frame placement is great and focus is good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-28 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111227, 4881, 3313, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflections ! ... Magic to an adult also :-)<br/>How did you get these lines ?<br/>=6 marcvg</td>', 'Very nice reflections ! ... Magic to an adult also :-)How did you get these lines ?=6 marcvg', '2002-08-29 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111228, 4881, 2361, '<td valign="top">It would be a little hard to figure the reference to the challenge here, even with the title''s assistance.  3 Jak</td>', 'It would be a little hard to figure the reference to the challenge here, even with the title''s assistance.  3 Jak', '2002-08-29 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111229, 4881, 1856, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  However, as an abstract, I think it might be more compelling if it were in color.  7 Lisa</td>', 'Great idea.  However, as an abstract, I think it might be more compelling if it were in color.  7 Lisa', '2002-08-29 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111230, 4881, 2456, '<td valign="top">and what exactly does that have to do with childhood...?</td>', 'and what exactly does that have to do with childhood...?', '2002-08-29 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111231, 4881, 3616, '<td valign="top">What?</td>', 'What?', '2002-08-30 05:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111232, 4881, 2798, '<td valign="top">This is great - Really interesting reflections and I like the B&amp;W here. 8 - floyd</td>', 'This is great - Really interesting reflections and I like the B&W here. 8 - floyd', '2002-08-30 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111233, 4881, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice compositon and interesting play of light reflections on the water. it makes for a nice black and white.  (6)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'nice compositon and interesting play of light reflections on the water. it makes for a nice black and white.  (6)  ~mcmurma', '2002-08-30 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111234, 4881, 2923, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  I think it portrays a child''s imagination and what he sees, ironically, this is the attributes that many amateur photographers don''t use as we get used to the mundane and only focused on objects.  I just wish the reflection is a bit better in this photograph. 8</td>', 'Good photo.  I think it portrays a child''s imagination and what he sees, ironically, this is the attributes that many amateur photographers don''t use as we get used to the mundane and only focused on objects.  I just wish the reflection is a bit better in this photograph. 8', '2002-08-30 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111235, 4881, 3419, '<td valign="top">A very interesting looking picture. If you are imaginative, you could see a man on a horse, or (gulp!) the boogey-man!</td>', 'A very interesting looking picture. If you are imaginative, you could see a man on a horse, or (gulp!) the boogey-man!', '2002-08-31 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111236, 4881, 3087, '<td valign="top">As a kid I spent hours looking for patterns in the clouds and in reflections. This is just so beautiful - there is a real abstract feel to it with the white and darker lines on the water surface - the b/w treatment emphasises the abstract feel of it.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'As a kid I spent hours looking for patterns in the clouds and in reflections. This is just so beautiful - there is a real abstract feel to it with the white and darker lines on the water surface - the b/w treatment emphasises the abstract feel of it.9, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111237, 4881, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?0,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?0,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-09-01 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111238, 4881, 3320, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I do not see where it relates to the challenge though. 7</td>', 'Nice picture. I do not see where it relates to the challenge though. 7', '2002-09-01 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111239, 4881, 3247, '<td valign="top">technically very good.  My childhood was in color.  no memories.</td>', 'technically very good.  My childhood was in color.  no memories.', '2002-09-01 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111240, 4883, 3402, '<td valign="top">interesting idea.  I think I would have liked it more had the hand been the only thing in focus.  Nice work though.</td>', 'interesting idea.  I think I would have liked it more had the hand been the only thing in focus.  Nice work though.', '2002-08-26 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111241, 4883, 2862, '<td valign="top">obviously the child''s view, what a great idea, really makes you think.</td>', 'obviously the child''s view, what a great idea, really makes you think.', '2002-08-26 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111242, 4883, 2586, '<td valign="top">Cool image. Well done. Love the angle of the figure; and how it rises high above the small child. Love the blurred hand. Image seems a little washed out though in places; wonder whether you could improve that in Photoshop. Prelim: 7 Journey<br/>Update: I do not like sentimental and cute pictures and in this challenge have had more than my fill of those. This picture, however, is so very "sympathetic" (can''t find a better word for it). Of all the pictures, this one symbolizes childhood most or what it OUGHT to be.: smiling, protective, secure.... I really love the blurred hand but am a little bothered by how large areas are washed out (duotoning in Photoshop could enhance this image a lot). Hence I can''t give more than an 8 for a final score. Journey</td>', 'Cool image. Well done. Love the angle of the figure; and how it rises high above the small child. Love the blurred hand. Image seems a little washed out though in places; wonder whether you could improve that in Photoshop. Prelim: 7 JourneyUpdate: I do not like sentimental and cute pictures and in this challenge have had more than my fill of those. This picture, however, is so very "sympathetic" (can''t find a better word for it). Of all the pictures, this one symbolizes childhood most or what it OUGHT to be.: smiling, protective, secure.... I really love the blurred hand but am a little bothered by how large areas are washed out (duotoning in Photoshop could enhance this image a lot). Hence I can''t give more than an 8 for a final score. Journey', '2002-08-26 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111243, 4883, 1507, '<td valign="top">DONT TRUST HIM! HE''S A KIDNAPPER!! (just kidding)</td>', 'DONT TRUST HIM! HE''S A KIDNAPPER!! (just kidding)', '2002-08-26 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111244, 4883, 2427, '<td valign="top">Good use of perspective.  Exposure a little overdone for me</td>', 'Good use of perspective.  Exposure a little overdone for me', '2002-08-26 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(111245, 4883, 2553, '<td valign="top">As an adult, this perspective is certainly different isn''t it ?  I like the b&amp;w treatment.  I don''t know that this photo would "stand alone" in conveying the "childhood" message, but within the context of the challenge, I like the photo. lhall</td>', 'As an adult, this perspective is certainly different isn''t it ?  I like the b&w treatment.  I don''t know that this photo would "stand alone" in conveying the "childhood" message, but within the context of the challenge, I like the photo. lhall', '2002-08-26 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111246, 4883, 3317, '<td valign="top">i''ve got a pal who volunteered to teach photography to little kids. he said the neatest thing was their perspective - photos taken from 2 or 3 feet off the ground. nice job catching that.</td>', 'i''ve got a pal who volunteered to teach photography to little kids. he said the neatest thing was their perspective - photos taken from 2 or 3 feet off the ground. nice job catching that.', '2002-08-26 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111247, 4883, 82, '<td valign="top">A tad overexposed on the shoulder and hand (it blows away the shape of this dad or uncle figure).  I like the tilted angle, though.</td>', 'A tad overexposed on the shoulder and hand (it blows away the shape of this dad or uncle figure).  I like the tilted angle, though.', '2002-08-26 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111248, 4883, 2798, '<td valign="top">Hey Kavey! This is a good concept and you''ve wrestled a great shot from that dodgy camera. Certainly it''s over exposed but that doesn''t distract too much (perhaps because it''s in B&amp;W). The focus is a little out on his face but that''s my only other criticism. I like the angle and the framing. Nice one. :)</td>', 'Hey Kavey! This is a good concept and you''ve wrestled a great shot from that dodgy camera. Certainly it''s over exposed but that doesn''t distract too much (perhaps because it''s in B&W). The focus is a little out on his face but that''s my only other criticism. I like the angle and the framing. Nice one. :)', '2002-08-26 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111249, 4883, 1827, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I definitely remember my dad''s hand as an early childhood memory.  Mostly for me, it''s his legs and hand extended, from behind, waiting for me to catch up and holding his hand out so I''d know it.  It seems you wanted the sky detail; the pose seems more menacing to me than helpful.  But then, perhaps that''s why kids get scared and shrink into mommy''s shoulder when someone else reaches out for them.<br/><br/>This photo seems way too light.  Perhaps it had to be that way not to get harsh shadows in what looks to be close-to-noon sunlight.  Still, you lose the shape in the sky.  5, just-married</td>', 'I like the concept.  I definitely remember my dad''s hand as an early childhood memory.  Mostly for me, it''s his legs and hand extended, from behind, waiting for me to catch up and holding his hand out so I''d know it.  It seems you wanted the sky detail; the pose seems more menacing to me than helpful.  But then, perhaps that''s why kids get scared and shrink into mommy''s shoulder when someone else reaches out for them.This photo seems way too light.  Perhaps it had to be that way not to get harsh shadows in what looks to be close-to-noon sunlight.  Still, you lose the shape in the sky.  5, just-married', '2002-08-26 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111250, 4883, 2923, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the lighting though is not what i would''ve chosen.. if you want to face the light like this and i think you''re trying to portray a nce and ''safe'' feeling, i would probably use a diffuser filter or perhaps a warming filter and cut down on th elighting a bit.<br/></td>', 'Nice composition, the lighting though is not what i would''ve chosen.. if you want to face the light like this and i think you''re trying to portray a nce and ''safe'' feeling, i would probably use a diffuser filter or perhaps a warming filter and cut down on th elighting a bit.', '2002-08-26 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111251, 4883, 133, '<td valign="top">Scary, well done.</td>', 'Scary, well done.', '2002-08-27 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111252, 4883, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent photo :)  I think this is a great black and white... the over exposure works nicely in this image... good shot! = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'excellent photo :)  I think this is a great black and white... the over exposure works nicely in this image... good shot! = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111253, 4883, 3554, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on what it is about this one I don''t like.  It does convey childhood to me but something isn''t quite right.  Maybe the contrast...not sure.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on what it is about this one I don''t like.  It does convey childhood to me but something isn''t quite right.  Maybe the contrast...not sure.', '2002-08-27 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111254, 4883, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you checked your fly before taking this shot. :)  I like it because it''s from a childs point of view.  I think it might have more visual impact though if it were in color.  As far as I know, kids don''t see in black and white.  The lighting is a bit harsh up towards your left shoulder it kind of gets washed away in the sky.  Overall great photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m glad you checked your fly before taking this shot. :)  I like it because it''s from a childs point of view.  I think it might have more visual impact though if it were in color.  As far as I know, kids don''t see in black and white.  The lighting is a bit harsh up towards your left shoulder it kind of gets washed away in the sky.  Overall great photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-28 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111255, 4883, 1826, '<td valign="top">Very different idea!</td>', 'Very different idea!', '2002-08-28 07:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111256, 4883, 3279, '<td valign="top">Picture ruined by a hideous model and poor camera. Recommend you buy a Minolta immediately :-)</td>', 'Picture ruined by a hideous model and poor camera. Recommend you buy a Minolta immediately :-)', '2002-08-28 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111257, 4883, 1748, '<td valign="top">nice angle but a bit washed out</td>', 'nice angle but a bit washed out', '2002-08-28 19:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111258, 4883, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great angle and sense of scale - B&amp;W works well.  Although intentional, I think it would have better had it not been overexposed.  The scale and B&amp;W elements would have carried this picture own it''s own.  Other than that I think the idea is great and composition works</td>', 'Great angle and sense of scale - B&W works well.  Although intentional, I think it would have better had it not been overexposed.  The scale and B&W elements would have carried this picture own it''s own.  Other than that I think the idea is great and composition works', '2002-08-29 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111259, 4883, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the surreal feeling that this image evokes.  Its lamost like a dream..... good job.  BAMartin</td>', 'I love the surreal feeling that this image evokes.  Its lamost like a dream..... good job.  BAMartin', '2002-08-29 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111260, 4883, 749, '<td valign="top">''n fawr arfer chan an i fyny bysgota , ''n sylweddol adds at ''r chyfansoddiad , a ''r ar - dadleniad chynorthwyon anrhega a yn clywed chan yn cael jyst creiniedig. 7<br/><br/>Great use of an upwards angle, really adds to the composition, and the over-exposure helps give that feeling of having just fallen down. 7<br/>- Manic -</td>', '''n fawr arfer chan an i fyny bysgota , ''n sylweddol adds at ''r chyfansoddiad , a ''r ar - dadleniad chynorthwyon anrhega a yn clywed chan yn cael jyst creiniedig. 7Great use of an upwards angle, really adds to the composition, and the over-exposure helps give that feeling of having just fallen down. 7- Manic -', '2002-08-29 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111261, 4883, 472, '<td valign="top">i like the washed out contrasty quality of this picture, and the looking up perspective.  i wish it wasnt quite so blurry tho</td>', 'i like the washed out contrasty quality of this picture, and the looking up perspective.  i wish it wasnt quite so blurry tho', '2002-08-29 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111262, 4883, 2158, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, but I find it a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Clever idea, but I find it a bit overexposed.', '2002-08-29 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111263, 4883, 1005, '<td valign="top">Seems pretty washed out.  Ex: can you see the back of your left  hand or your left shoulder? I like the concept.  Do you have dogs eyes?  6 Swash</td>', 'Seems pretty washed out.  Ex: can you see the back of your left  hand or your left shoulder? I like the concept.  Do you have dogs eyes?  6 Swash', '2002-08-30 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111264, 4883, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is really cool. I like the overexposed look, because it''s just like being dazzled by looking up towards the sun. It helps the sense of scale and perspective. The man''s face is kind and friendly. Very evocative. (There''s maybe a nasty undertone if you imagine he''s a big bad stranger rather than a kindly father or relative, but I''m mostly ignoring that!)</td>', 'This is really cool. I like the overexposed look, because it''s just like being dazzled by looking up towards the sun. It helps the sense of scale and perspective. The man''s face is kind and friendly. Very evocative. (There''s maybe a nasty undertone if you imagine he''s a big bad stranger rather than a kindly father or relative, but I''m mostly ignoring that!)', '2002-08-31 04:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111265, 4883, 1054, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent interpretation of the challenge.... I love the choice of framing, it suggests the view of a kid trying to clumb up on something or who stumbled.  the only technical issue I have is that some of the whites appear blown out and the man''s shoulder blends into the clouds.  If your camera supports this a shorter exposure time or narrower aperture would have corrected this, otherwise a levels adjustment in your image editing software.</td>', 'This is an excellent interpretation of the challenge.... I love the choice of framing, it suggests the view of a kid trying to clumb up on something or who stumbled.  the only technical issue I have is that some of the whites appear blown out and the man''s shoulder blends into the clouds.  If your camera supports this a shorter exposure time or narrower aperture would have corrected this, otherwise a levels adjustment in your image editing software.', '2002-08-31 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111266, 4883, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and framing of this.  I also like the bw.  The only thing, in my opinion, that is weak about the pic, is that it is a little too bright on his hand.  For some reason, this looks more like he is trying to grab you rather than help you.  Maybe if it was palm up it would look less "threatening" to me. karmat</td>', 'I like the composition and framing of this.  I also like the bw.  The only thing, in my opinion, that is weak about the pic, is that it is a little too bright on his hand.  For some reason, this looks more like he is trying to grab you rather than help you.  Maybe if it was palm up it would look less "threatening" to me. karmat', '2002-08-31 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111267, 4883, 2279, '<td valign="top">I like this...looks like it could be a little bit sharper. 7.</td>', 'I like this...looks like it could be a little bit sharper. 7.', '2002-08-31 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111268, 4883, 806, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. Nice angle and perspective. Hand and shirt wash into the sky - overexposed or over processed? Still like it. (8) Karen B</td>', 'Love the idea. Nice angle and perspective. Hand and shirt wash into the sky - overexposed or over processed? Still like it. (8) Karen B', '2002-09-01 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111269, 4883, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111270, 4884, 2586, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Would have liked it a lot more though if the carriage had not been totally parallel with the dresser behind. All the objects are stacked against the background and the foreground is empty. I''m sure the storeowner would have let you put that carriage at an interesting angle in the foreground. Journey</td>', 'Nice image. Would have liked it a lot more though if the carriage had not been totally parallel with the dresser behind. All the objects are stacked against the background and the foreground is empty. I''m sure the storeowner would have let you put that carriage at an interesting angle in the foreground. Journey', '2002-08-26 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111271, 4884, 2553, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen more of the buggy, and less of the other stuff. Love the b&amp;w, and the light/shadows. lhall</td>', 'I would like to have seen more of the buggy, and less of the other stuff. Love the b&w, and the light/shadows. lhall', '2002-08-26 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111272, 4884, 2881, '<td valign="top">I don''t like to see the name of the challenge in the title, but don''t know how you would have gotten the point across without it.</td>', 'I don''t like to see the name of the challenge in the title, but don''t know how you would have gotten the point across without it.', '2002-08-26 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111273, 4884, 82, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why, but I prefer objects that are the center of focus to be slightly off center.  This buggy is right in the middle, but I like your contrast and the variety of texture.</td>', 'I''m not sure why, but I prefer objects that are the center of focus to be slightly off center.  This buggy is right in the middle, but I like your contrast and the variety of texture.', '2002-08-26 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111274, 4884, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W shot.  Great contrasting elements.  I don''t know what to suggest to "improve" this photo, it''s very well done, but I''m not "moved" either.  Maybe it takes parenthood to fully appreciate this shot.  How about 8?  Swash</td>', 'Nice B&W shot.  Great contrasting elements.  I don''t know what to suggest to "improve" this photo, it''s very well done, but I''m not "moved" either.  Maybe it takes parenthood to fully appreciate this shot.  How about 8?  Swash', '2002-08-26 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111275, 4884, 3044, '<td valign="top">very nice shot. love the angles in this. i think you could have bumped up the contrast just a little though. great job. 9</td>', 'very nice shot. love the angles in this. i think you could have bumped up the contrast just a little though. great job. 9', '2002-08-27 11:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111276, 4884, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the pram and the floorboards very much.<br/>The cupboard behind it makes the shot feel top heavy. I would prefer if it wasn''t partly cropped out.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I like the pram and the floorboards very much.The cupboard behind it makes the shot feel top heavy. I would prefer if it wasn''t partly cropped out.5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111277, 4884, 811, '<td valign="top">bw really works well in this pic.  i also like the angle. karmat</td>', 'bw really works well in this pic.  i also like the angle. karmat', '2002-08-28 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111278, 4884, 3601, '<td valign="top">Good Idea<br/>I like this in B&amp;W</td>', 'Good IdeaI like this in B&W', '2002-08-28 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111279, 4884, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a really old baby buggy.  Very nice.  Says a lot about childhood.  I wonder what kind of people owned it.  Black and white works very well here.  The lighting and angle are great.  Very nice photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really old baby buggy.  Very nice.  Says a lot about childhood.  I wonder what kind of people owned it.  Black and white works very well here.  The lighting and angle are great.  Very nice photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-28 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111280, 4884, 2928, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting shot and I really like the use of B&amp;W to add atmosphere.</td>', 'It''s an interesting shot and I really like the use of B&W to add atmosphere.', '2002-08-29 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111281, 4884, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background10,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing10,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background10,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing10,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating9.   Autool', '2002-08-29 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111282, 4884, 640, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W works well here. How old are you, anyway? If this was yours.... Just joking. Love it. Good angle and sharp focus. Good work!</td>', 'B&W works well here. How old are you, anyway? If this was yours.... Just joking. Love it. Good angle and sharp focus. Good work!', '2002-09-01 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111283, 4884, 2279, '<td valign="top">Where are the brakes on that thing. That room and everything in it look really really old. 7.</td>', 'Where are the brakes on that thing. That room and everything in it look really really old. 7.', '2002-09-01 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111284, 4885, 3208, '<td valign="top">Perhaps some motion blur would have been nice - did you try it?</td>', 'Perhaps some motion blur would have been nice - did you try it?', '2002-08-26 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111285, 4885, 327, '<td valign="top">Just think of the hours spent there....! Many. Nice colors, good composition. Score 7. Kee</td>', 'Just think of the hours spent there....! Many. Nice colors, good composition. Score 7. Kee', '2002-08-26 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111286, 4885, 3127, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of the single swing moving.</td>', 'I like the idea of the single swing moving.', '2002-08-26 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111287, 4885, 3087, '<td valign="top">I do like the fact you have one of the swings in motion - definitely adds something. I think that the other swings are too obscured by the chains, perhaps a viewpoint just slightly to one side would improve this? I''d also prefer the tops of the A frames to show as they are almost in shot and such a strong shape that my eyes are lead up to where they would be - out of shot!<br/>Kavey</td>', 'I do like the fact you have one of the swings in motion - definitely adds something. I think that the other swings are too obscured by the chains, perhaps a viewpoint just slightly to one side would improve this? I''d also prefer the tops of the A frames to show as they are almost in shot and such a strong shape that my eyes are lead up to where they would be - out of shot!Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
