(111291, 4885, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like how there is one swing out in the photo.  It''s not just a photo of a bunch of swings.  I like the difference in colors as well.  There is some busy-ness in the background, but not your fault, if we could all choose our backgrounds, I''m sure we would.  Lighting, angle and focus are great.  I am wondering of you off centered it on purpose.  I think it would be nice either way.  Off centered, or off set. great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like how there is one swing out in the photo.  It''s not just a photo of a bunch of swings.  I like the difference in colors as well.  There is some busy-ness in the background, but not your fault, if we could all choose our backgrounds, I''m sure we would.  Lighting, angle and focus are great.  I am wondering of you off centered it on purpose.  I think it would be nice either way.  Off centered, or off set. great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
