(111304, 4886, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great angle on the castle.  Very nice job of keeping the moat and the castle in the photo.  I like the angle a lot.  The lighting is good, a little dark on the front of the castle and going down into the moat, but you can''t exactly control natural light real well.  Only way to have gotten light on the front of the castle would be to take the photo at a different time of the day, and i''m sure you weren''t going to sit there watching the sand castle until that happened.  lol.  Great depiction of childhood.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great angle on the castle.  Very nice job of keeping the moat and the castle in the photo.  I like the angle a lot.  The lighting is good, a little dark on the front of the castle and going down into the moat, but you can''t exactly control natural light real well.  Only way to have gotten light on the front of the castle would be to take the photo at a different time of the day, and i''m sure you weren''t going to sit there watching the sand castle until that happened.  lol.  Great depiction of childhood.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
