(111327, 4887, 3080, '<td valign="top">At first, this doesn''t scream childhood, however I do remember trying to catch flies in the house.  Later in the fall when it got cold and they got slow.  This is a good photo.  i am curious to find out what the white lines are near the flies butt toward the bottom left of the photo.  You can see it even through the flies wing.  I like the colors that show up on his wings.  Kind of metallic looking.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'At first, this doesn''t scream childhood, however I do remember trying to catch flies in the house.  Later in the fall when it got cold and they got slow.  This is a good photo.  i am curious to find out what the white lines are near the flies butt toward the bottom left of the photo.  You can see it even through the flies wing.  I like the colors that show up on his wings.  Kind of metallic looking.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
