(111348, 4889, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like a photo of a box.  Not real difficult.  I could be wrong.  I mean, you did a great job keeping glare out of the photo and I was also thinking that this COULD be a photo of an actual barbie with a transparency in front of it with the word barbie written on it.  that would be a little more creative.  I guess I"ll find out tonight.  Lighting is beautiful by the way and I love how it fills the frame.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like a photo of a box.  Not real difficult.  I could be wrong.  I mean, you did a great job keeping glare out of the photo and I was also thinking that this COULD be a photo of an actual barbie with a transparency in front of it with the word barbie written on it.  that would be a little more creative.  I guess I"ll find out tonight.  Lighting is beautiful by the way and I love how it fills the frame.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111349, 4890, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is a pleasant, subdued image yet it does not speak to me of childhood. Other than the knife, the objects I see displayed speak more to me of an older person. However, I may be dead wrong and besides I don''t take points off for not meeting the bloody challenge. I said the image is subdued and yet I would have liked to see some more contrast, perhaps in the shape and color of the sticks (or whatever they are), and the color of the background and most of the objects. It lacks that Ooompf element. My comment very much reflects my own taste. 6 Journey</td>', 'This is a pleasant, subdued image yet it does not speak to me of childhood. Other than the knife, the objects I see displayed speak more to me of an older person. However, I may be dead wrong and besides I don''t take points off for not meeting the bloody challenge. I said the image is subdued and yet I would have liked to see some more contrast, perhaps in the shape and color of the sticks (or whatever they are), and the color of the background and most of the objects. It lacks that Ooompf element. My comment very much reflects my own taste. 6 Journey', '2002-08-26 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
