(111510, 4902, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very enchanting photo. It definitely brings back my own memories of the magic of reading books at a young age. The composition could be tighter, maybe with a narrower depth of field to provide a sense of scale or depth as well, but the colours and lighting here are very well done.</td>', 'This is a very enchanting photo. It definitely brings back my own memories of the magic of reading books at a young age. The composition could be tighter, maybe with a narrower depth of field to provide a sense of scale or depth as well, but the colours and lighting here are very well done.', '2002-09-01 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111511, 4902, 3080, '<td valign="top">Cute...I love the setup.  Those look like REAL mushrooms.  How perfect.  The lighting and focus are really nice for this photo.  excelent creativity and planning.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute...I love the setup.  Those look like REAL mushrooms.  How perfect.  The lighting and focus are really nice for this photo.  excelent creativity and planning.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
