(111519, 4903, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like how the little bear looks like he''s in his jammies.  Great depiction of childhood.  The angle is good.  Was the light in the background contributing to the light source of the photo, or is it just there for looks?  If it''s not contributing to the light source then I might have turned it off for the photo because it makes an odd orange shadow around the little bears ear.  However, that doesn''t take away from the photo it''s self, it''s just an observation.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like how the little bear looks like he''s in his jammies.  Great depiction of childhood.  The angle is good.  Was the light in the background contributing to the light source of the photo, or is it just there for looks?  If it''s not contributing to the light source then I might have turned it off for the photo because it makes an odd orange shadow around the little bears ear.  However, that doesn''t take away from the photo it''s self, it''s just an observation.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111520, 4903, 2279, '<td valign="top">I dont like the way the lights match up in this. The soft yellow of the lamp and the bright white light of the flash. 6.</td>', 'I dont like the way the lights match up in this. The soft yellow of the lamp and the bright white light of the flash. 6.', '2002-09-01 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
