(111542, 4905, 2928, '<td valign="top">I love the shot.  The old horse looks to have been well loved by all the children it carries.  It has a careworn rather than falling apart look. The composition is great and I love the lighting and the texture.  It''s a great piece of work. (9)</td>', 'I love the shot.  The old horse looks to have been well loved by all the children it carries.  It has a careworn rather than falling apart look. The composition is great and I love the lighting and the texture.  It''s a great piece of work. (9)', '2002-08-27 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
