(111557, 4909, 3087, '<td valign="top">For me this is more about upcoming childhood than actual childhood - though perhaps if one has younger siblings there is the memory of mum''s belly, and touching it and waiting for the addition to the family to arrive?<br/>Is the high contrast and low depth of colour intentional?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'For me this is more about upcoming childhood than actual childhood - though perhaps if one has younger siblings there is the memory of mum''s belly, and touching it and waiting for the addition to the family to arrive?Is the high contrast and low depth of colour intentional?Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
