(111582, 4911, 2815, '<td valign="top">This is very clever.  I don''t know any children that don''t spill milk at least one a week.  The only thing I would have done differant is used a dark table top. it would have contrasted the white milk, adn bowl a little better.   Good Job  (8)</td>', 'This is very clever.  I don''t know any children that don''t spill milk at least one a week.  The only thing I would have done differant is used a dark table top. it would have contrasted the white milk, adn bowl a little better.   Good Job  (8)', '2002-08-26 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
