(111585, 4911, 3313, '<td valign="top">The problem for me (and it''s probably MY problem) is that I have to guess. The title helped me out, but then, it shouldn''t. Out of the challenge context and with no title I wouldn''t have had a clue as to what it was. That said, for me it''s technically better than what I could do.</td>', 'The problem for me (and it''s probably MY problem) is that I have to guess. The title helped me out, but then, it shouldn''t. Out of the challenge context and with no title I wouldn''t have had a clue as to what it was. That said, for me it''s technically better than what I could do.', '2002-08-26 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111586, 4911, 2752, '<td valign="top">very clever...good composition.</td>', 'very clever...good composition.', '2002-08-26 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
