(111588, 4911, 1644, '<td valign="top">I like it, but a colored bowl might have added a little something to it. A better contrast to the milk, like the cup is. I like the shadow in the cup, but not the one by the bowl as much. But that''s kind of picky. :)</td>', 'I like it, but a colored bowl might have added a little something to it. A better contrast to the milk, like the cup is. I like the shadow in the cup, but not the one by the bowl as much. But that''s kind of picky. :)', '2002-08-26 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
