(111591, 4911, 1827, '<td valign="top">An orange tablecloth and a glint of reflection in the milk would have made this dynamite.  The white tablecloth is too flat to make the milk stand out.  6-7, haven''t yet decided.</td>', 'An orange tablecloth and a glint of reflection in the milk would have made this dynamite.  The white tablecloth is too flat to make the milk stand out.  6-7, haven''t yet decided.', '2002-08-26 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
