(111649, 4913, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!  I can''t wait to find out where this photo was taken!  Great lighting and very nice set up.  You did a very fine job of not making the photo look cluttered.  I think I would like to have seen the photo tilted to the right a slight bit to correct the tilt, other than that...great shot!  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice!!  I can''t wait to find out where this photo was taken!  Great lighting and very nice set up.  You did a very fine job of not making the photo look cluttered.  I think I would like to have seen the photo tilted to the right a slight bit to correct the tilt, other than that...great shot!  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111650, 4916, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely executed photo... you have done a very good job with the lighting and the background... I''m under the impression that ''no children'' would include photos of children too...  This is a risky shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a nicely executed photo... you have done a very good job with the lighting and the background... I''m under the impression that ''no children'' would include photos of children too...  This is a risky shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 07:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
