(111652, 4916, 3469, '<td valign="top">This is still a picture of children (and, for the looks of it) a very recent picture as well. The little bear in the picture is really overdoing it. Apart from all this comment, the picture in the picture is well done. But that was not this weeks challenge.</td>', 'This is still a picture of children (and, for the looks of it) a very recent picture as well. The little bear in the picture is really overdoing it. Apart from all this comment, the picture in the picture is well done. But that was not this weeks challenge.', '2002-08-26 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
