(111654, 4916, 2279, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like an ad for something. I like it. 6.</td>', 'This almost looks like an ad for something. I like it. 6.', '2002-08-27 02:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111655, 4916, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I really don''t know what to say.  I don''t really see anything technically wrong with this, nor does it really "get" me.  At least it''s a pleasant childhood memory!  9 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo.  I really don''t know what to say.  I don''t really see anything technically wrong with this, nor does it really "get" me.  At least it''s a pleasant childhood memory!  9 Swash', '2002-08-27 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
