(111749, 4924, 2553, '<td valign="top">I almost had to laugh when I saw this shot.  It definitely speaks of childhood to ME !  But... only because I know what the challenge is.  On it''s own, this photo would not convey that message to me.  I do think that your perspective, and idea, are unique and creative.</td>', 'I almost had to laugh when I saw this shot.  It definitely speaks of childhood to ME !  But... only because I know what the challenge is.  On it''s own, this photo would not convey that message to me.  I do think that your perspective, and idea, are unique and creative.', '2002-08-26 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111750, 4924, 2752, '<td valign="top">My brothers could relate to this only my dad was a barber and the strap was more lethal...I think your composition could be improved by strecting the belt out more.</td>', 'My brothers could relate to this only my dad was a barber and the strap was more lethal...I think your composition could be improved by strecting the belt out more.', '2002-08-26 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111751, 4924, 1779, '<td valign="top">man... very interesting. kind of harsh, but true. i can relate...</td>', 'man... very interesting. kind of harsh, but true. i can relate...', '2002-08-26 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
