(111833, 4927, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good focus.  The dump truck''s back end seems a little "bright", but overall, a very nice shot.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very good focus.  The dump truck''s back end seems a little "bright", but overall, a very nice shot.  8 Swash', '2002-08-26 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
