(111853, 4928, 3075, '<td valign="top">There''s another picture of a swing, but my comment there was that the first swing wasn''t in shot completely, here it is! So like this picture better.<br/>Especially since the object is centered! Well done !</td>', 'There''s another picture of a swing, but my comment there was that the first swing wasn''t in shot completely, here it is! So like this picture better.Especially since the object is centered! Well done !', '2002-08-26 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
