(111863, 4928, 3111, '<td valign="top">Grainy shot - makes it interesting, makes the blue swings stand out from the rocks... Rocks in a playground=lawsuit waiting to happen...</td>', 'Grainy shot - makes it interesting, makes the blue swings stand out from the rocks... Rocks in a playground=lawsuit waiting to happen...', '2002-08-31 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111864, 4928, 2279, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t want to jump off those swings. Lots of small rocks to break my fall. Ouch. Good shot though. 6.</td>', 'I wouldn''t want to jump off those swings. Lots of small rocks to break my fall. Ouch. Good shot though. 6.', '2002-09-01 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111865, 4928, 1543, '<td valign="top">favorite childhood passtimeof mine.</td>', 'favorite childhood passtimeof mine.', '2002-09-01 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111866, 4928, 3080, '<td valign="top">very nice angle.  I like the patterns and the repetitiveness here.  the colors are very nice.  lighting was great for this photo. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'very nice angle.  I like the patterns and the repetitiveness here.  the colors are very nice.  lighting was great for this photo. good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111867, 4929, 2279, '<td valign="top">I like this except for the blurred truck on the left. I think its a little too distracting. 6.</td>', 'I like this except for the blurred truck on the left. I think its a little too distracting. 6.', '2002-08-26 03:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111868, 4929, 3208, '<td valign="top">Nice setup for photo, some toys somewhat out of focus but overall I really like this photo.</td>', 'Nice setup for photo, some toys somewhat out of focus but overall I really like this photo.', '2002-08-26 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111869, 4929, 1507, '<td valign="top">captures some of the things i used to love doing as a child. 8</td>', 'captures some of the things i used to love doing as a child. 8', '2002-08-26 05:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111870, 4929, 2881, '<td valign="top">I like this lots... the balance, the colors, the composition.  The only thing is... don''t use the name of the challenge in the title, no way, no part, no how! And the blurring of the red thing in the front left is kind of distracting.</td>', 'I like this lots... the balance, the colors, the composition.  The only thing is... don''t use the name of the challenge in the title, no way, no part, no how! And the blurring of the red thing in the front left is kind of distracting.', '2002-08-26 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111871, 4929, 82, '<td valign="top">The most striking thing about this picture is the vivid blue of the palm trees.  It wouldn''t suit the challenge, I think, but I''d like to see just those trees -- right as they are -- in the sand without the other items.  Just tan, blue, black.</td>', 'The most striking thing about this picture is the vivid blue of the palm trees.  It wouldn''t suit the challenge, I think, but I''d like to see just those trees -- right as they are -- in the sand without the other items.  Just tan, blue, black.', '2002-08-26 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111872, 4929, 3075, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, too bad the palmtrees are very much present due to the focus.<br/>Maybe if you put the dino in front of the palmtrees and foccused on the dinosaur this picture would be more interesting. Like the colors.</td>', 'Nice picture, too bad the palmtrees are very much present due to the focus.Maybe if you put the dino in front of the palmtrees and foccused on the dinosaur this picture would be more interesting. Like the colors.', '2002-08-26 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111873, 4929, 472, '<td valign="top">good diorama :)</td>', 'good diorama :)', '2002-08-27 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111874, 4929, 1024, '<td valign="top">The object that is out of focus in the front left bothers me a little bit.  Nice child like colors though, and no one can say you did not meet the challenge.</td>', 'The object that is out of focus in the front left bothers me a little bit.  Nice child like colors though, and no one can say you did not meet the challenge.', '2002-08-27 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111875, 4929, 2752, '<td valign="top">perspective is good,theme good,</td>', 'perspective is good,theme good,', '2002-08-28 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111876, 4929, 3601, '<td valign="top">Wow</td>', 'Wow', '2002-08-28 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111877, 4929, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love colours and dark "sky" against blue trees but don''t like low DOF in this photo, just too blurred a foreground for me.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Love colours and dark "sky" against blue trees but don''t like low DOF in this photo, just too blurred a foreground for me.6, Kavey', '2002-08-29 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111878, 4929, 1037, '<td valign="top">Initially I didn''t like this photo, but the more I look at it, the more it grabs me :). It''s taken down at the level a child would see as he/she is playing with the toys, which makes everything come alive in an imaginitive way. But also, I love the composition, with those blue trees, and the dinosaur head coming in from the side. The narrow depth of field gives the image a sense of scale and leads your eyes even more to the dinosaur. Nice photo :)</td>', 'Initially I didn''t like this photo, but the more I look at it, the more it grabs me :). It''s taken down at the level a child would see as he/she is playing with the toys, which makes everything come alive in an imaginitive way. But also, I love the composition, with those blue trees, and the dinosaur head coming in from the side. The narrow depth of field gives the image a sense of scale and leads your eyes even more to the dinosaur. Nice photo :)', '2002-08-30 05:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111879, 4929, 1909, '<td valign="top">interesting idea and good clarity.  how did you get the background SO black?</td>', 'interesting idea and good clarity.  how did you get the background SO black?', '2002-08-30 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111880, 4929, 2928, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...</td>', 'Nice shot...', '2002-08-31 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111881, 4929, 3080, '<td valign="top">The bottom of the photo looks like it''s got some color problem.  Like when you set a photo to have only a sertain amount of colors.  It looks like it was an upload problem though, because it is o nly in the bottom inch or so of the photo.  Strange.  Oh well, not your fault, so I can''t count that against you, or your pic.  I love the "play" in this photo.  My son also loves the photo cause of the dinosaur.  The lighting is great for this photo and I like how the background is black.  Great depiction of childhood. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The bottom of the photo looks like it''s got some color problem.  Like when you set a photo to have only a sertain amount of colors.  It looks like it was an upload problem though, because it is o nly in the bottom inch or so of the photo.  Strange.  Oh well, not your fault, so I can''t count that against you, or your pic.  I love the "play" in this photo.  My son also loves the photo cause of the dinosaur.  The lighting is great for this photo and I like how the background is black.  Great depiction of childhood. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-31 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
