(111884, 4931, 51167, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this one.  I was going to use lego guys too.  I like how you stuck the lego guys head in the car.</td>', 'I like the idea of this one.  I was going to use lego guys too.  I like how you stuck the lego guys head in the car.', '2002-08-26 02:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
