(111886, 4931, 1507, '<td valign="top">hahah i love it! 8</td>', 'hahah i love it! 8', '2002-08-26 05:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111887, 4931, 205, '<td valign="top">This is awesome.</td>', 'This is awesome.', '2002-08-26 06:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111888, 4931, 811, '<td valign="top">good motion blur!  karmat</td>', 'good motion blur!  karmat', '2002-08-26 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111889, 4931, 2881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and feeling of speed from the car, but not crazy about the background... also too much of it. Reposition for balance and crop more.</td>', 'I like the idea and feeling of speed from the car, but not crazy about the background... also too much of it. Reposition for balance and crop more.', '2002-08-26 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111890, 4931, 3075, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, really gives the car a "hi-speed" look.<br/></td>', 'Nice effect, really gives the car a "hi-speed" look.', '2002-08-26 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111891, 4931, 2752, '<td valign="top">great show of speed..poor knight..good composition.</td>', 'great show of speed..poor knight..good composition.', '2002-08-26 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111892, 4931, 3426, '<td valign="top">I like the "streaky" effect (yeah, I know it has a real name, but my head is hurting and it won''t come to me...)</td>', 'I like the "streaky" effect (yeah, I know it has a real name, but my head is hurting and it won''t come to me...)', '2002-08-26 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111893, 4931, 1644, '<td valign="top">Very cute. I think the background could have used something. The carpet is a little blah.</td>', 'Very cute. I think the background could have used something. The carpet is a little blah.', '2002-08-26 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111894, 4931, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like the movement in the car, but I''m not too sure about the combination of the two toys.</td>', 'I like the movement in the car, but I''m not too sure about the combination of the two toys.', '2002-08-26 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111895, 4931, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cool -- well thought out!  I would have liked a teeny bit more light on the horse and the jousting dude, but otherwise, this is a really slick shot.</td>', 'Very cool -- well thought out!  I would have liked a teeny bit more light on the horse and the jousting dude, but otherwise, this is a really slick shot.', '2002-08-26 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111896, 4931, 2295, '<td valign="top">I like the effect with the car. 7</td>', 'I like the effect with the car. 7', '2002-08-27 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111897, 4931, 3080, '<td valign="top">Really cool.  I love the motion in this.  Definately depict how children aren''t always very nice with their toys.  I just have to wonder how many times you hit that poor guy on the horse before you got the right picture. lol.    Looks like it''s going really fast, but would have to be a really powerful car to go that fast on carpet.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Really cool.  I love the motion in this.  Definately depict how children aren''t always very nice with their toys.  I just have to wonder how many times you hit that poor guy on the horse before you got the right picture. lol.    Looks like it''s going really fast, but would have to be a really powerful car to go that fast on carpet.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111898, 4931, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool motion effect.  Don''t really care for the rug, but you makes do with what you have, so I''ll let it pass.  8 Swash</td>', 'Cool motion effect.  Don''t really care for the rug, but you makes do with what you have, so I''ll let it pass.  8 Swash', '2002-08-27 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111899, 4931, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice :)  The bright rug in front compared to dark in back too away abit, but still an image to be proud of :)</td>', 'Nice :)  The bright rug in front compared to dark in back too away abit, but still an image to be proud of :)', '2002-08-27 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111900, 4931, 3578, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.</td>', 'Very creative idea.', '2002-08-28 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111901, 4931, 2928, '<td valign="top">This shot was  I think - a lot harder to get than it looks.  The car is moving; the shutter has to fire at exactly the right moment and at the right speed to get the effect of speed and movement.  I may be wrong, but I think it was done using fairly low light and a slow shutter speed.  Whatever you did, I like the effect, and however you did it, it worked, and it worked well.  Great shot, great idea (10)</td>', 'This shot was  I think - a lot harder to get than it looks.  The car is moving; the shutter has to fire at exactly the right moment and at the right speed to get the effect of speed and movement.  I may be wrong, but I think it was done using fairly low light and a slow shutter speed.  Whatever you did, I like the effect, and however you did it, it worked, and it worked well.  Great shot, great idea (10)', '2002-08-28 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111902, 4931, 772, '<td valign="top">nice shot :)  i love the exposure... the carpet doesn''t really grab me, but i like the idea :) = 7 - jmsetzler</td>', 'nice shot :)  i love the exposure... the carpet doesn''t really grab me, but i like the idea :) = 7 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-28 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111903, 4931, 1826, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2002-08-29 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111904, 4931, 1856, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect.  Will be interested to see how you did this.  I wish this were on a better backdrop...the carpet really detracts from the image.  Lisa</td>', 'Very cool effect.  Will be interested to see how you did this.  I wish this were on a better backdrop...the carpet really detracts from the image.  Lisa', '2002-08-29 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111905, 4931, 2798, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and I like the blur effect. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Interesting concept and I like the blur effect. 7 - floyd', '2002-08-30 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111906, 4931, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is sooo silly and yet I keep coming back to it. I am not sure about the dark background but it does provide good contrast for the bright car. <br/>Your carpet is scary ;)<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'This is sooo silly and yet I keep coming back to it. I am not sure about the dark background but it does provide good contrast for the bright car. Your carpet is scary ;)7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 05:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111907, 4931, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-01 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111908, 4931, 2279, '<td valign="top">LOL. Looks like a painful encounter. Good job on the streaks though. 7.</td>', 'LOL. Looks like a painful encounter. Good job on the streaks though. 7.', '2002-09-01 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111909, 4931, 2932, '<td valign="top">Unlike all the shots that depict a child''s toys, this shot manages to capture the imagination which only a child possesses</td>', 'Unlike all the shots that depict a child''s toys, this shot manages to capture the imagination which only a child possesses', '2002-09-02 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111910, 4931, 3251, '<td valign="top">For everybody who commented on our "carpet": it''s a towel and it''s supposed to be grass. I guess I didn''t get that across at all :-) But don''t worry about our floor. We use carpet, not towels for that...<br/><br/>Second: I didn''t knock the little guy over once. Timing was quite easy. I used front curtain sync for the flash and then I pulled the car backwards during the rest of the exposure.</td>', 'For everybody who commented on our "carpet": it''s a towel and it''s supposed to be grass. I guess I didn''t get that across at all :-) But don''t worry about our floor. We use carpet, not towels for that...Second: I didn''t knock the little guy over once. Timing was quite easy. I used front curtain sync for the flash and then I pulled the car backwards during the rest of the exposure.', '2002-09-02 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(111911, 4933, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, didn''t we all do that?</td>', 'Neat idea, didn''t we all do that?', '2002-08-26 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111912, 4933, 51167, '<td valign="top">I remember stomping through puddles and rivers and getting all mudding.  I like the picture</td>', 'I remember stomping through puddles and rivers and getting all mudding.  I like the picture', '2002-08-26 02:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111913, 4933, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image. I love the mood it invokes. I have just started voting but I suspect that this image will represent one of the highest, most sensitive representations of childhood. Love the yellow against all the grey. Love the composition with the yellow subject being surrounded by a lot of grey, room to breathe. I do sense so strongly the child of those boots and his/her delighting in the mud. It makes me think back of my own childhood. Thank you. Just started voting. My prelim. vote is 8 but will definitely revisit this image. Journey<br/>Update: My only nitpick with this image is that the top of the boots are very soft. Since there are so few elements here (boots, mud, and muddy water) every one carries a lot of weight. And when I look at the top part of the image I notice the softness of the boots most of all. Final score: 9 Journey</td>', 'This is a very nice image. I love the mood it invokes. I have just started voting but I suspect that this image will represent one of the highest, most sensitive representations of childhood. Love the yellow against all the grey. Love the composition with the yellow subject being surrounded by a lot of grey, room to breathe. I do sense so strongly the child of those boots and his/her delighting in the mud. It makes me think back of my own childhood. Thank you. Just started voting. My prelim. vote is 8 but will definitely revisit this image. JourneyUpdate: My only nitpick with this image is that the top of the boots are very soft. Since there are so few elements here (boots, mud, and muddy water) every one carries a lot of weight. And when I look at the top part of the image I notice the softness of the boots most of all. Final score: 9 Journey', '2002-08-26 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111914, 4933, 1143, '<td valign="top">Well executed. I had this idea but couldn''t have done it nearly as well. Top 5.</td>', 'Well executed. I had this idea but couldn''t have done it nearly as well. Top 5.', '2002-08-26 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111915, 4933, 3127, '<td valign="top">Nice color and contrast.</td>', 'Nice color and contrast.', '2002-08-26 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111916, 4933, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice color, composition, creative. Nice nice Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Nice color, composition, creative. Nice nice Score 7 Justine', '2002-08-26 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111917, 4933, 3093, '<td valign="top">I had a pair just like it!!!</td>', 'I had a pair just like it!!!', '2002-08-26 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
