(111966, 4934, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colours and close crop gives great shapes. Does remind me of that excitement and pride in a truly beloved toy - one which you just so awed to get, and thankful for. One that you remember even in adulthood.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'Fantastic colours and close crop gives great shapes. Does remind me of that excitement and pride in a truly beloved toy - one which you just so awed to get, and thankful for. One that you remember even in adulthood.9, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111967, 4934, 3080, '<td valign="top">They sure didn''t make them like this when I was a kid.  well, at least I didn''t have one.  I like the different angle you used, without having to photograph the entire bicycle, you got the point across very nicely.  Definately depicts childhood.  Lighting is great.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'They sure didn''t make them like this when I was a kid.  well, at least I didn''t have one.  I like the different angle you used, without having to photograph the entire bicycle, you got the point across very nicely.  Definately depicts childhood.  Lighting is great.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
