(111969, 4934, 2997, '<td valign="top">thanks to all for the great comments here.<br/>I readily admit the photo has a "busy" background.  Walmart has the odd policy about letting you take things without paying for them. :-)<br/>I took the picture with the bike on the rack.  It was cropped to emphasize the one bike as well as possible.  I am learning plenty about presentation here.</td>', 'thanks to all for the great comments here.I readily admit the photo has a "busy" background.  Walmart has the odd policy about letting you take things without paying for them. :-)I took the picture with the bike on the rack.  It was cropped to emphasize the one bike as well as possible.  I am learning plenty about presentation here.', '2002-09-02 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(111970, 4935, 1054, '<td valign="top">Good composition... the bubbles add nicely to the shot.  My only complaint is that the life-savers seem out of place.  It is an interesting play on words to have a life-saver by the bathtub though.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Good composition... the bubbles add nicely to the shot.  My only complaint is that the life-savers seem out of place.  It is an interesting play on words to have a life-saver by the bathtub though.  Nicely done.', '2002-08-26 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
