(111972, 4935, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea and I like the indivual elements - rubber duck, bubble bath bottle, brush, sweets, shoes and the big bubbles. It would work better for me if it were cropped in much closer, losing some at the top and as much at the left as possible within the ratios allowed.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'This is an interesting idea and I like the indivual elements - rubber duck, bubble bath bottle, brush, sweets, shoes and the big bubbles. It would work better for me if it were cropped in much closer, losing some at the top and as much at the left as possible within the ratios allowed.Kavey', '2002-08-26 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111973, 4935, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a fun fun shot. I know that MESS.........well. Good composition, color and very creative work. Score 7 Kee</td>', 'Just a fun fun shot. I know that MESS.........well. Good composition, color and very creative work. Score 7 Kee', '2002-08-26 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(111974, 4935, 811, '<td valign="top">since most of the "stuff" is on the right side of the pic, it may have been helpful to use a vertical framing, and eliminate some fo the left side of the picture.  the dirty shoes add a nice touch. karmat</td>', 'since most of the "stuff" is on the right side of the pic, it may have been helpful to use a vertical framing, and eliminate some fo the left side of the picture.  the dirty shoes add a nice touch. karmat', '2002-08-26 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
