(111976, 4935, 3080, '<td valign="top">Those shoes would have come off at the door!!! LOL.  I like how there are the bubbles flying around the bathroom.  Not realistic, but definately a great touch.  Not sure if I get the significance of the life savers, other than the fact that kids love them.  The angle and set up are great.  Lighting is great.  Through out the challenges, I am surprised to see how many photos are taken in the bathroom.  I wonder if it''s because of the lighting in the bathroom??  Really nice job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Those shoes would have come off at the door!!! LOL.  I like how there are the bubbles flying around the bathroom.  Not realistic, but definately a great touch.  Not sure if I get the significance of the life savers, other than the fact that kids love them.  The angle and set up are great.  Lighting is great.  Through out the challenges, I am surprised to see how many photos are taken in the bathroom.  I wonder if it''s because of the lighting in the bathroom??  Really nice job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
