(111999, 4936, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a great angle on the car, but the beach needs to be tilted a slight bit to the left.  I love the focus on the car, and the soft focus on everything happening in the background.  The lighting is good for this photo.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great angle on the car, but the beach needs to be tilted a slight bit to the left.  I love the focus on the car, and the soft focus on everything happening in the background.  The lighting is good for this photo.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112000, 4936, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and shot, but I really like either really straight horizons or horizons that are completely off the horizontal, such as "Castles and Shells" entry.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Nice idea and shot, but I really like either really straight horizons or horizons that are completely off the horizontal, such as "Castles and Shells" entry.6, Kavey', '2002-08-30 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112001, 4936, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112002, 4936, 734, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to make a quick comment on my picture.. and that this is by far my favorite macro picture ive ever taken...ok well that all.</td>', 'I just wanted to make a quick comment on my picture.. and that this is by far my favorite macro picture ive ever taken...ok well that all.', '2002-09-03 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112003, 4937, 1877, '<td valign="top">A very interesting concept.. growth! I think this was very well done. The lighting is a tad .. harsh? Bright? 7</td>', 'A very interesting concept.. growth! I think this was very well done. The lighting is a tad .. harsh? Bright? 7', '2002-08-26 02:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112004, 4937, 51167, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea for the challenge.  I like it, the more modern stuff is sharper than the younger kid stuff.</td>', 'This is a cool idea for the challenge.  I like it, the more modern stuff is sharper than the younger kid stuff.', '2002-08-26 02:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112005, 4937, 2862, '<td valign="top">I like how this picture tells a story of passing years</td>', 'I like how this picture tells a story of passing years', '2002-08-26 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112006, 4937, 2586, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done with the blurring to convey two different phases in life. Wonder how you did that. Will revisit this lateron this week. Prelim: 7 Journey</td>', 'Beautifully done with the blurring to convey two different phases in life. Wonder how you did that. Will revisit this lateron this week. Prelim: 7 Journey', '2002-08-26 04:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112007, 4937, 3208, '<td valign="top">Very interesting idea...</td>', 'Very interesting idea...', '2002-08-26 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112008, 4937, 3542, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2002-08-26 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112009, 4937, 117, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2002-08-26 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112010, 4937, 2792, '<td valign="top">Great concept!</td>', 'Great concept!', '2002-08-26 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112011, 4937, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice effect.  The concept is good, the execution is better than I could do, but it still doesn''t quite look "good".  The bear is overly bright on the left, blah, blah, blah.  I think there are too many elements both, partly visible and fully visible, makes it look cluttered.  Maybe two of each would have been more dramatic.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nice effect.  The concept is good, the execution is better than I could do, but it still doesn''t quite look "good".  The bear is overly bright on the left, blah, blah, blah.  I think there are too many elements both, partly visible and fully visible, makes it look cluttered.  Maybe two of each would have been more dramatic.  8 Swash', '2002-08-27 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112012, 4937, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing9,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing9,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-27 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112013, 4937, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and thought provoking. If I were to be picky I would ask the significance of the wood arm rest in the lower right corner. Lnede</td>', 'Very interesting and thought provoking. If I were to be picky I would ask the significance of the wood arm rest in the lower right corner. Lnede', '2002-08-28 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112014, 4937, 811, '<td valign="top">Great effect.  The color seems a bit off, but that makes it seem even "dreamier" or passing. karmat</td>', 'Great effect.  The color seems a bit off, but that makes it seem even "dreamier" or passing. karmat', '2002-08-28 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112015, 4937, 2172, '<td valign="top">REALLY cool and soooo true.  I like this one very much.  9<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'REALLY cool and soooo true.  I like this one very much.  9Ruthann', '2002-08-28 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112016, 4937, 3573, '<td valign="top">lots of work</td>', 'lots of work', '2002-08-29 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112017, 4937, 2223, '<td valign="top">very interesting time exposure, maybe a bit too long--kind of bright, i struggled to see the cell phone and the other thing on the bottom right that looks wooden, but cool none the less 6</td>', 'very interesting time exposure, maybe a bit too long--kind of bright, i struggled to see the cell phone and the other thing on the bottom right that looks wooden, but cool none the less 6', '2002-08-29 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112018, 4937, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever idea - makes me look and look again.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Clever idea - makes me look and look again.6, Kavey', '2002-08-30 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112019, 4937, 2798, '<td valign="top">Love your concept here. I think I would have liked to have seen these two shots taken in the same place and from the same angle. They dont quite gel for me. Good light and balance of elements, though. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Love your concept here. I think I would have liked to have seen these two shots taken in the same place and from the same angle. They dont quite gel for me. Good light and balance of elements, though. 8 - floyd', '2002-08-30 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112020, 4937, 1909, '<td valign="top">nice technique, how did you achieve it? How long was the shutter speed.  Good concept, well carried out.</td>', 'nice technique, how did you achieve it? How long was the shutter speed.  Good concept, well carried out.', '2002-08-30 08:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112021, 4937, 2634, '<td valign="top">cool effect on this one...nice!</td>', 'cool effect on this one...nice!', '2002-09-01 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112022, 4937, 2279, '<td valign="top">A darker floor would have made this picture a little better. 6.</td>', 'A darker floor would have made this picture a little better. 6.', '2002-09-01 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112023, 4937, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this is a shutter speed trick. Not real familiar with it, so i could be wrong.  I like how you have them kind of dissapearing into the "newer" toys.  the lighting is very nice and I like the framing.  great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this is a shutter speed trick. Not real familiar with it, so i could be wrong.  I like how you have them kind of dissapearing into the "newer" toys.  the lighting is very nice and I like the framing.  great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112024, 4938, 2862, '<td valign="top">this picture reminds me of the risk-tqking nature of a child, the mother in me crys "no!'' whereas dads everywhere will probably say "go for it!".</td>', 'this picture reminds me of the risk-tqking nature of a child, the mother in me crys "no!'' whereas dads everywhere will probably say "go for it!".', '2002-08-26 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112025, 4938, 2817, '<td valign="top">"Childhood WITHOUT children" I am afraid this doesn''t meet that challenge.</td>', '"Childhood WITHOUT children" I am afraid this doesn''t meet that challenge.', '2002-08-26 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112026, 4938, 2427, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus.  Really give a sense of movement toward the tunnel.  Good composition.</td>', 'I like the soft focus.  Really give a sense of movement toward the tunnel.  Good composition.', '2002-08-26 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112027, 4938, 2881, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I would have left out the person entirely, even if not a child.  And... don''t use the name of the challenge in the title, no way, no part, no how! The title would have had the same effect just by leaving out the words "of childhood"</td>', 'Interesting, but I would have left out the person entirely, even if not a child.  And... don''t use the name of the challenge in the title, no way, no part, no how! The title would have had the same effect just by leaving out the words "of childhood"', '2002-08-26 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112028, 4938, 2923, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun :)</td>', 'Looks like fun :)', '2002-08-26 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112029, 4938, 3087, '<td valign="top">Assuming this is an adult playing a child, seems a little bit of a cludge to avoid having a child in the photo by having an adult play the part of the child. Would have liked to see your creativity in creating a shot without a child rather than your creativity at disguising an adult as a child! But that''s just my preference!<br/>Also seems out of focus to me.<br/>Like the converging lines into the dark mouth of the tunnel.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Assuming this is an adult playing a child, seems a little bit of a cludge to avoid having a child in the photo by having an adult play the part of the child. Would have liked to see your creativity in creating a shot without a child rather than your creativity at disguising an adult as a child! But that''s just my preference!Also seems out of focus to me.Like the converging lines into the dark mouth of the tunnel.Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112030, 4938, 3075, '<td valign="top">Real daredevil picture. Not really sharp. Would be nice if the gentleman in front is sharp and the stuff further away out of focus. Anyway i recognize the moment like this. Should i go or not ?</td>', 'Real daredevil picture. Not really sharp. Would be nice if the gentleman in front is sharp and the stuff further away out of focus. Anyway i recognize the moment like this. Should i go or not ?', '2002-08-26 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112031, 4938, 1644, '<td valign="top">So you were that daredevil kid... neat perspective. I like the blurring on the sides. I''ve got "stand by me" playing in my head now. :)</td>', 'So you were that daredevil kid... neat perspective. I like the blurring on the sides. I''ve got "stand by me" playing in my head now. :)', '2002-08-27 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112032, 4938, 2553, '<td valign="top">I sure get "that feeling" in the pit of my stomach!  This is a good one for the challenge !  Nice shot. lhall</td>', 'I sure get "that feeling" in the pit of my stomach!  This is a good one for the challenge !  Nice shot. lhall', '2002-08-27 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112033, 4938, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo holds a special meaning for me :)  Take a look at this if you get an opportunity:<br/><br/>//www.pbase.com/image/2585019<br/><br/>Kids always are willing to take a risk.  Is this an old railroad bridge?  I initially thought that it was, but it appears that the rails have been removed.  the camera angle also gives the impression that that this bridge is on a slope... i would love to hear some details about this photo at your convenience... good work! = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This photo holds a special meaning for me :)  Take a look at this if you get an opportunity://www.pbase.com/image/2585019Kids always are willing to take a risk.  Is this an old railroad bridge?  I initially thought that it was, but it appears that the rails have been removed.  the camera angle also gives the impression that that this bridge is on a slope... i would love to hear some details about this photo at your convenience... good work! = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112034, 4938, 3080, '<td valign="top">Go for IT!!!  This photo reminded me of astephen king movie.  There are a couple that have train tracks in them, and right now, for the life of me, I can''t remember which it is, but I''m a huge SK fan, and this has a SK feeling to me.  The angle and frame placement is great.  the lighting was perfect for this shot.  I have to wonder if this is still in use.  There are some vines hanging down in front of the tunel.  Not like it matters either way, but just curious.  I hope you don''t get a bunch of comments saying "you''re not suposed to have a kid in your photo"  Arms are too hairy to be a kid. LOL.  Great job on the shot.  Very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Go for IT!!!  This photo reminded me of astephen king movie.  There are a couple that have train tracks in them, and right now, for the life of me, I can''t remember which it is, but I''m a huge SK fan, and this has a SK feeling to me.  The angle and frame placement is great.  the lighting was perfect for this shot.  I have to wonder if this is still in use.  There are some vines hanging down in front of the tunel.  Not like it matters either way, but just curious.  I hope you don''t get a bunch of comments saying "you''re not suposed to have a kid in your photo"  Arms are too hairy to be a kid. LOL.  Great job on the shot.  Very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112035, 4938, 2866, '<td valign="top">No Kids.</td>', 'No Kids.', '2002-08-27 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112036, 4938, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus of this, from camera shake it seems. It creates a sense of tension that complements the composition. This photo evokes a real mood.</td>', 'I like the soft focus of this, from camera shake it seems. It creates a sense of tension that complements the composition. This photo evokes a real mood.', '2002-08-28 05:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112037, 4938, 1024, '<td valign="top">This might have met the challenge better without a person in the photo.  I think you lose the sense of childhood, with an adult in the childs position....</td>', 'This might have met the challenge better without a person in the photo.  I think you lose the sense of childhood, with an adult in the childs position....', '2002-08-29 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112038, 4938, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is the man blurry or is it the tree.  How about the first few rails.  Could you have had a soft focus filter on?  Why?  (for the tunnel effect?)  Subtly is wasted on the vaste majority.  6 Swash</td>', 'Is the man blurry or is it the tree.  How about the first few rails.  Could you have had a soft focus filter on?  Why?  (for the tunnel effect?)  Subtly is wasted on the vaste majority.  6 Swash', '2002-08-30 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112039, 4938, 554, '<td valign="top">NO ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! GET OFF THE TRACKS NOW !  Good grief boy. What are you thinking? A train comes by and you''re nothing but a bloody mess for someone to have to clean up.<br/>Why is there a child in this photo? I like it a lot and the rules says "children" so I guess one child is ok. It looks like almost nothing is in focus either. I have no idea why I score it 8. I guess it''s because it is such a good idea and I don''t know what I would have focused on either.<br/>After reading your post I am back to review. conclusion---You obviously wanted us to think it is a child ,the title and attire of the person lead me to that conclusion. Would you not agree? What would make one think otherwise?+++no change in score. good luck</td>', 'NO ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! ! GET OFF THE TRACKS NOW !  Good grief boy. What are you thinking? A train comes by and you''re nothing but a bloody mess for someone to have to clean up.Why is there a child in this photo? I like it a lot and the rules says "children" so I guess one child is ok. It looks like almost nothing is in focus either. I have no idea why I score it 8. I guess it''s because it is such a good idea and I don''t know what I would have focused on either.After reading your post I am back to review. conclusion---You obviously wanted us to think it is a child ,the title and attire of the person lead me to that conclusion. Would you not agree? What would make one think otherwise?+++no change in score. good luck', '2002-08-31 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112040, 4938, 3419, '<td valign="top">Sure.... why not? Haven''t got anything better to do.....Nice composition, but a little blurry overall.</td>', 'Sure.... why not? Haven''t got anything better to do.....Nice composition, but a little blurry overall.', '2002-08-31 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112041, 4938, 3111, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, but there seems to be a bit of a blur in the shot.</td>', 'Like the idea, but there seems to be a bit of a blur in the shot.', '2002-08-31 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112042, 4938, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great idea - my only quibbles relate to the sharpness of the overall image and that there seems to be a child in the picture.  I think that the shot of the tunnel on its own would have been better.</td>', 'Great shot, great idea - my only quibbles relate to the sharpness of the overall image and that there seems to be a child in the picture.  I think that the shot of the tunnel on its own would have been better.', '2002-09-01 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112043, 4938, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?0,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?0,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112044, 4938, 1827, '<td valign="top">Even if walking the train tracks or listening for the train wasn''t a part of someon''s childhood, I think the movie Stand By Me immortalized it as a childhood moment.  Actually this photo brought back to me the feelings I had for that movie as a child, the empathy I had for the characters.  I''m assuming that the person is an adult, filling in to represent a child. (The furry arm gives it away.  hee hee)  I like him in the photo though many people may complain.  I''m sure you''ve probably been voted down as a result.  I only want to say that I think this would be a weaker photo without him in it, so my advice is to ignore and "does not meet challenge" comments you may get.  Focus is a bit soft, but for some reason in this photo I think it may add rather than detract.  I''ve gone back and forth on my feelings on that aspect of this photo this week.  6, just-married</td>', 'Even if walking the train tracks or listening for the train wasn''t a part of someon''s childhood, I think the movie Stand By Me immortalized it as a childhood moment.  Actually this photo brought back to me the feelings I had for that movie as a child, the empathy I had for the characters.  I''m assuming that the person is an adult, filling in to represent a child. (The furry arm gives it away.  hee hee)  I like him in the photo though many people may complain.  I''m sure you''ve probably been voted down as a result.  I only want to say that I think this would be a weaker photo without him in it, so my advice is to ignore and "does not meet challenge" comments you may get.  Focus is a bit soft, but for some reason in this photo I think it may add rather than detract.  I''ve gone back and forth on my feelings on that aspect of this photo this week.  6, just-married', '2002-09-01 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(112045, 4938, 2279, '<td valign="top">Kinda blurry and whats with the guy on the left? 5.</td>', 'Kinda blurry and whats with the guy on the left? 5.', '2002-09-01 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112046, 4938, 806, '<td valign="top">You elicit alot of emotion here. With a bit of motion in the foreground, I feel like I''m about to leap with the person thru the tunnel. Danger! It fills me with that excited fear! Because I''m not sure of the method you used for this, I am having trouble deciding if the rest of the blurriness is because of the motion, or because you used a small aperature number. (doesn''t *that* sound technical!) Anyway...gave you an 8.</td>', 'You elicit alot of emotion here. With a bit of motion in the foreground, I feel like I''m about to leap with the person thru the tunnel. Danger! It fills me with that excited fear! Because I''m not sure of the method you used for this, I am having trouble deciding if the rest of the blurriness is because of the motion, or because you used a small aperature number. (doesn''t *that* sound technical!) Anyway...gave you an 8.', '2002-09-02 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112047, 4939, 2862, '<td valign="top">this picture was thought provoking, wasn''t sure if there''s an activist message here due to the randomness of the display of articles</td>', 'this picture was thought provoking, wasn''t sure if there''s an activist message here due to the randomness of the display of articles', '2002-08-26 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112048, 4939, 327, '<td valign="top">+ soap and TP. :P LOL Good visual but could of been presented better. The sheet is wrong for this. Over all I like the idea. Score 6 Justine</td>', '+ soap and TP. :P LOL Good visual but could of been presented better. The sheet is wrong for this. Over all I like the idea. Score 6 Justine', '2002-08-26 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112049, 4939, 3170, '<td valign="top">pretty cool! toys for the big boys aye!!!!......</td>', 'pretty cool! toys for the big boys aye!!!!......', '2002-08-26 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112050, 4939, 1585, '<td valign="top">You''re not going to tell my mom are you? 5. liltool</td>', 'You''re not going to tell my mom are you? 5. liltool', '2002-08-26 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112051, 4939, 3313, '<td valign="top">Yep, I remember all those, but I find the picture too ... pre-arranged. I don^t think I would have done better, so I tend to limit the number of objects.</td>', 'Yep, I remember all those, but I find the picture too ... pre-arranged. I don^t think I would have done better, so I tend to limit the number of objects.', '2002-08-26 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112052, 4939, 2815, '<td valign="top">this photo really represents me when I was young.  I had all the above items and got into mischief with all of them<br/></td>', 'this photo really represents me when I was young.  I had all the above items and got into mischief with all of them', '2002-08-26 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112053, 4939, 117, '<td valign="top">i could only have a bb gun until i was old enough for a shotgun and rifle i bought both my sons pellet guns</td>', 'i could only have a bb gun until i was old enough for a shotgun and rifle i bought both my sons pellet guns', '2002-08-26 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112054, 4939, 3075, '<td valign="top">Like the composition of the various stuff. I would have put the white cloth all the way up front so no edge of wood was shown, for the rest: excellent picture!</td>', 'Like the composition of the various stuff. I would have put the white cloth all the way up front so no edge of wood was shown, for the rest: excellent picture!', '2002-08-26 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112055, 4939, 2717, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Did you make the sling shot or did you have it. I will guess make, unless you are a lot younger, we never had cable ties.  7</td>', 'Love it!  Did you make the sling shot or did you have it. I will guess make, unless you are a lot younger, we never had cable ties.  7', '2002-08-26 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112056, 4939, 2223, '<td valign="top">this scares me!</td>', 'this scares me!', '2002-08-26 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112057, 4939, 3102, '<td valign="top">Yikes... please tell me your kids don''t live in our neighborhood!</td>', 'Yikes... please tell me your kids don''t live in our neighborhood!', '2002-08-26 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112058, 4939, 2752, '<td valign="top">great toys...if the slingshot wasn''t facing the same way as the air rifle I think the composition would be better.</td>', 'great toys...if the slingshot wasn''t facing the same way as the air rifle I think the composition would be better.', '2002-08-26 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112059, 4939, 772, '<td valign="top">This is interesting :)  As I look at this photo, I wonder what could have been done simply with the box of matches and the firecracker?  :)  Good shot... - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is interesting :)  As I look at this photo, I wonder what could have been done simply with the box of matches and the firecracker?  :)  Good shot... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112060, 4939, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting layout. Front foreground should have either more or none of the wooden beam there. Angle seems funny, maybe it needs rotating slightly?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Interesting layout. Front foreground should have either more or none of the wooden beam there. Angle seems funny, maybe it needs rotating slightly?Kavey', '2002-08-27 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112061, 4939, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background4,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing5,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool', '2002-08-27 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112062, 4939, 2997, '<td valign="top">You conveyed your idea very well, but from what I am learning of "artistic" value here on dpc, you might have done better by eliminating some of the props.  One possible alternative would have been to have merely the slingshot sticking out of the back of a pair of jeans draped over a blue chair.  The stones could have been on the seat of the chair.<br/>Please understand I am not telling you how take pictures, merely suggesting an alternative.</td>', 'You conveyed your idea very well, but from what I am learning of "artistic" value here on dpc, you might have done better by eliminating some of the props.  One possible alternative would have been to have merely the slingshot sticking out of the back of a pair of jeans draped over a blue chair.  The stones could have been on the seat of the chair.Please understand I am not telling you how take pictures, merely suggesting an alternative.', '2002-08-29 03:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112063, 4939, 2798, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting but the arrangement seems a little loose. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Nice lighting but the arrangement seems a little loose. 7 - floyd', '2002-08-30 08:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112064, 4939, 3419, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of country life - what fun! Careful - don''t shoot your eye out! Nice composition and detail, but try different lighting?</td>', 'Reminiscent of country life - what fun! Careful - don''t shoot your eye out! Nice composition and detail, but try different lighting?', '2002-08-30 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112065, 4939, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great idea, good shot (I hope) ...  Pun intended :o)</td>', 'Great idea, good shot (I hope) ...  Pun intended :o)', '2002-09-01 04:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112066, 4939, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well isn''t this the truth!  Only thing missing is the roll of toilet paper for the trees!  The angle is good.  The photo isn''t cluttered, the objects are spaced out engough that we can tell exactly what they are.  The angle on each item is good.  Focus and lighting are ok.  I might have tried to cut the bottom wooden thing out of the photo.  There is a bit of a glare on it, and it''s not straight with the frame of the photo.  Great depiction of childhood.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well isn''t this the truth!  Only thing missing is the roll of toilet paper for the trees!  The angle is good.  The photo isn''t cluttered, the objects are spaced out engough that we can tell exactly what they are.  The angle on each item is good.  Focus and lighting are ok.  I might have tried to cut the bottom wooden thing out of the photo.  There is a bit of a glare on it, and it''s not straight with the frame of the photo.  Great depiction of childhood.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112067, 4939, 2279, '<td valign="top">Those things have definately got me in heaps of trouble. Good job. 6.</td>', 'Those things have definately got me in heaps of trouble. Good job. 6.', '2002-09-01 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112068, 4940, 3532, '<td valign="top">Empty swings are almost a cliched image for lost childhood, but I really like the perspective on this shot, from a child''s height.  Woul have been nice to get a little better exposure/burn on the background sky.</td>', 'Empty swings are almost a cliched image for lost childhood, but I really like the perspective on this shot, from a child''s height.  Woul have been nice to get a little better exposure/burn on the background sky.', '2002-08-26 04:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112069, 4940, 3448, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field...the flagpole (?) just beyond the swingset poles is a bit distracting (looks like it doesn''t belong)....7.</td>', 'Nice depth of field...the flagpole (?) just beyond the swingset poles is a bit distracting (looks like it doesn''t belong)....7.', '2002-08-26 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112070, 4940, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the focus on this, and the pattern the swings create.  Though I normally really like brighter colors, the "dullness" in the background gives this an early morning dreamy feel to me.  karmat</td>', 'I like the focus on this, and the pattern the swings create.  Though I normally really like brighter colors, the "dullness" in the background gives this an early morning dreamy feel to me.  karmat', '2002-08-26 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112071, 4940, 1005, '<td valign="top">Swings - a popular subject.  Challenge well met.  Too bad about the hazy day, it takes a bit away from the image.  Did you try taking this from the opposite side?  Good focus on the primary subject.  8 Swash</td>', 'Swings - a popular subject.  Challenge well met.  Too bad about the hazy day, it takes a bit away from the image.  Did you try taking this from the opposite side?  Good focus on the primary subject.  8 Swash', '2002-08-26 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
