(112073, 4940, 2279, '<td valign="top">Good job on this. I like how the swings lead your eye towards the top of the picture with the perfect overcast sky (my favorite kind of days). 7.</td>', 'Good job on this. I like how the swings lead your eye towards the top of the picture with the perfect overcast sky (my favorite kind of days). 7.', '2002-08-26 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
