(112075, 4940, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. The brightness at the top makes me feel like squinting against the light, so it''s captured the bright sun very well. The seat in the foreground is very dark and could do with just a little light on it (IMO).<br/>5, kavey</td>', 'Nice photo. The brightness at the top makes me feel like squinting against the light, so it''s captured the bright sun very well. The seat in the foreground is very dark and could do with just a little light on it (IMO).5, kavey', '2002-08-27 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
