(112077, 4940, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo... the soft (morning?) light and the mist in the background give a mood of reminiscence and contemplation to these empty swings. The composition is powerful.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo... the soft (morning?) light and the mist in the background give a mood of reminiscence and contemplation to these empty swings. The composition is powerful.', '2002-08-28 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112078, 4940, 2752, '<td valign="top">great perspective shot and DOF</td>', 'great perspective shot and DOF', '2002-08-28 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112079, 4940, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the angle this was taken at.  The pole in the back, and the blue building are kind of distracting, but it''s not like you could just move them, and I like the angle just how it is.  The lighting is good, but the background looks a little hazy.  Not sure if you did it that way on purpose, or if it just couldn''t be avoided.  Overall great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the angle this was taken at.  The pole in the back, and the blue building are kind of distracting, but it''s not like you could just move them, and I like the angle just how it is.  The lighting is good, but the background looks a little hazy.  Not sure if you did it that way on purpose, or if it just couldn''t be avoided.  Overall great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-28 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112080, 4940, 2247, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Yes there is the glare factor at the top of your pic, but it is more diffused and to me less distracting than direct sunlight.   I love your "child''s eye" view of the swings.  Really cool.  Overall, I give you a 10.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Yes there is the glare factor at the top of your pic, but it is more diffused and to me less distracting than direct sunlight.   I love your "child''s eye" view of the swings.  Really cool.  Overall, I give you a 10.', '2002-08-29 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112081, 4940, 1856, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and dof here...and the soft dewy quality of the background.  looks like a peaceful morning.  Great job!  8 Lisa</td>', 'I love the composition and dof here...and the soft dewy quality of the background.  looks like a peaceful morning.  Great job!  8 Lisa', '2002-08-29 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
