(112115, 4942, 2881, '<td valign="top">This is a memory right out of my childhood, and I would have loved to submit this very photo! This could have been the swing at my Gramma''s house! I thought about trying to find a tree, to re-create this memory, but we live where there are absolutely NO trees of the right kind, or big enough.  You''ve done it for me!</td>', 'This is a memory right out of my childhood, and I would have loved to submit this very photo! This could have been the swing at my Gramma''s house! I thought about trying to find a tree, to re-create this memory, but we live where there are absolutely NO trees of the right kind, or big enough.  You''ve done it for me!', '2002-08-26 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112116, 4942, 82, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous tree, comfy swing.  :)  The picture is a tad granulated, and for me it would be a stronger image if the focus were soft instead.</td>', 'Gorgeous tree, comfy swing.  :)  The picture is a tad granulated, and for me it would be a stronger image if the focus were soft instead.', '2002-08-26 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
