(112118, 4942, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really love this photo.  the grass is a really great green and the trees are a beautiful contrast.  The lighting was great for this photo. my only lighting concern would be in the upper left corner where the bright spot kind of washes away the tops of the trees right there.  This is an absolutely beautiful tree.  This photo is in my top 10.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really love this photo.  the grass is a really great green and the trees are a beautiful contrast.  The lighting was great for this photo. my only lighting concern would be in the upper left corner where the bright spot kind of washes away the tops of the trees right there.  This is an absolutely beautiful tree.  This photo is in my top 10.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112119, 4942, 3075, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, i wonder what i looked like if it were in B&amp;W.<br/>I think B&amp;W pictures are more suited for this challenge, although i like the "emptiness" in the background, just a tree and a swing. Nothing disturbing.<br/></td>', 'Nice picture, i wonder what i looked like if it were in B&W.I think B&W pictures are more suited for this challenge, although i like the "emptiness" in the background, just a tree and a swing. Nothing disturbing.', '2002-08-26 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
