(112126, 4942, 3044, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I would have loved to see this in b&amp;w. I think it would have given a more nostalgic feel. The green is so vibrant that it almost distracts from the swing. I think I would have tried to crop out the hot sky in the upper left hand corner. Great image.</td>', 'Nice composition. I would have loved to see this in b&w. I think it would have given a more nostalgic feel. The green is so vibrant that it almost distracts from the swing. I think I would have tried to crop out the hot sky in the upper left hand corner. Great image.', '2002-08-27 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112127, 4942, 1024, '<td valign="top">You have nailed MY childhood completely with this photo.  Great muted colors.   I think the only suggestion that I could make is the composition might be stronger if you moved to the side a little so the swing was not directly in the center of the photograph.  7  BAMartin</td>', 'You have nailed MY childhood completely with this photo.  Great muted colors.   I think the only suggestion that I could make is the composition might be stronger if you moved to the side a little so the swing was not directly in the center of the photograph.  7  BAMartin', '2002-08-27 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112128, 4942, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, a little grainy.<br/>Lacks punch - perhaps a close up or an unusual viewpoint?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Nice colours, a little grainy.Lacks punch - perhaps a close up or an unusual viewpoint?Kavey', '2002-08-27 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112129, 4942, 2997, '<td valign="top">There were so many swing pictures this time I am torn in voting on them.  Some have merits in one way while others in other ways.<br/>What I liked: The character of the tree bow and trunk add to this picture.  A more closely framed shot would have (in my opinion) been better in ths instance.<br/>I don''t know how varied and intense/subdued natural lighting is where you are at, but if possible, try returning here at different times of day to see of the shadows and lighting accentuate the shot.</td>', 'There were so many swing pictures this time I am torn in voting on them.  Some have merits in one way while others in other ways.What I liked: The character of the tree bow and trunk add to this picture.  A more closely framed shot would have (in my opinion) been better in ths instance.I don''t know how varied and intense/subdued natural lighting is where you are at, but if possible, try returning here at different times of day to see of the shadows and lighting accentuate the shot.', '2002-08-27 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112130, 4942, 2866, '<td valign="top">A softer focus may have been in order here, but a nice shot none the less.</td>', 'A softer focus may have been in order here, but a nice shot none the less.', '2002-08-27 19:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
