(112170, 4944, 3080, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t notice, but I just noticed that all the swings aren''t the same.  There are the 2 regular swings and the 2 "baby" swings.  There are 2 things that make me think this was taken at a public park, rather than at a school playground. And maybe I could be wrong, so just ignore me if I am (and it doesn''t affect score BTW, this is only an observation)  Schools usually have a fence at the "edge" of the playground, and they usually don''t have those baby swings.  I do NOT let title affect my ratings, but I think if you were going to sell the photo or something, people MIGHT feel decieved.    Personaly I don''t care if the photo was taken at a playground, park or prison.  It gets the point across, and very nicely.  I like the angle and the lighting.  You did a great job of getting the chain parallel with the edge of the photo.  Very nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'At first I didn''t notice, but I just noticed that all the swings aren''t the same.  There are the 2 regular swings and the 2 "baby" swings.  There are 2 things that make me think this was taken at a public park, rather than at a school playground. And maybe I could be wrong, so just ignore me if I am (and it doesn''t affect score BTW, this is only an observation)  Schools usually have a fence at the "edge" of the playground, and they usually don''t have those baby swings.  I do NOT let title affect my ratings, but I think if you were going to sell the photo or something, people MIGHT feel decieved.    Personaly I don''t care if the photo was taken at a playground, park or prison.  It gets the point across, and very nicely.  I like the angle and the lighting.  You did a great job of getting the chain parallel with the edge of the photo.  Very nice shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-30 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112171, 4944, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great shot where each element of foreground and background adds something. <br/>Nice lines and colours.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Great shot where each element of foreground and background adds something. Nice lines and colours.7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
