(112177, 4945, 82, '<td valign="top">There are a few this week of a swing near a tree, but this is my favorite.  The contrast is beautiful, and the composition is great.  If it weren''t for the swing, the tree would be a little too centered for my test -- but as you''ve framed it, it''s wonderful.  I would have given this a 10 if the ropes under the swing had been cut a bit shorter.</td>', 'There are a few this week of a swing near a tree, but this is my favorite.  The contrast is beautiful, and the composition is great.  If it weren''t for the swing, the tree would be a little too centered for my test -- but as you''ve framed it, it''s wonderful.  I would have given this a 10 if the ropes under the swing had been cut a bit shorter.', '2002-08-26 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
