(112182, 4945, 2668, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture as b&amp;w, it makes the picture. the shadows play along making the ground to the right not so empty.  the fact that its a homemade swing, brings back lots of childhood memories....unfortunately the younger voters may never have enjoyed or experienced this wonderful memory.  (8)</td>', 'I really like this picture as b&w, it makes the picture. the shadows play along making the ground to the right not so empty.  the fact that its a homemade swing, brings back lots of childhood memories....unfortunately the younger voters may never have enjoyed or experienced this wonderful memory.  (8)', '2002-08-27 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112183, 4945, 3540, '<td valign="top">As inspired by the title of this shot (which is exceptional btw), this makes me think of old people and death.  In my less than expert opinion, the absence of color leaves a morose taste in my mouth.  I may be on the other side of the generation gap here.  In absolute terms (forget the topic), this is quite a nice shot.</td>', 'As inspired by the title of this shot (which is exceptional btw), this makes me think of old people and death.  In my less than expert opinion, the absence of color leaves a morose taste in my mouth.  I may be on the other side of the generation gap here.  In absolute terms (forget the topic), this is quite a nice shot.', '2002-08-27 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
