(112193, 4945, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a superb shot.  The use of B&amp;W makes the picture.  The atmosphere is great and it has hit the challenge with aplomb.  I cannot find fault with the picture  some may say it''s a little dark, some may say it''s a little out of focus, but I think you''ve got it right.  (10)</td>', 'This is a superb shot.  The use of B&W makes the picture.  The atmosphere is great and it has hit the challenge with aplomb.  I cannot find fault with the picture  some may say it''s a little dark, some may say it''s a little out of focus, but I think you''ve got it right.  (10)', '2002-08-28 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112194, 4945, 1005, '<td valign="top">At first, I wanted to suggest a little brighter, but I think that would have washed out some of the ground and tree bark, so don''t do that.  Shadows to sun to shadows is hard, it seems to confuse the camera.  I would suggest circling round to the left.  The swing bar is shaded, so doesn''t show up well against the shade background, if you went to the left, you could have caught it in the sun, but I don''t know, maybe the background sucked in that direction.  8 Swash</td>', 'At first, I wanted to suggest a little brighter, but I think that would have washed out some of the ground and tree bark, so don''t do that.  Shadows to sun to shadows is hard, it seems to confuse the camera.  I would suggest circling round to the left.  The swing bar is shaded, so doesn''t show up well against the shade background, if you went to the left, you could have caught it in the sun, but I don''t know, maybe the background sucked in that direction.  8 Swash', '2002-08-28 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112195, 4945, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a deeply moving photo.  It brings to mind childhoods of the past, specificially from old black and white movies (I am thinking To Kill A Mockingbird) as I see this.  Wonderful job.  9  BAMartin</td>', 'This is a deeply moving photo.  It brings to mind childhoods of the past, specificially from old black and white movies (I am thinking To Kill A Mockingbird) as I see this.  Wonderful job.  9  BAMartin', '2002-08-28 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112196, 4945, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white but the composition is a little off.  The tree is smack dab in the middle of the pic.  The area left of the swing isn''t important.  I''d either crop that out or just pan the camera to the right more and get the tree off center.  This is the first pic I have ever rated and I hope I''m being to harsh.  I really dig the blac and white.</td>', 'I like the black and white but the composition is a little off.  The tree is smack dab in the middle of the pic.  The area left of the swing isn''t important.  I''d either crop that out or just pan the camera to the right more and get the tree off center.  This is the first pic I have ever rated and I hope I''m being to harsh.  I really dig the blac and white.', '2002-08-28 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112197, 4945, 2279, '<td valign="top">I like this. 7.</td>', 'I like this. 7.', '2002-08-29 05:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
