(112205, 4946, 2279, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a California beach. The only thing that I don''t like is the shadow at the very bottom left. 7.</td>', 'This reminds me of a California beach. The only thing that I don''t like is the shadow at the very bottom left. 7.', '2002-08-26 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112206, 4946, 1507, '<td valign="top">i like it, it captures some of the memories i once had when i was a child. sand castle building r0cked. i gave this an 8.</td>', 'i like it, it captures some of the memories i once had when i was a child. sand castle building r0cked. i gave this an 8.', '2002-08-26 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112207, 4946, 2553, '<td valign="top">The ONLY thing I could "nitpick" is the shadow in the lower left corner.  I love your composition, and the sheer simplicity of the shot at conveying childhood.  I like it a lot.  lhall (9)</td>', 'The ONLY thing I could "nitpick" is the shadow in the lower left corner.  I love your composition, and the sheer simplicity of the shot at conveying childhood.  I like it a lot.  lhall (9)', '2002-08-26 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112208, 4946, 1779, '<td valign="top">I like a lot. If you have the software, try saturating the colors and giving it a bit more of cvontrast, very good!<br/><br/>oh, and careful. see the shadow on the lower left corner? : )</td>', 'I like a lot. If you have the software, try saturating the colors and giving it a bit more of cvontrast, very good!oh, and careful. see the shadow on the lower left corner? : )', '2002-08-26 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112209, 4946, 640, '<td valign="top">I know its on lthe beach and in bright sunlight, but the colors look a little washed out. Maybe since there was so much sun it would have been better take the exposure down a step</td>', 'I know its on lthe beach and in bright sunlight, but the colors look a little washed out. Maybe since there was so much sun it would have been better take the exposure down a step', '2002-08-26 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112210, 4946, 1154, '<td valign="top">still my favorite place in the world, great beach shot</td>', 'still my favorite place in the world, great beach shot', '2002-08-26 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112211, 4946, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light. Nice color. Score 7 Kee</td>', 'Beautiful light. Nice color. Score 7 Kee', '2002-08-26 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112212, 4946, 2881, '<td valign="top">Focus needs to be more on the sand castle... maybe with childhood tools? Too much suft and sky.</td>', 'Focus needs to be more on the sand castle... maybe with childhood tools? Too much suft and sky.', '2002-08-26 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112213, 4946, 2295, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  focus looks great.  Lighting is good.  I like your subject.  8</td>', 'Very well done.  focus looks great.  Lighting is good.  I like your subject.  8', '2002-08-27 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112214, 4946, 671, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I would have liked to see the focus a little sharper.</td>', 'Great idea, I would have liked to see the focus a little sharper.', '2002-08-27 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112215, 4946, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is a very calming shot. I like the colors and composition. Nice job. (but what''s that shadow in the bottom left corner?)  :o)</td>', 'This is a very calming shot. I like the colors and composition. Nice job. (but what''s that shadow in the bottom left corner?)  :o)', '2002-08-28 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112216, 4946, 2752, '<td valign="top">The composition is good...I like the shadow of the pinwheels...the whole picture gives the feeling of a lazy,hazy summer day.</td>', 'The composition is good...I like the shadow of the pinwheels...the whole picture gives the feeling of a lazy,hazy summer day.', '2002-08-28 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112217, 4946, 3580, '<td valign="top">crop it a little higher up from the bottom, getting rid of the murkyness</td>', 'crop it a little higher up from the bottom, getting rid of the murkyness', '2002-08-28 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112218, 4946, 2123, '<td valign="top">This brings back fond memories!  I almost feel like I''m there...8</td>', 'This brings back fond memories!  I almost feel like I''m there...8', '2002-08-28 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112219, 4946, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excelent job of getting that horizon straight with the top of the frame.  Great framing.  There is definately a lot of childhood in this photo.  The lighting is perfect and that background is beautiful.    I like the angle you chose with the lake in the background.  Is it a lake, or is it an ocean?  Never seen the ocean, but living in michigan, LOTS of lakes. lol Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Excelent job of getting that horizon straight with the top of the frame.  Great framing.  There is definately a lot of childhood in this photo.  The lighting is perfect and that background is beautiful.    I like the angle you chose with the lake in the background.  Is it a lake, or is it an ocean?  Never seen the ocean, but living in michigan, LOTS of lakes. lol Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112220, 4946, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, simple, evocative.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Nice idea, simple, evocative.7, Kavey', '2002-08-30 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112221, 4946, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot - (8)</td>', 'Great shot - (8)', '2002-09-01 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112222, 4946, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background9,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background9,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-09-01 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112223, 4946, 2634, '<td valign="top">This was one of my ideas...didn''t get to the beach though. Nice pict., a little light though(polariser might have helped).</td>', 'This was one of my ideas...didn''t get to the beach though. Nice pict., a little light though(polariser might have helped).', '2002-09-01 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112224, 4947, 1507, '<td valign="top">this picture is depressing...</td>', 'this picture is depressing...', '2002-08-26 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112225, 4947, 3280, '<td valign="top">Disturbing but well thought out.</td>', 'Disturbing but well thought out.', '2002-08-26 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112226, 4947, 2427, '<td valign="top">Oh-oh.</td>', 'Oh-oh.', '2002-08-26 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112227, 4947, 2923, '<td valign="top">I love this photot, very emotional and expressive.<br/><br/>HOwever, the only thing i''d do differently, is to show a bit of the belt behind the shadow + the hand (i.e. use the curtain, a doorway, etc.) and show the texture of the belt....  great idea, wish i''d have though of that!</td>', 'I love this photot, very emotional and expressive.HOwever, the only thing i''d do differently, is to show a bit of the belt behind the shadow + the hand (i.e. use the curtain, a doorway, etc.) and show the texture of the belt....  great idea, wish i''d have though of that!', '2002-08-26 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112228, 4947, 2997, '<td valign="top">Definitely a frightening picture and probably a vivid memory for some.  I don''t like this picture BECAUSE of strong negative emotion it envokes, and that is why it deserves a "10."  However, the image was a bit dark and hard to make out, so I knocked off a point.</td>', 'Definitely a frightening picture and probably a vivid memory for some.  I don''t like this picture BECAUSE of strong negative emotion it envokes, and that is why it deserves a "10."  However, the image was a bit dark and hard to make out, so I knocked off a point.', '2002-08-26 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112229, 4947, 3075, '<td valign="top">Mystifying picture, but can''t make up what it''s suppose to be ?<br/>Artistic however</td>', 'Mystifying picture, but can''t make up what it''s suppose to be ?Artistic however', '2002-08-26 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112230, 4947, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, that bring back bad memories...... Great shot, very, very effective.  The closest thing to a suggestion would be to show the belt buckle, as the belt is the hardest to catch part of this shot and the most necessary!  9 Swash</td>', 'Ohhh, that bring back bad memories...... Great shot, very, very effective.  The closest thing to a suggestion would be to show the belt buckle, as the belt is the hardest to catch part of this shot and the most necessary!  9 Swash', '2002-08-26 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112231, 4947, 3323, '<td valign="top">This is "Children Without Childhood", not "Childhood Without Children".</td>', 'This is "Children Without Childhood", not "Childhood Without Children".', '2002-08-26 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112232, 4947, 2223, '<td valign="top">AHHHHHHH!!!!!</td>', 'AHHHHHHH!!!!!', '2002-08-26 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112233, 4947, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I like the shillouette, nothing more needs to be said.  If you relate as well as I do...I am truely sorry.  However, we learn a lot from our parents.  I learned how NOT to raise my child.  :)  Great depiction of my side of the fence.  Thank you for having the bravery to post.  For those perfect families, they might not "get it"  just ignore it.  YOU know your photo works, I know your photo works.  Ask the millions of social workers out there...they know your photo works.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great photo.  I like the shillouette, nothing more needs to be said.  If you relate as well as I do...I am truely sorry.  However, we learn a lot from our parents.  I learned how NOT to raise my child.  :)  Great depiction of my side of the fence.  Thank you for having the bravery to post.  For those perfect families, they might not "get it"  just ignore it.  YOU know your photo works, I know your photo works.  Ask the millions of social workers out there...they know your photo works.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112234, 4947, 3002, '<td valign="top">This is very sad, especially if the photographer''s thoughts of childhood conjure up this image of a condescending man weilding a belt.   Sadly, while there have been many photographs in this challenge that I feel were not appropriately depicting ''childhood'', this one, for some, does.</td>', 'This is very sad, especially if the photographer''s thoughts of childhood conjure up this image of a condescending man weilding a belt.   Sadly, while there have been many photographs in this challenge that I feel were not appropriately depicting ''childhood'', this one, for some, does.', '2002-08-26 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112235, 4947, 2643, '<td valign="top">Looks like a criminal is breaking into your house!</td>', 'Looks like a criminal is breaking into your house!', '2002-08-27 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112236, 4947, 156, '<td valign="top">ooooh i remember The Strap! all too well heh heh</td>', 'ooooh i remember The Strap! all too well heh heh', '2002-08-27 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112237, 4947, 3516, '<td valign="top">as a daddies girl, I love this. Gives me warm fuzzies</td>', 'as a daddies girl, I love this. Gives me warm fuzzies', '2002-08-27 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112238, 4947, 3540, '<td valign="top">Is this the poster boy for the "parents supporting child abuse?"</td>', 'Is this the poster boy for the "parents supporting child abuse?"', '2002-08-27 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112239, 4947, 2247, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it.  Is this "daddy" taking his belt off to give a child a spanking?  Or is he holding a wooden paddle to do the same thing? What''s happening?</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it.  Is this "daddy" taking his belt off to give a child a spanking?  Or is he holding a wooden paddle to do the same thing? What''s happening?', '2002-08-27 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112240, 4947, 1143, '<td valign="top">This shot just isn''t appealing to me. It''s not the subject matter, but the execution of the idea. I don''t like the coloring (purple?), and it''s hard to really tell what he''s holding.</td>', 'This shot just isn''t appealing to me. It''s not the subject matter, but the execution of the idea. I don''t like the coloring (purple?), and it''s hard to really tell what he''s holding.', '2002-08-28 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112241, 4947, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very well executed...</td>', 'Very well executed...', '2002-08-28 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112242, 4947, 3105, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit, I started laughing when I saw this because it does remind me of childhood ("Don''t make me get my belt!).   Although, I imagine you will get some negative comments from people taking a political stance and saying that capital punishment for kids is wrong or it seems to emphasize abuse.  Hopefully people will think of it in light of the challenge though and keep their politics to themselves.  Did you intentionally place the focus on the background and not the sillouette?<br/>Good job of portraying the subject in a different manner.<br/>Courtenay</td>', 'I''ll admit, I started laughing when I saw this because it does remind me of childhood ("Don''t make me get my belt!).   Although, I imagine you will get some negative comments from people taking a political stance and saying that capital punishment for kids is wrong or it seems to emphasize abuse.  Hopefully people will think of it in light of the challenge though and keep their politics to themselves.  Did you intentionally place the focus on the background and not the sillouette?Good job of portraying the subject in a different manner.Courtenay', '2002-08-28 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112243, 4947, 811, '<td valign="top">Provocative and powerful.  Very dark, but I think that helps the overall effect. karmat</td>', 'Provocative and powerful.  Very dark, but I think that helps the overall effect. karmat', '2002-08-28 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112244, 4947, 3469, '<td valign="top">Horrible picture, as intended. Still, the combination of an open hand as if to slap and a belt being taken off to hit is unbelievable to me as an observer. Great idea for a picture, though, standing out of the pack of teddy bears and swings.</td>', 'Horrible picture, as intended. Still, the combination of an open hand as if to slap and a belt being taken off to hit is unbelievable to me as an observer. Great idea for a picture, though, standing out of the pack of teddy bears and swings.', '2002-08-28 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(112245, 4947, 2586, '<td valign="top">Very emotional picture and I appreciate that you portrayed it in stark silhouette rather than sentimentalizing or turning it into a cloy picture. I also congratulate you on the courage to show this picture. For many children this IS childhood and they cannot escape from it. So, I appreciate this image so much more than all those bloody snapshots with toys and cutesy things. Showing it as a silhouette enhances the power of the image and it shows so sharply how kid in such a situation feels by being overmastered by this dark, fearful "authority figure". Interesting, too, how you managed to convey the object being a belt by that one belt hole! Thank you (I suspect this image is way above the heads of the bright color, easy picture loving dpc crowd. 8 Journey</td>', 'Very emotional picture and I appreciate that you portrayed it in stark silhouette rather than sentimentalizing or turning it into a cloy picture. I also congratulate you on the courage to show this picture. For many children this IS childhood and they cannot escape from it. So, I appreciate this image so much more than all those bloody snapshots with toys and cutesy things. Showing it as a silhouette enhances the power of the image and it shows so sharply how kid in such a situation feels by being overmastered by this dark, fearful "authority figure". Interesting, too, how you managed to convey the object being a belt by that one belt hole! Thank you (I suspect this image is way above the heads of the bright color, easy picture loving dpc crowd. 8 Journey', '2002-08-28 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112246, 4947, 1827, '<td valign="top">The idea of this photo is strong.  The helplessness of childhood and in certain cases the domination of parents speaks to the topic I think.  The silhouette works for me even as a child frightened of the wrath of the dfather might not even see Daddy so much as the shape of daddy''s hand and the belt.  The only contructive suggestion I have is perhaps to lose the vertical blinds.  They just seem out of place.  I can''t quite put my finger on on what it is that bothers me about them, and I almost didn''t comment for this reason, but in the end they bother me.  7, just-married</td>', 'The idea of this photo is strong.  The helplessness of childhood and in certain cases the domination of parents speaks to the topic I think.  The silhouette works for me even as a child frightened of the wrath of the dfather might not even see Daddy so much as the shape of daddy''s hand and the belt.  The only contructive suggestion I have is perhaps to lose the vertical blinds.  They just seem out of place.  I can''t quite put my finger on on what it is that bothers me about them, and I almost didn''t comment for this reason, but in the end they bother me.  7, just-married', '2002-08-28 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112247, 4947, 806, '<td valign="top">Scary. This would''ve been good for "fear" as well. Anyway,... unfortunately this is true for too many in their childhood. Good composition and emotive subject.</td>', 'Scary. This would''ve been good for "fear" as well. Anyway,... unfortunately this is true for too many in their childhood. Good composition and emotive subject.', '2002-08-29 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112248, 4947, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great job of creating a powerful concept with just a shadow.</td>', 'Great job of creating a powerful concept with just a shadow.', '2002-08-29 07:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112249, 4947, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-29 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112250, 4947, 2752, '<td valign="top">VERY DRAMATIC ...GOOD COMPOSITION..CHILLING STORY.</td>', 'VERY DRAMATIC ...GOOD COMPOSITION..CHILLING STORY.', '2002-08-29 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112251, 4947, 3616, '<td valign="top">Good God.  Those venetian blinds are filthy.  <br/><br/>Depressing.</td>', 'Good God.  Those venetian blinds are filthy.  Depressing.', '2002-08-29 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112252, 4947, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a really graphic picture and the strong silhouette is very striking (no I am not trying to play on words). I imagine the background has been chosen deliberately to add strong vertical lines to the composition but I don''t like it - it makes me think of an office rather than a home where this would be taking place.<br/>The light through the belt hole is an excellent detail.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'This is a really graphic picture and the strong silhouette is very striking (no I am not trying to play on words). I imagine the background has been chosen deliberately to add strong vertical lines to the composition but I don''t like it - it makes me think of an office rather than a home where this would be taking place.The light through the belt hole is an excellent detail.6, Kavey', '2002-08-30 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112253, 4947, 772, '<td valign="top">Nicely done shot here :)  I try to think of more happy times in my childhood and the childhood of others... You have done a very nice job of relaying your thoughts here though :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nicely done shot here :)  I try to think of more happy times in my childhood and the childhood of others... You have done a very nice job of relaying your thoughts here though :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-30 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112254, 4947, 2928, '<td valign="top">It got a reaction.  OK, so I dont like the content  I find it scary, oppressive and almost on the point of evil It gave me goose bumps.    Having said that, not liking something doesnt mean it doesnt exist, nor does it mean that it should be excluded on the grounds content Because of my reaction to this shot, I have to say that the technical side of this picture is  in my opinion - of a very high standard  and it does meet the challenge.  The clever use of lighting and composition have indeed brought out the worst in this image Great camera work  gutsy shot (10)</td>', 'It got a reaction.  OK, so I dont like the content  I find it scary, oppressive and almost on the point of evil It gave me goose bumps.    Having said that, not liking something doesnt mean it doesnt exist, nor does it mean that it should be excluded on the grounds content Because of my reaction to this shot, I have to say that the technical side of this picture is  in my opinion - of a very high standard  and it does meet the challenge.  The clever use of lighting and composition have indeed brought out the worst in this image Great camera work  gutsy shot (10)', '2002-08-31 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112255, 4947, 2261, '<td valign="top">Is daddy an axe murderer?</td>', 'Is daddy an axe murderer?', '2002-08-31 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112256, 4947, 2279, '<td valign="top">I definately like the silouette of the man but I wish the belt wasn''t so blocked. 7.</td>', 'I definately like the silouette of the man but I wish the belt wasn''t so blocked. 7.', '2002-09-01 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112257, 4947, 1543, '<td valign="top">brings back memories!</td>', 'brings back memories!', '2002-09-01 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112258, 4947, 1054, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing but powerful.  Sadly this is a big park of many childhoods and you conveyed the image well.  High marks from me.</td>', 'Very disturbing but powerful.  Sadly this is a big park of many childhoods and you conveyed the image well.  High marks from me.', '2002-09-02 00:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112259, 4947, 2221, '<td valign="top">I liked your photo very much. Don''t give up. The score from average voters is sometimes a riddle.</td>', 'I liked your photo very much. Don''t give up. The score from average voters is sometimes a riddle.', '2002-09-02 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112260, 4948, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an EXCELLENT photograph.  I love the black and white and the contrast is excellent... This photo fails to meet the challenge, IMHO, because it has a child in the photo.  - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an EXCELLENT photograph.  I love the black and white and the contrast is excellent... This photo fails to meet the challenge, IMHO, because it has a child in the photo.  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112261, 4948, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat picture. B&amp;W makes it even better but its supposed to be without children so i subtracted a few points for that. 4.</td>', 'This is a really neat picture. B&W makes it even better but its supposed to be without children so i subtracted a few points for that. 4.', '2002-08-26 02:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112262, 4948, 3178, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that a child?</td>', 'Isn''t that a child?', '2002-08-26 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112263, 4948, 3208, '<td valign="top">Yes, it does look like a child.  Really, how tall are you? :0)</td>', 'Yes, it does look like a child.  Really, how tall are you? :0)', '2002-08-26 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112264, 4948, 157, '<td valign="top">Great shot, it''s too bad you have a child in there...I''m sure you''re going to get a gazillion comments about it ;)</td>', 'Great shot, it''s too bad you have a child in there...I''m sure you''re going to get a gazillion comments about it ;)', '2002-08-26 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112265, 4948, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF and the B&amp;W here. Moody. I know this feeling.....really rings a bell with me. Score 7 Kee</td>', 'Love the DOF and the B&W here. Moody. I know this feeling.....really rings a bell with me. Score 7 Kee', '2002-08-26 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
