(112271, 4948, 3075, '<td valign="top">Am i mistaken or is a kid sitting on that swing ?<br/>Like the B&amp;W touch but i am not sure if this is a legal picture for this challenge since it states showing childhood WITHOUT children. Anyway picture is nice!</td>', 'Am i mistaken or is a kid sitting on that swing ?Like the B&W touch but i am not sure if this is a legal picture for this challenge since it states showing childhood WITHOUT children. Anyway picture is nice!', '2002-08-26 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
