(112274, 4948, 3087, '<td valign="top">My thoughts were that this photo represents an adult playing a kid, but it''s been pointed out that it could equally be an adult reminiscing about their childhood. Good point! Didn''t think of it!<br/>For the photo itself, I like it. I like the play of light on the ground, the low perspective and the inclusion of the empty swing beside the other one. Overall it''s a little dark, but perhaps that''s intentional, to capture the mood?<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'My thoughts were that this photo represents an adult playing a kid, but it''s been pointed out that it could equally be an adult reminiscing about their childhood. Good point! Didn''t think of it!For the photo itself, I like it. I like the play of light on the ground, the low perspective and the inclusion of the empty swing beside the other one. Overall it''s a little dark, but perhaps that''s intentional, to capture the mood?5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
