(112286, 4948, 280, '<td valign="top">OK. Let me first of all say that this is not a child (its me) nor was intended to look like a child. The idea of the photo was that, I am in a place where I played as a child reminiscing about my childhood.  I guess I didnt make this clear in the shot and thats why it suffered. : (</td>', 'OK. Let me first of all say that this is not a child (its me) nor was intended to look like a child. The idea of the photo was that, I am in a place where I played as a child reminiscing about my childhood.  I guess I didnt make this clear in the shot and thats why it suffered. : (', '2002-09-02 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 0),
