(112306, 4949, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what you''re trying to portray here, unless it''s the fact that he still needs his toast cut up. LOL.  I''ll give that to you.  :)  I cut my hubby''s food into little pieces now that we have a 2 year old. strange how that happens.  the angle is good, however I wish that the placemat were just a little straighter.  I am curious to know what the thing int he middle of the plate is.  I feel like I''ve been hiding under a rock with all the "different" things I see every day.  LIghting is great and I like the placement of everything.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not really sure what you''re trying to portray here, unless it''s the fact that he still needs his toast cut up. LOL.  I''ll give that to you.  :)  I cut my hubby''s food into little pieces now that we have a 2 year old. strange how that happens.  the angle is good, however I wish that the placemat were just a little straighter.  I am curious to know what the thing int he middle of the plate is.  I feel like I''ve been hiding under a rock with all the "different" things I see every day.  LIghting is great and I like the placement of everything.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
