(112382, 4954, 772, '<td valign="top">I can see it, but the childhood element of this photo is a little weak... The challenge was to ''capture your impression of childhood''.... Is this gate across the walkway your impression of childhood?  I can see how it is an impression of childhood, but I would love to have seen something a bit stronger as a childhood impression :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I can see it, but the childhood element of this photo is a little weak... The challenge was to ''capture your impression of childhood''.... Is this gate across the walkway your impression of childhood?  I can see how it is an impression of childhood, but I would love to have seen something a bit stronger as a childhood impression :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
