(112406, 4955, 2815, '<td valign="top">When I was a kid I always wanted to have the window seat.   Good Shot!!<br/>(8)</td>', 'When I was a kid I always wanted to have the window seat.   Good Shot!!(8)', '2002-08-26 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112407, 4955, 3075, '<td valign="top">As a child i always wanted the window seat! Also the b&amp;w adds to the feeling of days long gone by!<br/></td>', 'As a child i always wanted the window seat! Also the b&w adds to the feeling of days long gone by!', '2002-08-26 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112408, 4955, 2717, '<td valign="top">Lots of memories in this one....7</td>', 'Lots of memories in this one....7', '2002-08-26 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112409, 4955, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, does this ever bring back memories.  And some of them not so good !!  Excellent shot, LOVE the sepia, and the composition.  Good work! lhall</td>', 'Wow, does this ever bring back memories.  And some of them not so good !!  Excellent shot, LOVE the sepia, and the composition.  Good work! lhall', '2002-08-27 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112410, 4955, 3044, '<td valign="top">wonderul. great idea. great tones. great composition. great photo. 10. wish i could give it an 11.</td>', 'wonderul. great idea. great tones. great composition. great photo. 10. wish i could give it an 11.', '2002-08-27 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112411, 4955, 2997, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I can''t see how you could have "driven home" the idea any better.<br/><br/>I''m not sure I fully understand the rule of 3rds, but the front of the bus does sort of intersect there.  The horizon is nice and straight.  The angle is great. Bravo.</td>', 'Very nice.  I can''t see how you could have "driven home" the idea any better.I''m not sure I fully understand the rule of 3rds, but the front of the bus does sort of intersect there.  The horizon is nice and straight.  The angle is great. Bravo.', '2002-08-27 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112412, 4955, 2866, '<td valign="top">This captures the theme nicely.</td>', 'This captures the theme nicely.', '2002-08-27 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112413, 4955, 1856, '<td valign="top">This is a great b&amp;w.  Very strong on topic.  I love the contrasts and the texture on the seat.  Awesome job!  10 Lisa</td>', 'This is a great b&w.  Very strong on topic.  I love the contrasts and the texture on the seat.  Awesome job!  10 Lisa', '2002-08-27 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112414, 4955, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like how clearly you can see the texture of the seat.</td>', 'I like how clearly you can see the texture of the seat.', '2002-08-27 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112415, 4955, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo.  You really captured the spirit of childhood here.</td>', 'Awesome photo.  You really captured the spirit of childhood here.', '2002-08-27 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112416, 4955, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. It captures the theme well. Also like the B&amp;W. A different angle that prevented cutting the top off of the other bus would be nice.</td>', 'I really like this one. It captures the theme well. Also like the B&W. A different angle that prevented cutting the top off of the other bus would be nice.', '2002-08-28 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112417, 4955, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo... I love it :)  The black and white works very well also.  The only critique I have is that I wish I could see just a little more detail inside the bus.  Maybe a smaller aperture would have helped some, but it looks like you were probably already as small as you could go based on the clarity of the subjects outside the window :)  Excellent shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is a great photo... I love it :)  The black and white works very well also.  The only critique I have is that I wish I could see just a little more detail inside the bus.  Maybe a smaller aperture would have helped some, but it looks like you were probably already as small as you could go based on the clarity of the subjects outside the window :)  Excellent shot :) = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-28 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112418, 4955, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The texture in the seat is great.  I also like how you are looking out the window at another bus, just in case you couldn''t figure out what kind of window you were looking out.  I would like to see how it looked in color to see why you went with black and white for this photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The texture in the seat is great.  I also like how you are looking out the window at another bus, just in case you couldn''t figure out what kind of window you were looking out.  I would like to see how it looked in color to see why you went with black and white for this photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-28 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112419, 4955, 1024, '<td valign="top">wow, this brings back memories of childhood for me.  Composition well done, lighting great.  8 BAMartin</td>', 'wow, this brings back memories of childhood for me.  Composition well done, lighting great.  8 BAMartin', '2002-08-28 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112420, 4955, 3419, '<td valign="top">Yup - I remember travelling the school bus too! Nice focus and composition.</td>', 'Yup - I remember travelling the school bus too! Nice focus and composition.', '2002-08-29 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112421, 4955, 2634, '<td valign="top">The use of B&amp;W is great in this photo. Gives it a feeling of the past and thinking back to it. Interesting composition too. Good job. TG</td>', 'The use of B&W is great in this photo. Gives it a feeling of the past and thinking back to it. Interesting composition too. Good job. TG', '2002-08-29 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112422, 4955, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice and a very interesting position to take the shot from. I really like it. 9 - floyd<br/></td>', 'Good subject choice and a very interesting position to take the shot from. I really like it. 9 - floyd', '2002-08-29 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112423, 4955, 2223, '<td valign="top">ahhh..the bus ride was always an adventure. nice.</td>', 'ahhh..the bus ride was always an adventure. nice.', '2002-08-29 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112424, 4955, 2667, '<td valign="top">nice composition, i like the way the windows lead me through the photo. (6)  ~mcmurma</td>', 'nice composition, i like the way the windows lead me through the photo. (6)  ~mcmurma', '2002-08-30 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112425, 4955, 2204, '<td valign="top">I never rode a bus to school so I am trying to read this photo just for it''s merits as a photo and this is what I see......nice clear shot, The back of the seat is very detailed and the darkness at the bottom of the photo adds to the imagination of the subject, the B&amp;W transitions the photo to invoke feelings of childhood memory in neither a positive or negative way.  For me it just IS.  The view through the window remains clear and creates a schoolyard atmosphere.  There are no distracting highlights or shadows.  The ROT is set up wonderfully. There is still something not completely satisfying about this photo and I don''t think it has much to do with you as the photographer.   Some improvements, (strictly subjective as a viewer) .......It might have been better if the background Bus was parked much closer,  I''m not totally thrilled with the background content through the windows.  =8 syamjonimi  ;''-D</td>', 'I never rode a bus to school so I am trying to read this photo just for it''s merits as a photo and this is what I see......nice clear shot, The back of the seat is very detailed and the darkness at the bottom of the photo adds to the imagination of the subject, the B&W transitions the photo to invoke feelings of childhood memory in neither a positive or negative way.  For me it just IS.  The view through the window remains clear and creates a schoolyard atmosphere.  There are no distracting highlights or shadows.  The ROT is set up wonderfully. There is still something not completely satisfying about this photo and I don''t think it has much to do with you as the photographer.   Some improvements, (strictly subjective as a viewer) .......It might have been better if the background Bus was parked much closer,  I''m not totally thrilled with the background content through the windows.  =8 syamjonimi  ;''-D', '2002-08-30 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112426, 4955, 2427, '<td valign="top">interesting view point.  I ight have positioned the other bus a little differently in the windows, but that''s me.  I like the use of monochromse here.  The texture on the seat is a nice touch too. - 6</td>', 'interesting view point.  I ight have positioned the other bus a little differently in the windows, but that''s me.  I like the use of monochromse here.  The texture on the seat is a nice touch too. - 6', '2002-08-30 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112427, 4955, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, and unusual to be taken from inside a bus with the windows framing the exterior part. Slightly too dark inside for me, but I imagine it would have been too overexposed outside if it had been adjusted for inside?<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Interesting photo, and unusual to be taken from inside a bus with the windows framing the exterior part. Slightly too dark inside for me, but I imagine it would have been too overexposed outside if it had been adjusted for inside?7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112428, 4955, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a really good picture. The windows just lead me through the photo. And the B&amp;W makes it seem like just an old memory. 8.</td>', 'This is a really good picture. The windows just lead me through the photo. And the B&W makes it seem like just an old memory. 8.', '2002-08-31 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112429, 4955, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-01 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112430, 4955, 714, '<td valign="top">I just have one question.  Why do the texture the seat covers?  :)  They haven''t changed since I rode in one when I was a child.  Nice way to capture childhood.  I can''t  believe they actually let you in there.  My bus driver was strict.</td>', 'I just have one question.  Why do the texture the seat covers?  :)  They haven''t changed since I rode in one when I was a child.  Nice way to capture childhood.  I can''t  believe they actually let you in there.  My bus driver was strict.', '2002-09-03 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112431, 4956, 1877, '<td valign="top">i love the lighting and position of the bowl/chair.... I can remember trying to eat my breakfast as soon as i could so i could get outside and play. love the shot, one of my faves 10</td>', 'i love the lighting and position of the bowl/chair.... I can remember trying to eat my breakfast as soon as i could so i could get outside and play. love the shot, one of my faves 10', '2002-08-26 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
