(112485, 4958, 3080, '<td valign="top">Simple and to the point.  Great depiction of childhood.  i don''t know how many unclaimed shovels I see at beaches just lying around waiting for the next kid to come along and play with it.  Lighting and clarity are great.  Perfect focus.  might I also comment on your full usage of the maximum file size allowed.  i see a lot of photos that don''t use that to their advantage.  great placement in the frame and over all really nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Simple and to the point.  Great depiction of childhood.  i don''t know how many unclaimed shovels I see at beaches just lying around waiting for the next kid to come along and play with it.  Lighting and clarity are great.  Perfect focus.  might I also comment on your full usage of the maximum file size allowed.  i see a lot of photos that don''t use that to their advantage.  great placement in the frame and over all really nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112486, 4958, 2337, '<td valign="top">Composition and concept wonderful!  Great texture...</td>', 'Composition and concept wonderful!  Great texture...', '2002-08-27 05:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
