(112602, 4964, 3087, '<td valign="top">Woo! Lovely sunset. Did you make the plane out of foil to get the reflections on it? I was confused, as it seemed the side of the plane nearest to us was reflecting things which were behind it, then I decided maybe the mountains continue round behind the photographer and there is another palm tree. But I am not really sure! <br/>Please let me/ us know.<br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Woo! Lovely sunset. Did you make the plane out of foil to get the reflections on it? I was confused, as it seemed the side of the plane nearest to us was reflecting things which were behind it, then I decided maybe the mountains continue round behind the photographer and there is another palm tree. But I am not really sure! Please let me/ us know.7, Kavey', '2002-08-30 06:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
