(112621, 4965, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo, but I find myself ''searching'' for the subject matter... There is not much contrast in this image... everything seems to blend together.  I think that this could have possibly used a few adjustments to contrast and brightness to make it puhch a little harder :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting photo, but I find myself ''searching'' for the subject matter... There is not much contrast in this image... everything seems to blend together.  I think that this could have possibly used a few adjustments to contrast and brightness to make it puhch a little harder :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112622, 4965, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sad, very sad photo.  The clutter of the background makes the subjects harder to see clearly.  Is the fence referring to the title or did something bad happen to the child?  If the fence connects to the title, it''s a good thing, if not, not so good.<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Sad, very sad photo.  The clutter of the background makes the subjects harder to see clearly.  Is the fence referring to the title or did something bad happen to the child?  If the fence connects to the title, it''s a good thing, if not, not so good.7 Swash', '2002-08-27 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112623, 4965, 3087, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the fence, although I appreciate fully it''s significance in the subject matter. I like the overgrown nature of the shot, and the b/w really conveys the sadness and bleakness.<br/>On the composition front I am struggling with a point of focus between both the slide and the other ride thing, and the cactii - the shot seems to busy for me.<br/>PS. what is the correct plural for cactus? <br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I don''t like the fence, although I appreciate fully it''s significance in the subject matter. I like the overgrown nature of the shot, and the b/w really conveys the sadness and bleakness.On the composition front I am struggling with a point of focus between both the slide and the other ride thing, and the cactii - the shot seems to busy for me.PS. what is the correct plural for cactus? 5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112624, 4965, 3554, '<td valign="top">This one doesn''t convey childhood to me.  I don''t understand the title with the photo.</td>', 'This one doesn''t convey childhood to me.  I don''t understand the title with the photo.', '2002-08-27 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112625, 4965, 3469, '<td valign="top">The fence does it, well done!</td>', 'The fence does it, well done!', '2002-08-28 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112626, 4965, 3419, '<td valign="top">Sad to see such neglect..... nicely portrayed in this greyish shot.</td>', 'Sad to see such neglect..... nicely portrayed in this greyish shot.', '2002-08-29 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112627, 4965, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,<br/>Total Averaged Rating5.   Autool<br/>I feel so sad for you.  My idea of childhood differs greatly.</td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background5,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?3,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 4,Total Averaged Rating5.   AutoolI feel so sad for you.  My idea of childhood differs greatly.', '2002-08-29 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112628, 4965, 2798, '<td valign="top">The fence in the foreground is good but the swing and slide are blending into their surroundings. More contrast maybe? Perhaps make things gloomier too in view of the subject matter. 7 - floyd</td>', 'The fence in the foreground is good but the swing and slide are blending into their surroundings. More contrast maybe? Perhaps make things gloomier too in view of the subject matter. 7 - floyd', '2002-08-30 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112629, 4965, 554, '<td valign="top">Very sad and thought provoking. Say it isn''t so, but I fear it is.  (well done)</td>', 'Very sad and thought provoking. Say it isn''t so, but I fear it is.  (well done)', '2002-08-31 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112630, 4965, 2279, '<td valign="top">Good choice of B&amp;W. Could be a little sharper focus on the slide and swing but other than that good job. 7.</td>', 'Good choice of B&W. Could be a little sharper focus on the slide and swing but other than that good job. 7.', '2002-08-31 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112631, 4965, 2928, '<td valign="top">Oh, so sad... Great atmosphere and composition, good use of B&amp;W...</td>', 'Oh, so sad... Great atmosphere and composition, good use of B&W...', '2002-09-01 04:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112632, 4965, 1054, '<td valign="top">The b/w and weak contrast here make it difficult to distinguish the subject from the backgrounnd.  Color, more contrast and/or different lighting (time of day) may have improved this shot.</td>', 'The b/w and weak contrast here make it difficult to distinguish the subject from the backgrounnd.  Color, more contrast and/or different lighting (time of day) may have improved this shot.', '2002-09-02 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112633, 4966, 51167, '<td valign="top">Who would have thought.  I actually thought about pulling out the tree and putting lights on it for this challenge.  I got lazy and didn''t do it.  Great idea for the challenge.  I think christmas is some of the best childhood memories.</td>', 'Who would have thought.  I actually thought about pulling out the tree and putting lights on it for this challenge.  I got lazy and didn''t do it.  Great idea for the challenge.  I think christmas is some of the best childhood memories.', '2002-08-26 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112634, 4966, 3448, '<td valign="top">Photo is a little on the dark side.</td>', 'Photo is a little on the dark side.', '2002-08-26 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112635, 4966, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the candy canes, they look really good.  The bear might be in focus, it''s fuzzy appearance could be due to it''s own fuzziness (did that make sense?)  The gold ribbon seems "off", esp. at the top of the frame (what is going on there?)  I like most of the rest of it.  7 Swash</td>', 'I like the candy canes, they look really good.  The bear might be in focus, it''s fuzzy appearance could be due to it''s own fuzziness (did that make sense?)  The gold ribbon seems "off", esp. at the top of the frame (what is going on there?)  I like most of the rest of it.  7 Swash', '2002-08-26 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112636, 4966, 2881, '<td valign="top">Needs to be brighter and happier</td>', 'Needs to be brighter and happier', '2002-08-26 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112637, 4966, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The angle and focus are great.  I like the little touch of light at the top.  it kind of represents a christmas light, without actually seeing one.  The little pine tree branches work really great in creating a country christmas kind of look.  Excelent photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The angle and focus are great.  I like the little touch of light at the top.  it kind of represents a christmas light, without actually seeing one.  The little pine tree branches work really great in creating a country christmas kind of look.  Excelent photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112638, 4966, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you an extra point for setting up your Xmas tree in August (assuming you followed the rules of the contest)!</td>', 'I''ll give you an extra point for setting up your Xmas tree in August (assuming you followed the rules of the contest)!', '2002-08-26 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
