(112659, 4967, 3087, '<td valign="top">I adore this, I love the colours and intensity of the sky and the way the clouds below break open into blue blue sky at the top. It gives a real sense of rising. I really love the bubbles - with their rainbow "petrol" colours and reflected sunlight. This is a definite 10 for me. Kavey</td>', 'I adore this, I love the colours and intensity of the sky and the way the clouds below break open into blue blue sky at the top. It gives a real sense of rising. I really love the bubbles - with their rainbow "petrol" colours and reflected sunlight. This is a definite 10 for me. Kavey', '2002-08-26 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112660, 4967, 3448, '<td valign="top">Absolutely breathtaking! The colors look great, one of the best compositions I''ve seen so far. 10.</td>', 'Absolutely breathtaking! The colors look great, one of the best compositions I''ve seen so far. 10.', '2002-08-26 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112661, 4967, 82, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2002-08-26 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
