(112663, 4967, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very great photo.  I love how the background is the sky.  he little rainbows in the bubbles ad nice subtle color.  Angle and placement are great.  Lighting was perfect for this photo.  You will probably get different views of the dark clouds at the bottom, but I like them.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very great photo.  I love how the background is the sky.  he little rainbows in the bubbles ad nice subtle color.  Angle and placement are great.  Lighting was perfect for this photo.  You will probably get different views of the dark clouds at the bottom, but I like them.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112664, 4967, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!!!  Very nice bubbles!  Great color!  This has a wonderful feeling.  <br/>10 Swash</td>', 'Wonderful!!!!  Very nice bubbles!  Great color!  This has a wonderful feeling.  10 Swash', '2002-08-26 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
