(112668, 4967, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the bubbles against the backdrop of the sky.  The colors of the bubbles come across so well.  Love how you got the bubbles all "composed" so well in the shot! :) lhall</td>', 'Love the bubbles against the backdrop of the sky.  The colors of the bubbles come across so well.  Love how you got the bubbles all "composed" so well in the shot! :) lhall', '2002-08-27 06:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
