(112694, 4967, 2221, '<td valign="top">Very good. I know how difficult it is to phorograph bubbles in the sky. It''s good that you chose a more narrow DOF. That way I can see some depth and that some bubble are nearer than others. Good work!<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Very good. I know how difficult it is to phorograph bubbles in the sky. It''s good that you chose a more narrow DOF. That way I can see some depth and that some bubble are nearer than others. Good work!-stephan', '2002-08-31 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
