(112706, 4967, 2667, '<td valign="top">I had to pick my jaw up off the floor after seeing that ''Carefree'' won this challenge. I really had no expectations that this shot would win...especially after all the controversy surrounding the challenge interpretations. Nevertheless I am delighted. Thanks to everyone for all the marvelous comments!</td>', 'I had to pick my jaw up off the floor after seeing that ''Carefree'' won this challenge. I really had no expectations that this shot would win...especially after all the controversy surrounding the challenge interpretations. Nevertheless I am delighted. Thanks to everyone for all the marvelous comments!', '2002-09-02 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112707, 4967, 2752, '<td valign="top">This was my very favorite..so uplifting and well done.  The irredescent bubbles contrasting against the sky and clouds made this an easy choice for me.  Congrats!</td>', 'This was my very favorite..so uplifting and well done.  The irredescent bubbles contrasting against the sky and clouds made this an easy choice for me.  Congrats!', '2002-09-02 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112708, 4967, 2173, '<td valign="top">its magical....</td>', 'its magical....', '2002-09-02 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112709, 4967, 1993, '<td valign="top">Funny thing...I LIKE the gray clouds.  They remind me of when the rain stops....and as a child, that meant we could go outside and play again...to blow bubbles.  (And, I personally had thought of cloud-watching as a childhood memory, so this is really nice)</td>', 'Funny thing...I LIKE the gray clouds.  They remind me of when the rain stops....and as a child, that meant we could go outside and play again...to blow bubbles.  (And, I personally had thought of cloud-watching as a childhood memory, so this is really nice)', '2002-09-06 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112710, 4969, 2764, '<td valign="top">Would have been better without the truck. it''s too light and distracting,  Without it the colors are stunning.</td>', 'Would have been better without the truck. it''s too light and distracting,  Without it the colors are stunning.', '2002-08-26 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112711, 4969, 327, '<td valign="top">lol Well done. Very creative, good composition. Score 7 Justine</td>', 'lol Well done. Very creative, good composition. Score 7 Justine', '2002-08-26 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
