(112713, 4969, 2881, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and love the colors.  Simplify it a bit more. I would have left out the toy, and maybe tipped one of the boots over.  You probably tried all sorts of variations though, I know I usually do when I have an idea and want to get it just "so".</td>', 'Great idea, and love the colors.  Simplify it a bit more. I would have left out the toy, and maybe tipped one of the boots over.  You probably tried all sorts of variations though, I know I usually do when I have an idea and want to get it just "so".', '2002-08-26 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
