(112728, 4970, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot!  I like the bear... my only comment is the overall yellow glow... I don''t know if this was intentional or not, but if your camera has white balance settings, they may have been useful on this photo to correct the color... :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'interesting shot!  I like the bear... my only comment is the overall yellow glow... I don''t know if this was intentional or not, but if your camera has white balance settings, they may have been useful on this photo to correct the color... :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
