(112733, 4970, 3080, '<td valign="top">I hope your bear is doing better than mine.  I dont think people like bears. LOL  Personally, I love it.  The angle on yours is great.  He looks so soft.  Like he''s one of the overyly soft, kind of oily feeling ones.  The lighting is good, I think i would have liked to have seen the lighting spread out evenly over the bear.  His head seems a slight bit darker than his feet, like the light source was coming from the front, like a flash.  If you were trying to get him perfectly centered, he needs to scoot a tad bit to the left. (his right)  Otherwise, a very well executed photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I hope your bear is doing better than mine.  I dont think people like bears. LOL  Personally, I love it.  The angle on yours is great.  He looks so soft.  Like he''s one of the overyly soft, kind of oily feeling ones.  The lighting is good, I think i would have liked to have seen the lighting spread out evenly over the bear.  His head seems a slight bit darker than his feet, like the light source was coming from the front, like a flash.  If you were trying to get him perfectly centered, he needs to scoot a tad bit to the left. (his right)  Otherwise, a very well executed photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
