(112772, 4977, 3002, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but strange as there are hardly any shadows in the pic, and the jacks look cloned in.</td>', 'Nice idea, but strange as there are hardly any shadows in the pic, and the jacks look cloned in.', '2002-08-26 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112773, 4977, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - cute title!</td>', 'Nice shot - cute title!', '2002-08-26 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112774, 4977, 2553, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple.  I love the lighting.  Something about the composition throws me off a little - I think it''s the way everything seems to be bunched towards the center horizontal.  I really like this perspective on "childhood". lhall</td>', 'Clean and simple.  I love the lighting.  Something about the composition throws me off a little - I think it''s the way everything seems to be bunched towards the center horizontal.  I really like this perspective on "childhood". lhall', '2002-08-27 06:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112775, 4977, 133, '<td valign="top">A cool close up.  Interesting lighting.</td>', 'A cool close up.  Interesting lighting.', '2002-08-27 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112776, 4977, 3542, '<td valign="top">Really like the title!</td>', 'Really like the title!', '2002-08-27 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112777, 4977, 3127, '<td valign="top">I like the way the ball and jacks appear suspended in air. Good pic!</td>', 'I like the way the ball and jacks appear suspended in air. Good pic!', '2002-08-27 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112778, 4977, 1005, '<td valign="top">A bit stark, don''t you think?  (as in bare)  Your elements are very clear, but to me, an activity needs motion or the more story to explain the game.  Anaseptic 7 Swash</td>', 'A bit stark, don''t you think?  (as in bare)  Your elements are very clear, but to me, an activity needs motion or the more story to explain the game.  Anaseptic 7 Swash', '2002-08-27 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112779, 4977, 2472, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition...</td>', 'beautiful composition...', '2002-08-27 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112780, 4977, 2158, '<td valign="top">This may sound strange, but I find this looks too arranged - too tidy.</td>', 'This may sound strange, but I find this looks too arranged - too tidy.', '2002-08-27 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112781, 4977, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background8,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating8.   Autool', '2002-08-27 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112782, 4977, 1454, '<td valign="top">I liked it! nice illumination!</td>', 'I liked it! nice illumination!', '2002-08-28 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112783, 4977, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and composition.  Also, the high contrast makes it look as if everything is suspended.  That is awesome.  good work. karmat</td>', 'I like the colors and composition.  Also, the high contrast makes it look as if everything is suspended.  That is awesome.  good work. karmat', '2002-08-28 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112784, 4977, 3573, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2002-08-29 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112785, 4977, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot - great title...</td>', 'Great shot - great title...', '2002-08-29 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112786, 4977, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice work with the background :)  I like the effect quite a bit... good photo for this challenge :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'Nice work with the background :)  I like the effect quite a bit... good photo for this challenge :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-29 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112787, 4977, 3111, '<td valign="top">If this was a white background, I would have liked to see some shadows, I suspect you bled out the contrast.  The ball looks great - red on an otherwise b&amp;w photo.</td>', 'If this was a white background, I would have liked to see some shadows, I suspect you bled out the contrast.  The ball looks great - red on an otherwise b&w photo.', '2002-08-29 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112788, 4977, 2079, '<td valign="top">I like this. The white works well here. A couple of wrinkles in the cloth should be hidden. layout is good, color is good. But the jacks all seem to be facing in a uniform direction. I wonder if it would add a little pizzaz to random the positions a bit? - Good Luck, 8 (Gotcha)</td>', 'I like this. The white works well here. A couple of wrinkles in the cloth should be hidden. layout is good, color is good. But the jacks all seem to be facing in a uniform direction. I wonder if it would add a little pizzaz to random the positions a bit? - Good Luck, 8 (Gotcha)', '2002-08-30 03:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112789, 4977, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely clean white background and still good light on the jacks and ball. Like it. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Lovely clean white background and still good light on the jacks and ball. Like it. 8 - floyd', '2002-08-30 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112790, 4977, 2857, '<td valign="top">cool shot. looks very outer-spacey.</td>', 'cool shot. looks very outer-spacey.', '2002-08-30 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112791, 4977, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks like it either had some upload problems, or it was post edited way too much.  I am leaning towards post editing because there are shadows on some of them, but the shadows are washed out on the others.  I know this is sometimes done to "erase" the background and if this were the case, you definately did a good job of erasing the background.  There is a blemish of some sort up in t he upper right corner, but other than that, the angle is great and lighting is good.  I like how there are no shadows on some of them, but i would like to have seen no shadows on all of them, but that would probably take a lot away from the photo.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like it either had some upload problems, or it was post edited way too much.  I am leaning towards post editing because there are shadows on some of them, but the shadows are washed out on the others.  I know this is sometimes done to "erase" the background and if this were the case, you definately did a good job of erasing the background.  There is a blemish of some sort up in t he upper right corner, but other than that, the angle is great and lighting is good.  I like how there are no shadows on some of them, but i would like to have seen no shadows on all of them, but that would probably take a lot away from the photo.  Good job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-30 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112792, 4977, 3419, '<td valign="top">......but jack''s! I like it - it''s simple and elegant looking. Good composition.</td>', '......but jack''s! I like it - it''s simple and elegant looking. Good composition.', '2002-08-30 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112793, 4977, 1143, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. You came very close to completely eliminating the shadows which makes the whole scene seem like it''s floating. Having them all on one plane and shooting from this angle adds to that effect. It''s simple, clean, and high-key (the opposite of my submission this week). I like the subject, and it is technically very good. It would make a nice stock shot, but for some reason it doesn''t have a lot of emotional pull for me.   ~indigo997</td>', 'Nice lighting. You came very close to completely eliminating the shadows which makes the whole scene seem like it''s floating. Having them all on one plane and shooting from this angle adds to that effect. It''s simple, clean, and high-key (the opposite of my submission this week). I like the subject, and it is technically very good. It would make a nice stock shot, but for some reason it doesn''t have a lot of emotional pull for me.   ~indigo997', '2002-08-30 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112794, 4977, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and beautiful clean background. <br/>Layout of jacks doesn''t feel right, somehow. <br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'Nice idea and beautiful clean background. Layout of jacks doesn''t feel right, somehow. 7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112795, 4977, 2261, '<td valign="top">Simple, stark contrast, good composition, great shot. well done.</td>', 'Simple, stark contrast, good composition, great shot. well done.', '2002-08-31 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112796, 4977, 806, '<td valign="top">Love it all - even the title! Good work!</td>', 'Love it all - even the title! Good work!', '2002-09-01 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112797, 4977, 255, '<td valign="top">this picture is my only ten so far! i jsut love it----i am a big fan of stark pics. nice everything!! 10--amitchell</td>', 'this picture is my only ten so far! i jsut love it----i am a big fan of stark pics. nice everything!! 10--amitchell', '2002-09-01 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112798, 4977, 3247, '<td valign="top">Where''s the 10th jack?  How would more shadows work?</td>', 'Where''s the 10th jack?  How would more shadows work?', '2002-09-01 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112799, 4977, 2279, '<td valign="top">I like this. I really like the white background. 7.</td>', 'I like this. I really like the white background. 7.', '2002-09-01 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112800, 4977, 1280, '<td valign="top">Definetly one of my favorites.  Simple, uncluttered, and very nice.  The shadow up in the right corner is surprising.  Wish ya woulda gotten rid of it.  Still very nice. Grayce aka Gracious</td>', 'Definetly one of my favorites.  Simple, uncluttered, and very nice.  The shadow up in the right corner is surprising.  Wish ya woulda gotten rid of it.  Still very nice. Grayce aka Gracious', '2002-09-02 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112801, 4978, 327, '<td valign="top">Real nice. Score 6 Kee</td>', 'Real nice. Score 6 Kee', '2002-08-26 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112802, 4978, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white, and the fact that this was taken froma lower angle.  karmat</td>', 'I like the black and white, and the fact that this was taken froma lower angle.  karmat', '2002-08-26 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112803, 4978, 3075, '<td valign="top">For this challenge the B&amp;W pictures really are great, giving that nostalgic feeling of years flying by. Nice the low camera stand, gives the idea that things look like you saw them as a child!<br/></td>', 'For this challenge the B&W pictures really are great, giving that nostalgic feeling of years flying by. Nice the low camera stand, gives the idea that things look like you saw them as a child!', '2002-08-26 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112804, 4978, 2752, '<td valign="top">good compostion and very effective in black and white.</td>', 'good compostion and very effective in black and white.', '2002-08-26 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112805, 4978, 133, '<td valign="top">Very moving.</td>', 'Very moving.', '2002-08-27 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112806, 4978, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good focus, nice cropping, less than engaging subjects.  7 Swash</td>', 'Good focus, nice cropping, less than engaging subjects.  7 Swash', '2002-08-27 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112807, 4978, 3554, '<td valign="top">The title is confusing.  Also the black and white feels forced with the smooth plasitic more modern toy.</td>', 'The title is confusing.  Also the black and white feels forced with the smooth plasitic more modern toy.', '2002-08-27 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112808, 4978, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice low viewpoint. Ball feels a little too close to edge of frame, otherwise nice composition. Feels a little dark despite the great highlights on the vehicule.<br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Nice low viewpoint. Ball feels a little too close to edge of frame, otherwise nice composition. Feels a little dark despite the great highlights on the vehicule.6, Kavey', '2002-08-28 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112809, 4978, 1175, '<td valign="top">black and white was a poor choice here.  The reason is that the picture is all a middle greay except fo for the fence and hedge in the background.</td>', 'black and white was a poor choice here.  The reason is that the picture is all a middle greay except fo for the fence and hedge in the background.', '2002-08-29 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112810, 4978, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot depicting childhood.  I wonder why you went with B&amp;W here.  was it to help portray the "lost" feeling.  If so, it does a very nice job of that.  The angle and the focus are great.  I was almost getting ready to comment on the branch in the foreground, however, with the "lost" theme, the branch fits in very nicely.  Looks like it''s not been played with in awhile that way.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice shot depicting childhood.  I wonder why you went with B&W here.  was it to help portray the "lost" feeling.  If so, it does a very nice job of that.  The angle and the focus are great.  I was almost getting ready to comment on the branch in the foreground, however, with the "lost" theme, the branch fits in very nicely.  Looks like it''s not been played with in awhile that way.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112811, 4978, 2928, '<td valign="top">In colour, this picture  at best  in my opinion would have been dull.  But in B&amp;W its a completely different shot.  The absence of colour adds atmosphere, depth and texture.  The composition is first class  nice shooting (8)</td>', 'In colour, this picture  at best  in my opinion would have been dull.  But in B&W its a completely different shot.  The absence of colour adds atmosphere, depth and texture.  The composition is first class  nice shooting (8)', '2002-09-01 03:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112812, 4978, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112813, 4978, 2279, '<td valign="top">Good B&amp;W shot. 7.</td>', 'Good B&W shot. 7.', '2002-09-01 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112814, 4978, 3354, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys for your comments. So many of you are really good. To me this picture is really unbareable. It''s a shot of my daughter''s toys (I lost my daughter to divorce) - so to the one who asked what the title meant... that''s what it meant... a child I lost.</td>', 'Thanks guys for your comments. So many of you are really good. To me this picture is really unbareable. It''s a shot of my daughter''s toys (I lost my daughter to divorce) - so to the one who asked what the title meant... that''s what it meant... a child I lost.', '2002-09-09 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112815, 4979, 1360, '<td valign="top">This photo has a LOT of ccd noise in it. 3 -lennier</td>', 'This photo has a LOT of ccd noise in it. 3 -lennier', '2002-08-26 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112816, 4979, 2427, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, not sure if the backgound, although interesting, helps the composition.</td>', 'I like the idea, not sure if the backgound, although interesting, helps the composition.', '2002-08-26 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112817, 4979, 811, '<td valign="top">I think more focus on possible the head of the horse, and less of the background would have made this pic more powerful.  Though the vertical lines give an "upward" feeling to the pic, they do so at the expense of drawing the viewer away from the horse, I think. karmat</td>', 'I think more focus on possible the head of the horse, and less of the background would have made this pic more powerful.  Though the vertical lines give an "upward" feeling to the pic, they do so at the expense of drawing the viewer away from the horse, I think. karmat', '2002-08-26 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112818, 4979, 3313, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a great shot. It would have been perfect if the background wasn''t so lit up as all these beams and sticks distract from the horse.</td>', 'I think it''s a great shot. It would have been perfect if the background wasn''t so lit up as all these beams and sticks distract from the horse.', '2002-08-26 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112819, 4979, 3093, '<td valign="top">Jpeg artifacts up the wahzoo!  Too distracting to enjoy the angle of the shot.</td>', 'Jpeg artifacts up the wahzoo!  Too distracting to enjoy the angle of the shot.', '2002-08-26 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112820, 4979, 82, '<td valign="top">Great angle, it captures the motion.  The colors are a bit mottled on the horse''s coat, but the picture itself is very nice.</td>', 'Great angle, it captures the motion.  The colors are a bit mottled on the horse''s coat, but the picture itself is very nice.', '2002-08-26 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112821, 4979, 3323, '<td valign="top">the background is too busy for me.</td>', 'the background is too busy for me.', '2002-08-26 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112822, 4979, 3002, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt on the part of the photographer and meets challenge, unlike several photos I''ve seen here for this challenge that don''t.</td>', 'Nice attempt on the part of the photographer and meets challenge, unlike several photos I''ve seen here for this challenge that don''t.', '2002-08-26 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112823, 4979, 2643, '<td valign="top">This actually looks kinda scary.</td>', 'This actually looks kinda scary.', '2002-08-27 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112824, 4979, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Like the low viewpoint but not the tilted angle.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'Nice photo. Like the low viewpoint but not the tilted angle.5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112825, 4979, 2295, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter.  Presented well.  Lighting is OK.  Focus looks pretty good.</td>', 'Good subject matter.  Presented well.  Lighting is OK.  Focus looks pretty good.', '2002-08-28 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112826, 4979, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?8,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?8,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-29 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112827, 4979, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  My only gripe, and I''m not really sure how you could have cured it, is that the lighting seems a little harsh</td>', 'This is a great shot.  My only gripe, and I''m not really sure how you could have cured it, is that the lighting seems a little harsh', '2002-08-29 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112828, 4979, 2279, '<td valign="top">This one is way to busy for me. The glare on the horse is really harsh. and you cut of its back end. 3.</td>', 'This one is way to busy for me. The glare on the horse is really harsh. and you cut of its back end. 3.', '2002-08-31 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112829, 4979, 3080, '<td valign="top">I have seen more colorful carousels.  This however, is a very nice shot.  I would like to have seen more color, but I like how the focus is on his head.  Angle is nice and definately depicts childhood to a T.  great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I have seen more colorful carousels.  This however, is a very nice shot.  I would like to have seen more color, but I like how the focus is on his head.  Angle is nice and definately depicts childhood to a T.  great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112830, 4980, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice,  I couldn''t find any of my star wars toys that I had when I was younger.  I blew them up in the battles we had.</td>', 'Nice,  I couldn''t find any of my star wars toys that I had when I was younger.  I blew them up in the battles we had.', '2002-08-26 02:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112831, 4980, 2764, '<td valign="top">Aaagh - make at least one of them stand up straight.</td>', 'Aaagh - make at least one of them stand up straight.', '2002-08-26 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112832, 4980, 2199, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, and how it really looks like the characters are in a desert. A lower perspective might add drama, but I also realize that this could bring in background elements that you were trying to avoid.</td>', 'I like the lighting, and how it really looks like the characters are in a desert. A lower perspective might add drama, but I also realize that this could bring in background elements that you were trying to avoid.', '2002-08-26 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112833, 4980, 1585, '<td valign="top">This is cool. I wanna play.</td>', 'This is cool. I wanna play.', '2002-08-26 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112834, 4980, 3075, '<td valign="top">Nice one, especially the sand in the background, really remembers me of the Star Wars movies of long ago (not the new ones, the first ones from way back!).<br/>Nice shiny picture!</td>', 'Nice one, especially the sand in the background, really remembers me of the Star Wars movies of long ago (not the new ones, the first ones from way back!).Nice shiny picture!', '2002-08-26 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112835, 4980, 2223, '<td valign="top">use the force!! i bet im not the only one who said that!! star wars was definetly part of my childhood, wish i still had my action figures..</td>', 'use the force!! i bet im not the only one who said that!! star wars was definetly part of my childhood, wish i still had my action figures..', '2002-08-26 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112836, 4980, 1644, '<td valign="top">Simple, but it communicates the right message.</td>', 'Simple, but it communicates the right message.', '2002-08-26 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112837, 4980, 2279, '<td valign="top">Thats cool. I loved my star wars toys. 7.</td>', 'Thats cool. I loved my star wars toys. 7.', '2002-08-27 03:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112838, 4980, 2596, '<td valign="top">Composition  ( 7 )<br/>Technical Aspects  ( 4 )<br/>Meets Challenge  ( 10 ) yes (if NO -2 point) <br/>Creativity   ( 8 )<br/>Rating  ( 9 )<br/></td>', 'Composition  ( 7 )Technical Aspects  ( 4 )Meets Challenge  ( 10 ) yes (if NO -2 point) Creativity   ( 8 )Rating  ( 9 )', '2002-08-27 07:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112839, 4980, 3281, '<td valign="top">Qué padre foto!!! ¿Quién la tomó? Seguro un fan de Star Wars!!!!<br/>Barbie :)<br/></td>', 'Qué padre foto!!! ¿Quién la tomó? Seguro un fan de Star Wars!!!!Barbie :)', '2002-08-27 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112840, 4980, 1827, '<td valign="top">LMAO.  Right on.  This sums up my childhood aptly.  And the title is great.  Photographically, I wish the lighting were slightly less harsh.  +1 for creativity.  6, just-married</td>', 'LMAO.  Right on.  This sums up my childhood aptly.  And the title is great.  Photographically, I wish the lighting were slightly less harsh.  +1 for creativity.  6, just-married', '2002-08-27 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112841, 4980, 2472, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge. It reminded me of one of the first 3 movies when this 2 guys were in a planet, in the middle of the desert, in a position very much like this composition. Fun idea. It made me smile...<br/><br/>I would have openned my view a little bit more, to convey the solitude of this two characters (although maybe you were unable to open the angle and avoid the real surroundings, in which case you should have gone to a real desert to make the photo -just kidding!-). It would have looked nice if the shadows were more a part of the composition, even if it ment taking the figures from the back of the subject. I white cloth filter would have helped you avoid the severity of the direct sunlight.</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge. It reminded me of one of the first 3 movies when this 2 guys were in a planet, in the middle of the desert, in a position very much like this composition. Fun idea. It made me smile...I would have openned my view a little bit more, to convey the solitude of this two characters (although maybe you were unable to open the angle and avoid the real surroundings, in which case you should have gone to a real desert to make the photo -just kidding!-). It would have looked nice if the shadows were more a part of the composition, even if it ment taking the figures from the back of the subject. I white cloth filter would have helped you avoid the severity of the direct sunlight.', '2002-08-27 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112842, 4980, 3528, '<td valign="top">good resolution. good memories.</td>', 'good resolution. good memories.', '2002-08-27 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112843, 4980, 2337, '<td valign="top">Light is too harsh (although I guess they are on a desert planet, huh?)  Seriously though, they lost a lot of detail cause of the light... Nice composition / idea...</td>', 'Light is too harsh (although I guess they are on a desert planet, huh?)  Seriously though, they lost a lot of detail cause of the light... Nice composition / idea...', '2002-08-27 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112844, 4980, 3087, '<td valign="top">Definite childhood memories! Like the all sand background... <br/>6, Kavey</td>', 'Definite childhood memories! Like the all sand background... 6, Kavey', '2002-08-28 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(112845, 4980, 1042, '<td valign="top">I was 10 I think...when it came out. I had every figure and card and poster you could think of. I was in love with Han Solo...lol.  What I''m trying to say here is that you captured childhood memories for me.  Great job! :)  KDJ   8</td>', 'I was 10 I think...when it came out. I had every figure and card and poster you could think of. I was in love with Han Solo...lol.  What I''m trying to say here is that you captured childhood memories for me.  Great job! :)  KDJ   8', '2002-08-28 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112846, 4980, 3080, '<td valign="top">With nothing to compare size to, you almost can''t tell they are just little figures.  Could be the real thing for all I know. lol.  I never got to see the star wars movies from when I was a kid, but this still portrays childhood very well.  The lighting is great.  No silly reflections, glares or shadows.  The placement of the figures is also nice, to not have them directly in the center of the photo puts a nice twist on things. Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'With nothing to compare size to, you almost can''t tell they are just little figures.  Could be the real thing for all I know. lol.  I never got to see the star wars movies from when I was a kid, but this still portrays childhood very well.  The lighting is great.  No silly reflections, glares or shadows.  The placement of the figures is also nice, to not have them directly in the center of the photo puts a nice twist on things. Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-28 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112847, 4980, 1856, '<td valign="top">This cracks me up...great composition and dof...maybe needs a little color tweak. 8 Lisa</td>', 'This cracks me up...great composition and dof...maybe needs a little color tweak. 8 Lisa', '2002-08-29 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112848, 4980, 2798, '<td valign="top">Star Wars was such a HUGE part of so many of our childhoods. Great idea and creatively arranged. - floyd</td>', 'Star Wars was such a HUGE part of so many of our childhoods. Great idea and creatively arranged. - floyd', '2002-08-29 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112849, 4980, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, just wish C3-PO wasnt so central in the image.</td>', 'Nice and simple, just wish C3-PO wasnt so central in the image.', '2002-08-30 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112850, 4980, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice toys.  Good setting, where''s Luke?  This is going to sound a bit wierd, but the detail I want to see is their trail.  It looks like you "plopped them down" and shot.  (Devil''s in the details!)  3CPO might not have left much of a trail, but R2D2 would have.  9 Swash</td>', 'Nice toys.  Good setting, where''s Luke?  This is going to sound a bit wierd, but the detail I want to see is their trail.  It looks like you "plopped them down" and shot.  (Devil''s in the details!)  3CPO might not have left much of a trail, but R2D2 would have.  9 Swash', '2002-08-30 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112851, 4980, 1037, '<td valign="top">That''s just so.... cute! I think it could be better framed, but it has a lot of appeal as it is. The colours and lighting are great, it gives a strong sense of a frame from the movie. Well done :)</td>', 'That''s just so.... cute! I think it could be better framed, but it has a lot of appeal as it is. The colours and lighting are great, it gives a strong sense of a frame from the movie. Well done :)', '2002-08-31 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112852, 4980, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112853, 4980, 1827, '<td valign="top">You know, Swashbucker''s comment about adding r2d2''s trails is an INCREDIBLE insight.  That would have made this photo 1-2 points better.  Anyway, good job!  Dawn</td>', 'You know, Swashbucker''s comment about adding r2d2''s trails is an INCREDIBLE insight.  That would have made this photo 1-2 points better.  Anyway, good job!  Dawn', '2002-09-02 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(112854, 4984, 2997, '<td valign="top">VERY good concept.  Considering your setup, angle and lighting would have driven the point home better.</td>', 'VERY good concept.  Considering your setup, angle and lighting would have driven the point home better.', '2002-08-26 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112855, 4984, 3532, '<td valign="top">Good idea, interesting framing, but the exposure is just too dark.</td>', 'Good idea, interesting framing, but the exposure is just too dark.', '2002-08-26 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112856, 4984, 772, '<td valign="top">Childhood :)  I believe that I got in trouble a few times myself for similar acts of childhood disregard :)  This is an interesting view with the dim lighting... - jmsetzler</td>', 'Childhood :)  I believe that I got in trouble a few times myself for similar acts of childhood disregard :)  This is an interesting view with the dim lighting... - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 07:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112857, 4984, 3448, '<td valign="top">Very dark, hard to tell what you''re looking at. Some additional lighting might have helped. 6.</td>', 'Very dark, hard to tell what you''re looking at. Some additional lighting might have helped. 6.', '2002-08-26 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112858, 4984, 82, '<td valign="top">Very sweet ... this brings on a nostalgic smile.</td>', 'Very sweet ... this brings on a nostalgic smile.', '2002-08-26 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112859, 4984, 3087, '<td valign="top">This definitely meets the challenge - I can picture so many parents'' looks of horror as they see their "little monsters" work on the interior decor that they''ve just finished painting. However the photo itself doesn''t grab me on a visual level. The lighting is a little too dark.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'This definitely meets the challenge - I can picture so many parents'' looks of horror as they see their "little monsters" work on the interior decor that they''ve just finished painting. However the photo itself doesn''t grab me on a visual level. The lighting is a little too dark.Kavey', '2002-08-26 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112860, 4984, 811, '<td valign="top">I think if there was a little more even light, so that the scribble was more easily visible, it would be more effective. karmat</td>', 'I think if there was a little more even light, so that the scribble was more easily visible, it would be more effective. karmat', '2002-08-26 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112861, 4984, 3313, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that it raises questions. Such as .. what hapened to the door ? .. Where is this ? In terms of photo, it is a bit too flat and the drawing fails to capture the attention (that''s why I wonder about the door I guess)</td>', 'I like the fact that it raises questions. Such as .. what hapened to the door ? .. Where is this ? In terms of photo, it is a bit too flat and the drawing fails to capture the attention (that''s why I wonder about the door I guess)', '2002-08-26 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112862, 4984, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ewww, bad memory.   It''s a bit dark, artistry isn''t very good (scribbles, after all)<br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Ewww, bad memory.   It''s a bit dark, artistry isn''t very good (scribbles, after all)7 Swash', '2002-08-26 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112863, 4984, 2279, '<td valign="top">Man I got in big trouble when I did that once. I wish there was a little more light used in this picture. Just seems a little too dark. 5.</td>', 'Man I got in big trouble when I did that once. I wish there was a little more light used in this picture. Just seems a little too dark. 5.', '2002-08-26 21:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112864, 4984, 2752, '<td valign="top">good composition...I like the muted tones</td>', 'good composition...I like the muted tones', '2002-08-26 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112865, 4984, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not quite clear enough, I''m afraid.  It''s a nice idea, but I would have tried to bring out a little more contrast.</td>', 'Not quite clear enough, I''m afraid.  It''s a nice idea, but I would have tried to bring out a little more contrast.', '2002-08-26 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112866, 4984, 2337, '<td valign="top">hehehe, Been there, done that... I like the strong linesof the door jam and the molding... The lighting bothered me at first, but it''s grown on me...</td>', 'hehehe, Been there, done that... I like the strong linesof the door jam and the molding... The lighting bothered me at first, but it''s grown on me...', '2002-08-27 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112867, 4984, 2295, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Unfortunatly for me, I have seen this in my own home.  Focus looks good.  The lighting seems a bit dark on the subject.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Unfortunatly for me, I have seen this in my own home.  Focus looks good.  The lighting seems a bit dark on the subject.', '2002-08-27 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112868, 4984, 3580, '<td valign="top">perhaps if you emphasized the scribbling to be low to the ground as a child would have it. it seems too high up</td>', 'perhaps if you emphasized the scribbling to be low to the ground as a child would have it. it seems too high up', '2002-08-28 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112869, 4984, 1454, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea, but may be you can find a better angle because the door is very distracting.</td>', 'I liked the idea, but may be you can find a better angle because the door is very distracting.', '2002-08-28 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112870, 4984, 2361, '<td valign="top">The lighting and angle are awful.  I suspect there was an intersting shot to be had here.  2 Jak</td>', 'The lighting and angle are awful.  I suspect there was an intersting shot to be had here.  2 Jak', '2002-08-29 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112871, 4984, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject - I almost did grafitti myself. Overall the shot it very dark but I like the doorframe in shot. - floyd</td>', 'Good choice of subject - I almost did grafitti myself. Overall the shot it very dark but I like the doorframe in shot. - floyd', '2002-08-30 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112872, 4984, 3419, '<td valign="top">Give that kid some paper! My mother would have shot me for this. Angle and lighting makes this an interesting shot.</td>', 'Give that kid some paper! My mother would have shot me for this. Angle and lighting makes this an interesting shot.', '2002-08-31 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112873, 4984, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wish we could see this better!  I really like the idea behind this.  Definately portrays childhood nicely.  I would say that I wish it were brighter, but I think that if it were brighter, it would be even harder to see.  I like the angle on this very much.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I wish we could see this better!  I really like the idea behind this.  Definately portrays childhood nicely.  I would say that I wish it were brighter, but I think that if it were brighter, it would be even harder to see.  I like the angle on this very much.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-31 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112874, 4984, 806, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more effective in horizontal with  the eye leading down the wall and into the hallway a bit (or room?). A bit too dark. Good idea, and definately describes childhood.</td>', 'I think this would be more effective in horizontal with  the eye leading down the wall and into the hallway a bit (or room?). A bit too dark. Good idea, and definately describes childhood.', '2002-09-01 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112875, 4984, 2079, '<td valign="top">Pablo Picasso in training no doubt. I hope you continue to encourage this sort of training, you could possible retire early.  This is Childhood, without question.  I like the diagonals and the framing. The lighting is a little dark and/or contrasty for my tastes, but the overall look of this has an artsy feel. Good Luck - Gotcha</td>', 'Pablo Picasso in training no doubt. I hope you continue to encourage this sort of training, you could possible retire early.  This is Childhood, without question.  I like the diagonals and the framing. The lighting is a little dark and/or contrasty for my tastes, but the overall look of this has an artsy feel. Good Luck - Gotcha', '2002-09-01 05:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112876, 4984, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?9,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?9,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
