(112891, 4991, 2881, '<td valign="top">This is a good B&amp;W study but I prefer color.  And I don''t like to see the challenge title used in the photograph title, no way, no part, no how!</td>', 'This is a good B&W study but I prefer color.  And I don''t like to see the challenge title used in the photograph title, no way, no part, no how!', '2002-08-26 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
