(112897, 4991, 1644, '<td valign="top">Wow all those textures of wood look great! Good lighting and shadows too. This is one of my favorites!</td>', 'Wow all those textures of wood look great! Good lighting and shadows too. This is one of my favorites!', '2002-08-26 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
