(112913, 4991, 1255, '<td valign="top">I love the warm feel to this photo.  I can just imagine how smooth and worn the seat of the chair must be... Beautiful composition as well!  10 shedonist</td>', 'I love the warm feel to this photo.  I can just imagine how smooth and worn the seat of the chair must be... Beautiful composition as well!  10 shedonist', '2002-08-30 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
