(112938, 4992, 3080, '<td valign="top">This definately does not portray childhood in my life, but I think you did an excelent job of showing that it DOES depict childhood in your life.  Everyone''s childhood is different and I can picture a little kid out on one of these boats with his/her Dad learning everything to do.  The angle you chose is great.  Black and white works really nicely here and although #1 is a bit dark on the side, the shadows to the left are a wonderful touch.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This definately does not portray childhood in my life, but I think you did an excelent job of showing that it DOES depict childhood in your life.  Everyone''s childhood is different and I can picture a little kid out on one of these boats with his/her Dad learning everything to do.  The angle you chose is great.  Black and white works really nicely here and although #1 is a bit dark on the side, the shadows to the left are a wonderful touch.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
