(112942, 4992, 3178, '<td valign="top">This probably invokes more memories for me than it will for most. I spent many summers sailing from docks just like this one. It''s a pleasant well don''t picture. The angles of the masts relative to the pilings catches the viewers attention. The large white sky is a little bland. Is it blown out? Maybe a different time of day, with clouds? Or in color with a sunset/sunrise? 8.</td>', 'This probably invokes more memories for me than it will for most. I spent many summers sailing from docks just like this one. It''s a pleasant well don''t picture. The angles of the masts relative to the pilings catches the viewers attention. The large white sky is a little bland. Is it blown out? Maybe a different time of day, with clouds? Or in color with a sunset/sunrise? 8.', '2002-08-30 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112943, 4992, 3111, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t scream childhood to me, but I am sure it does to you.  Won''t affect my score any....  The verticality of the masts could have been emphasized more, and the picture is a little dark and without detial at the bottom...</td>', 'It doesn''t scream childhood to me, but I am sure it does to you.  Won''t affect my score any....  The verticality of the masts could have been emphasized more, and the picture is a little dark and without detial at the bottom...', '2002-09-01 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
