(112964, 4994, 2337, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems a little sloped :)  (yes, I''m kidding)... Excellent shot!  Would have been drop dead fantastic if the sky had co-operated more :)</td>', 'The horizon seems a little sloped :)  (yes, I''m kidding)... Excellent shot!  Would have been drop dead fantastic if the sky had co-operated more :)', '2002-08-27 05:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112965, 4994, 1827, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast on the rocks in this shot, and the bucket is a nice touch.<br/>The angle is intentional, a choice you made, and maybe you love it.  I can''t decide.  The banding in the upper left corner is unfortunate.  I wonder if not compressing so much would have fixed this.  Your file size would have been allowed at up to 1/3 larger.  Still, the photo appeals to me overall.  6, just-married</td>', 'I like the contrast on the rocks in this shot, and the bucket is a nice touch.The angle is intentional, a choice you made, and maybe you love it.  I can''t decide.  The banding in the upper left corner is unfortunate.  I wonder if not compressing so much would have fixed this.  Your file size would have been allowed at up to 1/3 larger.  Still, the photo appeals to me overall.  6, just-married', '2002-08-27 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112966, 4994, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice :)  I love the exposure control on this photo.  This must be a very early morning photo... the long shadows work well here... I also love the camera tilt.  Some people are afraid to do this.  I think it adds a great impact sometimes... great shot! = 9 - jmsetzler</td>', 'very nice :)  I love the exposure control on this photo.  This must be a very early morning photo... the long shadows work well here... I also love the camera tilt.  Some people are afraid to do this.  I think it adds a great impact sometimes... great shot! = 9 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
