(112985, 4994, 2261, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. The sharpe colours of the bucket and spade stand out really well against the rocks. The angle is spot on as well. Well done. 9 - Martin</td>', 'Brilliant. The sharpe colours of the bucket and spade stand out really well against the rocks. The angle is spot on as well. Well done. 9 - Martin', '2002-08-31 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112986, 4994, 2221, '<td valign="top">Uh oh. I would really like to hear why you tilted he camera. It''s not good in this case I think. The calm light (sunset) is somehow working against the chaotic influence of the tilt. I think if the photo weren''t tilted it would be one of my top favourites.<br/>Anyway, good lighting and focus. I like the contrast of the blue/red of the toys and stones.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Uh oh. I would really like to hear why you tilted he camera. It''s not good in this case I think. The calm light (sunset) is somehow working against the chaotic influence of the tilt. I think if the photo weren''t tilted it would be one of my top favourites.Anyway, good lighting and focus. I like the contrast of the blue/red of the toys and stones.-stephan', '2002-08-31 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112987, 4994, 3080, '<td valign="top">I LOVE how there are no footprints in this photo.  I wonder why you chose the angle you did, but I''m not complaining.  The angle works nicely with this photo for some reason.  The red bucket and blue shovel add a very nice hint of color and this definately depicts childhood.  I think I just realized why you went with this angle.  Was it so you could walk on the rocks to place the shovel and bucket without showing footprints?  Anyway, This is a great photo.  Good luck in the challenge ~Hbunch7187~</td>', 'I LOVE how there are no footprints in this photo.  I wonder why you chose the angle you did, but I''m not complaining.  The angle works nicely with this photo for some reason.  The red bucket and blue shovel add a very nice hint of color and this definately depicts childhood.  I think I just realized why you went with this angle.  Was it so you could walk on the rocks to place the shovel and bucket without showing footprints?  Anyway, This is a great photo.  Good luck in the challenge ~Hbunch7187~', '2002-08-31 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(112988, 4994, 806, '<td valign="top">Really like this, but wonder if it would have the same effect with a bit less tilt? (9)</td>', 'Really like this, but wonder if it would have the same effect with a bit less tilt? (9)', '2002-09-01 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
