(113013, 4996, 1019, '<td valign="top">Very nice--how did you manage to find an empty swinger?  looks as if it will soon be filled with children!  andrewm</td>', 'Very nice--how did you manage to find an empty swinger?  looks as if it will soon be filled with children!  andrewm', '2002-08-27 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113014, 4996, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?9,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing6,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?9,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 7,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-27 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113015, 4996, 1143, '<td valign="top">I really love the colors. A lower crop, showing more of the bright green trees, would be interesting. Unless you were trying to crop something out  :o)<br/>The chairs seem a tad out of focus. If you couldn''t get a fast enough shot to freeze the motion then you might consider taking a slower one and taking advantage of the blur. Just a suggestion. I have no idea how it''d look.</td>', 'I really love the colors. A lower crop, showing more of the bright green trees, would be interesting. Unless you were trying to crop something out  :o)The chairs seem a tad out of focus. If you couldn''t get a fast enough shot to freeze the motion then you might consider taking a slower one and taking advantage of the blur. Just a suggestion. I have no idea how it''d look.', '2002-08-28 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113016, 4996, 1829, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photo.  The colours are great also.  Well captured :)</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photo.  The colours are great also.  Well captured :)', '2002-08-28 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113017, 4996, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great job catching EMPTY seats! I like it.</td>', 'Great job catching EMPTY seats! I like it.', '2002-08-28 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113018, 4996, 1827, '<td valign="top">I thought for a real long time on this one.  I really like the photo.  The framing is perfect.  The socus is terrific - just a bit of blur on the swings which is terrific.  It was the colors that gave me cause for pause.  They are brilliant.  And that was my problem for a little while.  I think the saturation must have been VERY boosted (I could be wrong, but that''s my suspicion).  I don''t have a problem with that, but in this case I pondered for a long time whether it was to such a degree that it detracted from the realism of the photo.  Ultimately, I decided that as a child you see the world differently - a world of colors brighter than they really are and life better than it really is, so I decided to let it work for me.  I mention it only because if the challenge had been something else, my decision may have been different -- and that might be helpful knowledge to you as a photographer.  Then again, it might not.  Take what you can use, throw the rest away.  :-)  9, just-married</td>', 'I thought for a real long time on this one.  I really like the photo.  The framing is perfect.  The socus is terrific - just a bit of blur on the swings which is terrific.  It was the colors that gave me cause for pause.  They are brilliant.  And that was my problem for a little while.  I think the saturation must have been VERY boosted (I could be wrong, but that''s my suspicion).  I don''t have a problem with that, but in this case I pondered for a long time whether it was to such a degree that it detracted from the realism of the photo.  Ultimately, I decided that as a child you see the world differently - a world of colors brighter than they really are and life better than it really is, so I decided to let it work for me.  I mention it only because if the challenge had been something else, my decision may have been different -- and that might be helpful knowledge to you as a photographer.  Then again, it might not.  Take what you can use, throw the rest away.  :-)  9, just-married', '2002-08-29 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113019, 4996, 1856, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors and composition.  I love this!  How''d you pull this off without having a child on one of those swings????  10 Lisa</td>', 'Awesome colors and composition.  I love this!  How''d you pull this off without having a child on one of those swings????  10 Lisa', '2002-08-29 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113020, 4996, 749, '<td valign="top">Da chyfansoddiad , deimladau cara ''i s i mewn chyffro! ''r ''n befr banerau ''n sylweddol chyfnertha hefyd. 8<br/><br/>Good composition, feels like it''s in motion! The bright colours really help too. 8.<br/>- Manic -<br/></td>', 'Da chyfansoddiad , deimladau cara ''i s i mewn chyffro! ''r ''n befr banerau ''n sylweddol chyfnertha hefyd. 8Good composition, feels like it''s in motion! The bright colours really help too. 8.- Manic -', '2002-08-29 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
