(113027, 4996, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites - I love the colours and the movement. The overall composition is great - interesting. I like the trees along the lower edge too.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'This is one of my favourites - I love the colours and the movement. The overall composition is great - interesting. I like the trees along the lower edge too.9, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113028, 4996, 3111, '<td valign="top">I understand that the challenge is "without children", but it is still rather eerie to see this working without people in it.  Great shot, excellent color and great composition.</td>', 'I understand that the challenge is "without children", but it is still rather eerie to see this working without people in it.  Great shot, excellent color and great composition.', '2002-09-01 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113029, 4996, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Very bright colors and I can almost see the seats filled with kids. Good Job. 7.</td>', 'Nice shot. Very bright colors and I can almost see the seats filled with kids. Good Job. 7.', '2002-09-01 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113030, 4996, 806, '<td valign="top">Top 20, Terry! Congrats!</td>', 'Top 20, Terry! Congrats!', '2002-09-02 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(113031, 4996, 2667, '<td valign="top">Congrats Terry! This was one of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Congrats Terry! This was one of my favorites this week.', '2002-09-02 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(113032, 4996, 714, '<td valign="top">I was going to take a picture of one of the rides at the carnival here, but it rained the whole time.  Good job.  I love the colors<br/></td>', 'I was going to take a picture of one of the rides at the carnival here, but it rained the whole time.  Good job.  I love the colors', '2002-09-03 02:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(113033, 4996, 2634, '<td valign="top">For those who asked how did I get this with no children...just lucky! First I took some pictures of it, with nothing working well because if you crop out the kids you crop out the swings. Then just as I was about to leave the park, I noticed it was half empty. Just at the right time I got a shot with all empty seats! <br/>Couldnt crop out the trees because I would lose seats. Couldn''t have more trees because there were stores below. Yes I had to saturate because the sky was a little dull, but I feel it added to the look of the photo.<br/>Thanks for all the comments!</td>', 'For those who asked how did I get this with no children...just lucky! First I took some pictures of it, with nothing working well because if you crop out the kids you crop out the swings. Then just as I was about to leave the park, I noticed it was half empty. Just at the right time I got a shot with all empty seats! Couldnt crop out the trees because I would lose seats. Couldn''t have more trees because there were stores below. Yes I had to saturate because the sky was a little dull, but I feel it added to the look of the photo.Thanks for all the comments!', '2002-09-04 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(113034, 4997, 2279, '<td valign="top">Wow, This photo really catches my eye. Looks like someone playing hide and seek. One of my tops this week. 9.</td>', 'Wow, This photo really catches my eye. Looks like someone playing hide and seek. One of my tops this week. 9.', '2002-08-26 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113035, 4997, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is pleasant landscape. It relates to childhood only because of the title. Yes, kids explore so do adults. So, I don''t see anything specifically "Childhood" about this. Methinks, not enough contrast in the dark trees in the background.  5 Journey</td>', 'This is pleasant landscape. It relates to childhood only because of the title. Yes, kids explore so do adults. So, I don''t see anything specifically "Childhood" about this. Methinks, not enough contrast in the dark trees in the background.  5 Journey', '2002-08-26 04:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113036, 4997, 3540, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot...don''t see the correlation with the topic though</td>', 'Not a bad shot...don''t see the correlation with the topic though', '2002-08-26 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113037, 4997, 1154, '<td valign="top">luv this pic!  thats how I spent my childhood playing in the woods</td>', 'luv this pic!  thats how I spent my childhood playing in the woods', '2002-08-26 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113038, 4997, 2553, '<td valign="top">Having grown up on a farm in the country in PA, this is one I can definitely relate to !  I love the lighting and the composition, and the DOF works well for me.  lhall</td>', 'Having grown up on a farm in the country in PA, this is one I can definitely relate to !  I love the lighting and the composition, and the DOF works well for me.  lhall', '2002-08-27 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113039, 4997, 3080, '<td valign="top">I relate to this photo well because I grew up on a dead end dirt road in the middle of nothing but field and forest.  You have the main focus on the tree in the front.  I wonder what it would look like looking straight down that road.  I guess it doesn''t really matter.  I like it how it is, with the road in the background and the weeds and the tree in sharp focus.  Some people probably wont see this as depicting childhood, but I am sure it does for you, as it also does for me.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I relate to this photo well because I grew up on a dead end dirt road in the middle of nothing but field and forest.  You have the main focus on the tree in the front.  I wonder what it would look like looking straight down that road.  I guess it doesn''t really matter.  I like it how it is, with the road in the background and the weeds and the tree in sharp focus.  Some people probably wont see this as depicting childhood, but I am sure it does for you, as it also does for me.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113040, 4997, 2172, '<td valign="top">That was my idea....but I didn''t submit.  Nice and clean image.  Good work  7<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'That was my idea....but I didn''t submit.  Nice and clean image.  Good work  7Ruthann', '2002-08-28 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113041, 4997, 3573, '<td valign="top">pretty shot, but doesn''t carry the theme well</td>', 'pretty shot, but doesn''t carry the theme well', '2002-08-29 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113042, 4997, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,<br/>Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background7,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing8,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 6,Total Averaged Rating7.   Autool', '2002-08-29 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
