(113058, 4998, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I think I would have liked a higher angle, to show off the shadows of the jacks.  The ball has an interesting shadow, too.  Another suggestion would be movement, did you try this with the ball bouncing?  You have plenty of light for a fast shutter speed.  8 Swash</td>', 'Nicely done.  I think I would have liked a higher angle, to show off the shadows of the jacks.  The ball has an interesting shadow, too.  Another suggestion would be movement, did you try this with the ball bouncing?  You have plenty of light for a fast shutter speed.  8 Swash', '2002-08-26 20:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113059, 4998, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle and great background.  I like it.  I also like the way the grass/concrete line is very close to being straight with the bottom of the frame.  Focus and lighting are wonderful. Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice angle and great background.  I like it.  I also like the way the grass/concrete line is very close to being straight with the bottom of the frame.  Focus and lighting are wonderful. Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
