(113090, 4999, 1827, '<td valign="top">UPDATE:  Darn it!  I have changed this back and forth between a nine and a ten 3 times this week.  Ultimately I have decided that since I always have taken off at least one point for not meeting the challenge it would be hypocritical of me not to do so here.  So, a nine it is and I refuse to let myself touch this comment area again.  I LOVE the picture though.  9, just-married<br/><br/>ORIGINAL:<br/>Damn I love this shot.  Why couldn''t the challenge have been sea life or such?!  So, I''m making a stretch and pretending that you meant this to be a mermaid so that I can justify in my mind not taking off points for missing the challenge.  Every little girl fantasizes about mermaids after all.  GORGEOUS color.  nice texture, detail, lighting.  I can''t believe I''m giving you a 10 for something that doesn''t meet the challenge, but there it is.  (I promise to be mad at you for this later.  LOL) 10, just-married</td>', 'UPDATE:  Darn it!  I have changed this back and forth between a nine and a ten 3 times this week.  Ultimately I have decided that since I always have taken off at least one point for not meeting the challenge it would be hypocritical of me not to do so here.  So, a nine it is and I refuse to let myself touch this comment area again.  I LOVE the picture though.  9, just-marriedORIGINAL:Damn I love this shot.  Why couldn''t the challenge have been sea life or such?!  So, I''m making a stretch and pretending that you meant this to be a mermaid so that I can justify in my mind not taking off points for missing the challenge.  Every little girl fantasizes about mermaids after all.  GORGEOUS color.  nice texture, detail, lighting.  I can''t believe I''m giving you a 10 for something that doesn''t meet the challenge, but there it is.  (I promise to be mad at you for this later.  LOL) 10, just-married', '2002-08-27 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
