(113092, 4999, 3080, '<td valign="top">I am not really sure what i''m looking at.  your title is Fish Tale.  So I am thinking that i''m looking at an actual photo of a Fish Tail.  Since you spelled Tale so mean "a story" I am thinking that maybe there is a story behind the tail?  To be honest, without the title, I would have no clue at all what this was. Setting that aside, the relationship to childhood is that you fished when you were young??  Anyway, the photo is really pretty, I assume there was some color editing going on.  I like how it fills the frame, and the lighting appears to be good.  There is a white blemish over to the right just under half way up that is a bit distracting.  Interesting photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I am not really sure what i''m looking at.  your title is Fish Tale.  So I am thinking that i''m looking at an actual photo of a Fish Tail.  Since you spelled Tale so mean "a story" I am thinking that maybe there is a story behind the tail?  To be honest, without the title, I would have no clue at all what this was. Setting that aside, the relationship to childhood is that you fished when you were young??  Anyway, the photo is really pretty, I assume there was some color editing going on.  I like how it fills the frame, and the lighting appears to be good.  There is a white blemish over to the right just under half way up that is a bit distracting.  Interesting photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
