(113119, 5000, 3080, '<td valign="top">In the forums, there is discussion of "good" to "bad" childhood.  Aparently some people are having trouble with the bad childhood photos.  Personally I love them.  I can relate better.  This photo portrays a bad memory from my childhood. my dad had forced my mom and I to go on the ferris wheel.  she was ready to give birth to my little brother and I was scared to death. the darn thing got stuck and we were at the top.  All I can remember was screaming at the top of my lungs for what seemed like hours.  LOL.  funny how different things mean something different to everyone.  I like the angle of this and the placement and frame filling is great.  lighting is a bit dark on the bottoms of the carts, but that can''t be controlled.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'In the forums, there is discussion of "good" to "bad" childhood.  Aparently some people are having trouble with the bad childhood photos.  Personally I love them.  I can relate better.  This photo portrays a bad memory from my childhood. my dad had forced my mom and I to go on the ferris wheel.  she was ready to give birth to my little brother and I was scared to death. the darn thing got stuck and we were at the top.  All I can remember was screaming at the top of my lungs for what seemed like hours.  LOL.  funny how different things mean something different to everyone.  I like the angle of this and the placement and frame filling is great.  lighting is a bit dark on the bottoms of the carts, but that can''t be controlled.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
