(113137, 5001, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful! She''s sitting on Ganesha''s knee :). I love Ganesha, I just finished making a 3d computer model of him. Is this Sanandan''s photo? It''s my favourite so far. I wish I could give it more than 10, but that will have to do! - lisae</td>', 'This is so beautiful! She''s sitting on Ganesha''s knee :). I love Ganesha, I just finished making a 3d computer model of him. Is this Sanandan''s photo? It''s my favourite so far. I wish I could give it more than 10, but that will have to do! - lisae', '2002-08-28 06:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113138, 5001, 312, '<td valign="top">definitely a stretch for the "childhood" theme, but a nicely done photo nonetheless. my only suggestion would be not to center the subject so much, but rather more it off to one side a bit (in this case, the right side to make it look like she figure is looking into the photo instead of out of it.)</td>', 'definitely a stretch for the "childhood" theme, but a nicely done photo nonetheless. my only suggestion would be not to center the subject so much, but rather more it off to one side a bit (in this case, the right side to make it look like she figure is looking into the photo instead of out of it.)', '2002-08-29 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
