(113144, 5001, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is kind of creepy...and definately not from my childhood, but I am sure it is from someones.  It really is a beautiful photo, but it kind of looks like it''s bleeding.  either that or not totally painted or something.  You captured the angle beautifully.  and the lighting is great.  I like how the subject fills the whole photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is kind of creepy...and definately not from my childhood, but I am sure it is from someones.  It really is a beautiful photo, but it kind of looks like it''s bleeding.  either that or not totally painted or something.  You captured the angle beautifully.  and the lighting is great.  I like how the subject fills the whole photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(113145, 5001, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''ve put this photo in my favourites. I guess I was the only one who gave it 10. That''s so sad :(. Sanandan, you''ll just have to take more photos that are understandable by the average American before you can get the kind of score you deserve... but then they wouldn''t have the uniqueness I love... bah.</td>', 'I''ve put this photo in my favourites. I guess I was the only one who gave it 10. That''s so sad :(. Sanandan, you''ll just have to take more photos that are understandable by the average American before you can get the kind of score you deserve... but then they wouldn''t have the uniqueness I love... bah.', '2002-09-02 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(113146, 5001, 2110, '<td valign="top">This image is of Lord Krishna, sittig on the lap of lord Ganesha, and the image was taken when this 16 feet idol was being painted (for a religious ceremony). <br/>Lord Krishna, is known for his mischiefs in his childhood and specailly "Raas Leela". <br/>I have been brought up in a (Hindu) religious family. So my child-hood has been mostly influenced by the stories of Lord Krishna and his child hood. I never had the freedom to do a lot of things that I wanted to do and the fear of the Supernatural powers predominantly constrained my thoughts associated with freedom to do all! <br/>This image of Lord Krishna (in his childhood) is a reflection of my dreams to have a childhood like his, as read in the religious stories.<br/><br/>My apologies to all for touching a subject that may not interest most of the list members here. Thanks a  ton to Lisae for encouraging!</td>', 'This image is of Lord Krishna, sittig on the lap of lord Ganesha, and the image was taken when this 16 feet idol was being painted (for a religious ceremony). Lord Krishna, is known for his mischiefs in his childhood and specailly "Raas Leela". I have been brought up in a (Hindu) religious family. So my child-hood has been mostly influenced by the stories of Lord Krishna and his child hood. I never had the freedom to do a lot of things that I wanted to do and the fear of the Supernatural powers predominantly constrained my thoughts associated with freedom to do all! This image of Lord Krishna (in his childhood) is a reflection of my dreams to have a childhood like his, as read in the religious stories.My apologies to all for touching a subject that may not interest most of the list members here. Thanks a  ton to Lisae for encouraging!', '2002-09-03 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
