(113166, 5004, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting child''s toy :)  I love the setup and composition here, but the background material takes away a lot of contrast from your subject.  The colors and patterns on the background could be considered quite distracting from the subject.  This toy, possibly, could have been more effectively photographed on a neutral background??  Good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting child''s toy :)  I love the setup and composition here, but the background material takes away a lot of contrast from your subject.  The colors and patterns on the background could be considered quite distracting from the subject.  This toy, possibly, could have been more effectively photographed on a neutral background??  Good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113167, 5004, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think partly the background makes this more interesting than many of the toy shots this week, but I also like the red leatherette ear, the matching bracelet and the fantastic pearls. Also like the angle he/ she is lying at within the frame.<br/>Outside of the challenge would crop a little off the top to even out the width of background at each side.<br/>5, Kavey</td>', 'I think partly the background makes this more interesting than many of the toy shots this week, but I also like the red leatherette ear, the matching bracelet and the fantastic pearls. Also like the angle he/ she is lying at within the frame.Outside of the challenge would crop a little off the top to even out the width of background at each side.5, Kavey', '2002-08-27 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
