(113173, 5004, 3080, '<td valign="top">If you were going for the look that everything in this photo clashes, then great job.  This is one busy photo.  So many different patterns.  The old looking dog is a nice touch.  The dress up idea definately portrays childhood nicely.  Angle and placemnt are good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'If you were going for the look that everything in this photo clashes, then great job.  This is one busy photo.  So many different patterns.  The old looking dog is a nice touch.  The dress up idea definately portrays childhood nicely.  Angle and placemnt are good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
