(113178, 5004, 2221, '<td valign="top">Hmm it looks like you just used a stuffed animal because children were not allowed. The background is not chosen very well. It merges with the cloths of the subject and is too distracting in my opinion. Also the saturation (esp. of the red colour) is a bit too much.<br/>-stephan</td>', 'Hmm it looks like you just used a stuffed animal because children were not allowed. The background is not chosen very well. It merges with the cloths of the subject and is too distracting in my opinion. Also the saturation (esp. of the red colour) is a bit too much.-stephan', '2002-08-31 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
