(113213, 5006, 3080, '<td valign="top">I see a child in the photo!  Oh well...the challenge didn''t state if there could be photos of children in the photo, so I''ll let it slide.  :)  Definately depict childhood.  And parenthood for that matter.  Nice focus and lighting.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I see a child in the photo!  Oh well...the challenge didn''t state if there could be photos of children in the photo, so I''ll let it slide.  :)  Definately depict childhood.  And parenthood for that matter.  Nice focus and lighting.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-02 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
