(113216, 5007, 3087, '<td valign="top">My eye keeps getting pulled to the black toy sofa, which is probably one of the less attractive things in the picture, so perhaps unfortunate. Although this definitely says childhood to me, the photo in itself doesn''t appeal to me, visually. Perhaps focusing more on just the doll house and related toys would be more cohesive than including the other stuff such as rocking horse and white cuddly?<br/>Kavey</td>', 'My eye keeps getting pulled to the black toy sofa, which is probably one of the less attractive things in the picture, so perhaps unfortunate. Although this definitely says childhood to me, the photo in itself doesn''t appeal to me, visually. Perhaps focusing more on just the doll house and related toys would be more cohesive than including the other stuff such as rocking horse and white cuddly?Kavey', '2002-08-26 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113217, 5007, 2279, '<td valign="top">This picture just doesnt really hold my attention. Seems to busy. 4.</td>', 'This picture just doesnt really hold my attention. Seems to busy. 4.', '2002-08-26 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113218, 5007, 3554, '<td valign="top">Try for a more compelling title.</td>', 'Try for a more compelling title.', '2002-08-27 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113219, 5007, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cluttered, but a good shot.  No ideas what to do to "improve" this shot.  It is what it is.  A triffle dark....maybe a few too many elements, but if messy is what you wanted, this is it!  8 Swash</td>', 'Cluttered, but a good shot.  No ideas what to do to "improve" this shot.  It is what it is.  A triffle dark....maybe a few too many elements, but if messy is what you wanted, this is it!  8 Swash', '2002-08-27 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113220, 5007, 2158, '<td valign="top">A good depiction of childhood, but as a  photo I find it too cluttered.</td>', 'A good depiction of childhood, but as a  photo I find it too cluttered.', '2002-08-27 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113221, 5007, 772, '<td valign="top">I understand your ''theme'' on this photo quite well... As I look at some of the items in this image, I wonder if you could have taken that troll in the lingere and made some really cool photogrpah of just that :))  Good shot :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I understand your ''theme'' on this photo quite well... As I look at some of the items in this image, I wonder if you could have taken that troll in the lingere and made some really cool photogrpah of just that :))  Good shot :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-28 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113222, 5007, 3080, '<td valign="top">Great depiction of childhood.  Playtime.  The angle is good and the lighting is great.  no strange glares, bright spots, or shadows.  I like how it''s not really a set up shot of childhood, rather a candid one, but I don''t know how many people will go for that.  They don''t seem to go for candid on this site.  I am scared at how the "candid" challenge is going to go. lol  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great depiction of childhood.  Playtime.  The angle is good and the lighting is great.  no strange glares, bright spots, or shadows.  I like how it''s not really a set up shot of childhood, rather a candid one, but I don''t know how many people will go for that.  They don''t seem to go for candid on this site.  I am scared at how the "candid" challenge is going to go. lol  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113223, 5007, 1031, '<td valign="top">Around here that would be 30 seconds!</td>', 'Around here that would be 30 seconds!', '2002-08-30 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113224, 5007, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?7,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-01 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113225, 5007, 1827, '<td valign="top">I think the composition was the thing that worked least for me in this photo.  If you were trying to emphasize "toys" I think organizing them differently or selecting just a few would create a more interesting photo.  If you are trying to emphasize "messy", I think a bigger mess and a more zoomed out approach would have been more successful.  The corner lines distract me, and the glare from the flash adds to the snapshot quality.  2, just-married</td>', 'I think the composition was the thing that worked least for me in this photo.  If you were trying to emphasize "toys" I think organizing them differently or selecting just a few would create a more interesting photo.  If you are trying to emphasize "messy", I think a bigger mess and a more zoomed out approach would have been more successful.  The corner lines distract me, and the glare from the flash adds to the snapshot quality.  2, just-married', '2002-09-01 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113226, 5008, 3178, '<td valign="top">Nice concept! Anybody remember the "He man woman hater''s club"? :)</td>', 'Nice concept! Anybody remember the "He man woman hater''s club"? :)', '2002-08-26 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113227, 5008, 3208, '<td valign="top">I feel that if you left the door ajar somewhat, it may have added more interest to the photo.  I don''t know what I would have liked to see past the door - perhaps a slight glimpse of a toy.  Overall, I like this photo.</td>', 'I feel that if you left the door ajar somewhat, it may have added more interest to the photo.  I don''t know what I would have liked to see past the door - perhaps a slight glimpse of a toy.  Overall, I like this photo.', '2002-08-26 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113228, 5008, 772, '<td valign="top">As the president of the local chapter of the "He-man Woman Haters Club", I would like to file suit against the perpetrator of this slanderous, blasphemous, and otherwise chauvenistic and intentional display of sexual bias.  WhuddEVah the intent is with this photo, noting good can come of the continued supression of the male in our urban society.  We want equal pay and equal play :) So... shooowwwwww mmeeeeeee dddaaaaaa MONEY! :P - jmsetzler</td>', 'As the president of the local chapter of the "He-man Woman Haters Club", I would like to file suit against the perpetrator of this slanderous, blasphemous, and otherwise chauvenistic and intentional display of sexual bias.  WhuddEVah the intent is with this photo, noting good can come of the continued supression of the male in our urban society.  We want equal pay and equal play :) So... shooowwwwww mmeeeeeee dddaaaaaa MONEY! :P - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113229, 5008, 82, '<td valign="top">I love it:  the yellow paint, the scratched out "boys."  Excellent!  This captures the energy of the age group.</td>', 'I love it:  the yellow paint, the scratched out "boys."  Excellent!  This captures the energy of the age group.', '2002-08-26 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113230, 5008, 3542, '<td valign="top">Girls rule!  Reminds me of the fort my friend and I had growing up!</td>', 'Girls rule!  Reminds me of the fort my friend and I had growing up!', '2002-08-26 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
