(113253, 5009, 2427, '<td valign="top">Freah idea.  This one never occured to me.<br/>Subject heavy yes, but valid for sure.  I like the uneven light on the face of the stone and across the grass.  Nice job.</td>', 'Freah idea.  This one never occured to me.Subject heavy yes, but valid for sure.  I like the uneven light on the face of the stone and across the grass.  Nice job.', '2002-08-26 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
