(113255, 5009, 327, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, heart breaking, impact.......great b&amp;w. Sorry for someones loss here.<br/>Score 7 Justine</td>', 'Dramatic, heart breaking, impact.......great b&w. Sorry for someones loss here.Score 7 Justine', '2002-08-26 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113256, 5009, 2882, '<td valign="top">This is a very powerfull image and true to all accounts to the name you have chosen I do like this one very Much Mrbobby37</td>', 'This is a very powerfull image and true to all accounts to the name you have chosen I do like this one very Much Mrbobby37', '2002-08-26 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113257, 5009, 3080, '<td valign="top">Having recently just lost a young child, not mine, but very close to me, this photo is hard for me to appreciate, however there are some pretty good technical aspects in my mind.  The lighting and angle are good, and the background fits the photo.  Just to the right of the photo, there is something white, and it''s hard to tell what it is, but it might be flowers??  would either be better to include it all the way, or leave it out. (if possible).Sorry about the personal preference at this time, not your fault, just bad timing of sorts.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Having recently just lost a young child, not mine, but very close to me, this photo is hard for me to appreciate, however there are some pretty good technical aspects in my mind.  The lighting and angle are good, and the background fits the photo.  Just to the right of the photo, there is something white, and it''s hard to tell what it is, but it might be flowers??  would either be better to include it all the way, or leave it out. (if possible).Sorry about the personal preference at this time, not your fault, just bad timing of sorts.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113258, 5009, 3102, '<td valign="top">Boy, that''s kind of a sad interpretation of the challenge... but still very nicely done.  I like the composition; the subject made me give my little girl a hug...</td>', 'Boy, that''s kind of a sad interpretation of the challenge... but still very nicely done.  I like the composition; the subject made me give my little girl a hug...', '2002-08-26 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
