(113267, 5009, 2928, '<td valign="top">This is a sad picture It is also a superbly executed shot.  I might not like the idea and I might not like being forced to look at something that I''d rather not see, but, from the point of view of the challenge you have to ask:  Does it fit? Yes, and very powerfully  Is it a good photographically?  Yes, it''s damn good Is the composition OK?  Can''t fault it  Did it catch your eye?  Yes Did it make you think or bring out any emotion?  Yes  both counts How do you score something like this?  (10) Controversial, but gutsy picture</td>', 'This is a sad picture It is also a superbly executed shot.  I might not like the idea and I might not like being forced to look at something that I''d rather not see, but, from the point of view of the challenge you have to ask:  Does it fit? Yes, and very powerfully  Is it a good photographically?  Yes, it''s damn good Is the composition OK?  Can''t fault it  Did it catch your eye?  Yes Did it make you think or bring out any emotion?  Yes  both counts How do you score something like this?  (10) Controversial, but gutsy picture', '2002-08-29 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
