(113314, 5011, 2923, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, i like this photo but not necessarily the composition. the idea is good, the composition would need to be different.  The hands are great but needs to be more pronounced.  I would have shot underneath the bed, as most children who are afraid of teh dark would hide there.<br/><br/></td>', 'Hmmm, i like this photo but not necessarily the composition. the idea is good, the composition would need to be different.  The hands are great but needs to be more pronounced.  I would have shot underneath the bed, as most children who are afraid of teh dark would hide there.', '2002-08-26 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113315, 5011, 1005, '<td valign="top">Oooo, scary!  I know it''s supposed to be dark as part of the scariness, so I won''t score you down, but it is hard to see where the bed stops and the toy starts.  7 Swash</td>', 'Oooo, scary!  I know it''s supposed to be dark as part of the scariness, so I won''t score you down, but it is hard to see where the bed stops and the toy starts.  7 Swash', '2002-08-26 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
