(113318, 5011, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  It is more often than not that a really horrible memory takes presidence over even the best of memories.  It''s traumatic and often really hard to forget.  This is a really dark photo, and under normal circumstances, I don''t normally like overly dark or overly bright photos, but it works ver nicely here.  The angle and focus are great also for this photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  It is more often than not that a really horrible memory takes presidence over even the best of memories.  It''s traumatic and often really hard to forget.  This is a really dark photo, and under normal circumstances, I don''t normally like overly dark or overly bright photos, but it works ver nicely here.  The angle and focus are great also for this photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113319, 5011, 3102, '<td valign="top">I wish this were a little brighter because I think I would like it a lot.  At least on this monitor it''s a bit hard to tell what''s happening.  I''m assuming that you have hands reaching to scare someone in bed, which is a great concept!</td>', 'I wish this were a little brighter because I think I would like it a lot.  At least on this monitor it''s a bit hard to tell what''s happening.  I''m assuming that you have hands reaching to scare someone in bed, which is a great concept!', '2002-08-26 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113320, 5011, 3002, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus, but VERY creative!  I think this is great.</td>', 'A bit out of focus, but VERY creative!  I think this is great.', '2002-08-26 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113321, 5011, 3208, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a great idea!  This photo is good because it reminds me of fears I had when I was a child.  However, only one hand''s shadow is clearly defined and I feel there is too much bed in the photo.  I don''t know why, but that cuddly toy just seems out of place in this scene (despite it being very appropriate).  Could you have done this all in shadows?  How about the shadow of a bed corner, the boy clutching a teady-bear and gazing at the hands?  I think this would score higher points with me.  Nevertheless, I really like this photo for the feelings and also for the creativity.  Well done.</td>', 'Congratulations on a great idea!  This photo is good because it reminds me of fears I had when I was a child.  However, only one hand''s shadow is clearly defined and I feel there is too much bed in the photo.  I don''t know why, but that cuddly toy just seems out of place in this scene (despite it being very appropriate).  Could you have done this all in shadows?  How about the shadow of a bed corner, the boy clutching a teady-bear and gazing at the hands?  I think this would score higher points with me.  Nevertheless, I really like this photo for the feelings and also for the creativity.  Well done.', '2002-08-27 06:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113322, 5011, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very scary indeed.  Looking at this shot makes me get that "pit of the stomach" fear feeling.  I relate.  lhall</td>', 'Very scary indeed.  Looking at this shot makes me get that "pit of the stomach" fear feeling.  I relate.  lhall', '2002-08-27 06:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113323, 5011, 2866, '<td valign="top">Good idea.</td>', 'Good idea.', '2002-08-27 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
