(113377, 5013, 1175, '<td valign="top">this was a great idea... but I don''t like how it came out.  I would have liked to have seen all of the word gumballs, cutting off the g in the beginning is fine but at least include the 2 L''s and at least part of the S so I can make it out.  Then the most important thing would be to get a polarizer lens.  It''ll increase color saturation and do away with all that glare.</td>', 'this was a great idea... but I don''t like how it came out.  I would have liked to have seen all of the word gumballs, cutting off the g in the beginning is fine but at least include the 2 L''s and at least part of the S so I can make it out.  Then the most important thing would be to get a polarizer lens.  It''ll increase color saturation and do away with all that glare.', '2002-08-29 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113378, 5013, 3080, '<td valign="top">The color of this looks odd probably because it''s being shot through the gumball machine''s glass.  I love this idea.  It definately depicts childhood very well.  I like how you got most f the word gumball in the photo too.  Nice touch.  There is a glare on the left side and in the top right.  Hard to avoid when shooting through glass/plastic though.  You did a nice job.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The color of this looks odd probably because it''s being shot through the gumball machine''s glass.  I love this idea.  It definately depicts childhood very well.  I like how you got most f the word gumball in the photo too.  Nice touch.  There is a glare on the left side and in the top right.  Hard to avoid when shooting through glass/plastic though.  You did a nice job.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-29 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113379, 5013, 2261, '<td valign="top">The purple haze is off putting.</td>', 'The purple haze is off putting.', '2002-08-31 07:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
