(113403, 5015, 3087, '<td valign="top">No clear point of focus, but a pretty scene. The title states "What we did..." but I am not sure what you are doing? Fishing possibly, or about to go swimming or something else. Not sure.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'No clear point of focus, but a pretty scene. The title states "What we did..." but I am not sure what you are doing? Fishing possibly, or about to go swimming or something else. Not sure.Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
