(113410, 5015, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting view... I used to go fishing with my grandfather every summer in south carolina when i was young... we used to stay out on the lake all day, every day for a whole week when school was out for the summer.  anyway... In this photo, it appears that you were working in low light... it looks overcast and you may have been dealing with a slower than average shutter speed.  The image lacks sharpness, but it''s not really a focus issue.. it may be a slight blur due to camera shake maybe?  - jmsetzler</td>', 'This is an interesting view... I used to go fishing with my grandfather every summer in south carolina when i was young... we used to stay out on the lake all day, every day for a whole week when school was out for the summer.  anyway... In this photo, it appears that you were working in low light... it looks overcast and you may have been dealing with a slower than average shutter speed.  The image lacks sharpness, but it''s not really a focus issue.. it may be a slight blur due to camera shake maybe?  - jmsetzler', '2002-08-26 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113411, 5015, 3002, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this photo is a real ''stretch'' meeting this challenge.  As a matter of fact, it does NOT meet the challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, this photo is a real ''stretch'' meeting this challenge.  As a matter of fact, it does NOT meet the challenge.', '2002-08-26 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113412, 5015, 3102, '<td valign="top">At least something should be in focus here... This has kind of a Blair Witch feel to it for me.  I almost expect there to be another picture following it where the guy is eaten by something large involving tentacles.</td>', 'At least something should be in focus here... This has kind of a Blair Witch feel to it for me.  I almost expect there to be another picture following it where the guy is eaten by something large involving tentacles.', '2002-08-26 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
