(113414, 5015, 2818, '<td valign="top">I do like the picture, but a bit fuzzy.  Looks like a No Cal day with only partial sun.   Might have been better with a bright day.</td>', 'I do like the picture, but a bit fuzzy.  Looks like a No Cal day with only partial sun.   Might have been better with a bright day.', '2002-08-27 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
