(113426, 5015, 3080, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!  Fishing with my Dad.  About the only thing I could do right in that mans eyes. LOL.  I wish we had a closer up of the man in the photo.  It is ALMOST hard to tell what he is doing.  The lighting works very nicely here and the angle is good, maybe just move it in a tad closer.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh yes!  Fishing with my Dad.  About the only thing I could do right in that mans eyes. LOL.  I wish we had a closer up of the man in the photo.  It is ALMOST hard to tell what he is doing.  The lighting works very nicely here and the angle is good, maybe just move it in a tad closer.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113427, 5015, 2, '<td valign="top">What''s it like to be such an amazing photographer?  Probably something like being an amazing commenter.</td>', 'What''s it like to be such an amazing photographer?  Probably something like being an amazing commenter.', '2002-09-14 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(113428, 5016, 3178, '<td valign="top">This is disturbing. Very very disturbing. :)</td>', 'This is disturbing. Very very disturbing. :)', '2002-08-26 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113429, 5016, 157, '<td valign="top">oooooooo....man, I miss that show :)</td>', 'oooooooo....man, I miss that show :)', '2002-08-26 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113430, 5016, 2881, '<td valign="top">Not a bad photo, but maybe stretching it for the challenge</td>', 'Not a bad photo, but maybe stretching it for the challenge', '2002-08-26 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113431, 5016, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. To me (purely personal) this says more about teenage boys and men than it does about childhood (I tend to see childhood as that time when we are young kids, before we hit the teenage years, where we like to consider ourselves as "young adults").<br/>Kavey</td>', 'Nice colours. To me (purely personal) this says more about teenage boys and men than it does about childhood (I tend to see childhood as that time when we are young kids, before we hit the teenage years, where we like to consider ourselves as "young adults").Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113432, 5016, 3075, '<td valign="top">This really reminds me of my own childhood: The Dukes of Hazzard.<br/>Nice effect of all the General Lees in a row with the hood opened!<br/></td>', 'This really reminds me of my own childhood: The Dukes of Hazzard.Nice effect of all the General Lees in a row with the hood opened!', '2002-08-26 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113433, 5016, 2923, '<td valign="top">This look like another entry!</td>', 'This look like another entry!', '2002-08-26 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113434, 5016, 3208, '<td valign="top">Yeeee-haaah!  Is there a reason for so many cars, trees and people in the photo?  Surely, your subject is the General Lee (and possibly adults re-living their childhood passion) so I feel there are too many distractions in this photo.  Perhaps it was not possible to get a snap of a General Lee alone, or perhaps just a snap of part of the car''s side (showing 01 &amp; G. Lee). How about an adult''s expression as he/she gazes at the G. Lee?   However, this photo genertaed some positive memories of my childhood so, according to my voting standard, your photo received a fairly decent mark.  And overall, positive memories = smiles = thanks to you!</td>', 'Yeeee-haaah!  Is there a reason for so many cars, trees and people in the photo?  Surely, your subject is the General Lee (and possibly adults re-living their childhood passion) so I feel there are too many distractions in this photo.  Perhaps it was not possible to get a snap of a General Lee alone, or perhaps just a snap of part of the car''s side (showing 01 & G. Lee). How about an adult''s expression as he/she gazes at the G. Lee?   However, this photo genertaed some positive memories of my childhood so, according to my voting standard, your photo received a fairly decent mark.  And overall, positive memories = smiles = thanks to you!', '2002-08-27 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113435, 5016, 133, '<td valign="top">Just a good ole boy.....OH, sorry. LOL.  LOVED that show, though it has really not much to do with the subject.</td>', 'Just a good ole boy.....OH, sorry. LOL.  LOVED that show, though it has really not much to do with the subject.', '2002-08-27 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113436, 5016, 3542, '<td valign="top">They don''t make shows at good as this any more!  This reminds me of being a kid because it was one of my favorite shows!</td>', 'They don''t make shows at good as this any more!  This reminds me of being a kid because it was one of my favorite shows!', '2002-08-27 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113437, 5016, 772, '<td valign="top">I used to watch this show every friday night :) - jmsetzler</td>', 'I used to watch this show every friday night :) - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113438, 5016, 1827, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition.  I would really like to see a diagonal shot of the hoods open, cropped in such a way that includes not much else -- could be very nice with brigh contrast and good lighting.  Of course, it wouldn''t be appropriate for this challenge, so I''m not suggesting a change to your submission, only an avenue of further investigation with the photo.  The reds are great, and the General Lee definitely has a place in my childhood memories.  5, just-married</td>', 'I like the repetition.  I would really like to see a diagonal shot of the hoods open, cropped in such a way that includes not much else -- could be very nice with brigh contrast and good lighting.  Of course, it wouldn''t be appropriate for this challenge, so I''m not suggesting a change to your submission, only an avenue of further investigation with the photo.  The reds are great, and the General Lee definitely has a place in my childhood memories.  5, just-married', '2002-08-27 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113439, 5016, 2815, '<td valign="top">I bet you could find more red necks there then you could shake a stick at.  This one kind of scares me.  I didn''t know people did this kind of suff..    it is a neat photo</td>', 'I bet you could find more red necks there then you could shake a stick at.  This one kind of scares me.  I didn''t know people did this kind of suff..    it is a neat photo', '2002-08-27 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113440, 5016, 2798, '<td valign="top">Don''t ruin the illusion for me! I used to love that show. Nice colour but those guys in the foreground get in the way of the real star. - floyd</td>', 'Don''t ruin the illusion for me! I used to love that show. Nice colour but those guys in the foreground get in the way of the real star. - floyd', '2002-08-29 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113441, 5016, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but seems a bit blurry.</td>', 'Nice color, but seems a bit blurry.', '2002-08-31 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113442, 5016, 2261, '<td valign="top">But I thought there was only one, I thought the dukes were real, they lied to me.</td>', 'But I thought there was only one, I thought the dukes were real, they lied to me.', '2002-08-31 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113443, 5016, 1202, '<td valign="top">Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,<br/>Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,<br/>Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,<br/>Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,<br/>Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool<br/></td>', 'Composition: Subject Placement, Cropping, Background6,Technical: Focus, Exposure, Lighting, Processing7,Challenge: Does your entry meet it?6,Appeal: Is it Interesting, Motivating, Etc.? 5,Total Averaged Rating6.   Autool', '2002-09-01 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
