(113493, 5020, 472, '<td valign="top">this is nice but you need a less stark light.  you can soften it by bouncing it off a wall or sheet onto the pop, or put a sheet or some silk in between it and the pop.  the larger the source, the softer the light.  so a big glow is softer than a small one even at the same intensity.</td>', 'this is nice but you need a less stark light.  you can soften it by bouncing it off a wall or sheet onto the pop, or put a sheet or some silk in between it and the pop.  the larger the source, the softer the light.  so a big glow is softer than a small one even at the same intensity.', '2002-08-29 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
