(113499, 5020, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''ve never seen one of these actually in existence. lol.  Great colors, it actually looks like it''s been licked on a few times.  I like the shinyness too.  Lighting is perfect.  Angle and placement are very visually appealing.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  I''ve never seen one of these actually in existence. lol.  Great colors, it actually looks like it''s been licked on a few times.  I like the shinyness too.  Lighting is perfect.  Angle and placement are very visually appealing.  Great photo and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-31 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113500, 5020, 2928, '<td valign="top">10 - easily... Great shot, superb composition, excellent colour, outstanding quality You have used a neutral background with excellent effect in this shot; it propels the image forward with an explosion of amazing colours Great shooting and technique  this is a fantastic example of what can be achieved when both lighting and composition are spot on</td>', '10 - easily... Great shot, superb composition, excellent colour, outstanding quality You have used a neutral background with excellent effect in this shot; it propels the image forward with an explosion of amazing colours Great shooting and technique  this is a fantastic example of what can be achieved when both lighting and composition are spot on', '2002-09-01 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
