(113522, 5022, 2199, '<td valign="top">Creative approach (hope you don''t get too beat up in the ratings with this!) -- I would like this better if the background paper were not so noticably wrinkled. The blood somehow isn''t convincing either....and the plastic flowers don''t help!</td>', 'Creative approach (hope you don''t get too beat up in the ratings with this!) -- I would like this better if the background paper were not so noticably wrinkled. The blood somehow isn''t convincing either....and the plastic flowers don''t help!', '2002-08-27 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
