(113550, 5023, 82, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous colors.  I like the basketball hoop, because it defines the setting (more so than merely the other structure, which could be a porch, verandah, etc., but is probably a jungle gym).  Somehow, though, I''d like to see the hoop at a different angle.  It "argues" with the tree just a bit.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous colors.  I like the basketball hoop, because it defines the setting (more so than merely the other structure, which could be a porch, verandah, etc., but is probably a jungle gym).  Somehow, though, I''d like to see the hoop at a different angle.  It "argues" with the tree just a bit.', '2002-08-26 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
