(113563, 5023, 2858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful atmosphere here, good composition. Variety of colour and tone in the sky is great. Nitpick : the net stand could possibly be more visible/dramatic if it was isolated from the tree below. But once you start messing with the composition.......you end up with a different picture. Top five.</td>', 'Wonderful atmosphere here, good composition. Variety of colour and tone in the sky is great. Nitpick : the net stand could possibly be more visible/dramatic if it was isolated from the tree below. But once you start messing with the composition.......you end up with a different picture. Top five.', '2002-08-27 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
