(113565, 5023, 1024, '<td valign="top">One of my strongest memories of childhood is at the end of the day and everyone has to go home.I wish that the basketball hoop was somewhat more separated from the trees in the background but I am not sure that was possible. 8  BAMartin</td>', 'One of my strongest memories of childhood is at the end of the day and everyone has to go home.I wish that the basketball hoop was somewhat more separated from the trees in the background but I am not sure that was possible. 8  BAMartin', '2002-08-27 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
