(113582, 5023, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, and more wow.  If this were a sunset challenge, you''d have a good bet.  You will probably do well anyway....great colors.  If I had any kind of suggestion at all, look at the basketball backboard and the tree growing up into it, separate these two elements and you''d have a GREAT shot!!! (Still it ain''t bad!)  8 Swash</td>', 'Wow, and more wow.  If this were a sunset challenge, you''d have a good bet.  You will probably do well anyway....great colors.  If I had any kind of suggestion at all, look at the basketball backboard and the tree growing up into it, separate these two elements and you''d have a GREAT shot!!! (Still it ain''t bad!)  8 Swash', '2002-08-30 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113583, 5023, 3178, '<td valign="top">Well, what can you say? Great colors. Reminds me of the last day of summer vacation. I would have liked to have seen the BB rim seperated from the trees a little more. And I''m not exactly sure what''s going on to the right. I like the colors and emotion, but I can''t help wondering if there was a SLIGHTLY better angle for the shot. 9.</td>', 'Well, what can you say? Great colors. Reminds me of the last day of summer vacation. I would have liked to have seen the BB rim seperated from the trees a little more. And I''m not exactly sure what''s going on to the right. I like the colors and emotion, but I can''t help wondering if there was a SLIGHTLY better angle for the shot. 9.', '2002-08-30 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
