(113587, 5023, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky, but the foreground elements could be more effectively composed and framed. IT doesn''t really give a strong sense of a play area or sporting area, although I think I can tell that the big square thing is a basketball net. Perhaps a tighter shot with the net in frame would have been more effective.</td>', 'Very nice sky, but the foreground elements could be more effectively composed and framed. IT doesn''t really give a strong sense of a play area or sporting area, although I think I can tell that the big square thing is a basketball net. Perhaps a tighter shot with the net in frame would have been more effective.', '2002-09-01 04:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
