(113606, 5024, 1827, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I wish it were less sky more roller coaster; but to get enough, you might have had to crop out part of Cyclone, which I''d have been reluctant to do.  I would be interesting to see how the photo changes if the focus were on the rails as they start to dip instead of the name of the ride.  Good title.  6-7, I''ll see what I think as the week passes. just-married</td>', 'Nice shot.  I wish it were less sky more roller coaster; but to get enough, you might have had to crop out part of Cyclone, which I''d have been reluctant to do.  I would be interesting to see how the photo changes if the focus were on the rails as they start to dip instead of the name of the ride.  Good title.  6-7, I''ll see what I think as the week passes. just-married', '2002-08-27 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
