(113637, 5026, 2553, '<td valign="top">Is a "yougin'' " something like a "yute" ??!!   I like the feel, and the perspective of this shot.  I don''t know that it would convey "childhood" to me without the title, but the perspective of the grass does make you feel kind of "dwarfed" by the height, as a child might feel. lhall</td>', 'Is a "yougin'' " something like a "yute" ??!!   I like the feel, and the perspective of this shot.  I don''t know that it would convey "childhood" to me without the title, but the perspective of the grass does make you feel kind of "dwarfed" by the height, as a child might feel. lhall', '2002-08-31 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113638, 5026, 3080, '<td valign="top">This looks very similar to a path near where I live.  It''s in the boyscout reserve behind my college.  Anyway, I love the angle of this photo it is very nice.  The lighting worked very well for this photo.  The focus and placement withing the frame are great. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks very similar to a path near where I live.  It''s in the boyscout reserve behind my college.  Anyway, I love the angle of this photo it is very nice.  The lighting worked very well for this photo.  The focus and placement withing the frame are great. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-09-01 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113639, 5027, 3402, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2002-08-26 02:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
