(113642, 5027, 3208, '<td valign="top">Interesting but B&amp;W photo is out of focus.  I would have prefered the opposite, bringing the viewer''s attention to the past rather than the present.  Also, B&amp;W photo is wonky, but am I being too fussy now?  God idea.</td>', 'Interesting but B&W photo is out of focus.  I would have prefered the opposite, bringing the viewer''s attention to the past rather than the present.  Also, B&W photo is wonky, but am I being too fussy now?  God idea.', '2002-08-26 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
