(113671, 5028, 2881, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea that I can really relate to! I don''t usually like B&amp;W and most of the "childhood" B&amp;W photos are kind of depressing.  This one isn''t!  It made me smile '';&amp;lt;D</td>', 'This is a great idea that I can really relate to! I don''t usually like B&W and most of the "childhood" B&W photos are kind of depressing.  This one isn''t!  It made me smile '';&lt;D', '2002-08-26 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113672, 5028, 3448, '<td valign="top">This one gave me goosebumps! Very well captured. Also, nice balance of light and dark, and well cropped (not too much or too little extra detail) 9.</td>', 'This one gave me goosebumps! Very well captured. Also, nice balance of light and dark, and well cropped (not too much or too little extra detail) 9.', '2002-08-26 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
