(113679, 5028, 2553, '<td valign="top">EEK!  I can feel this in the pit of my stomach.  My Dad always threatened to do this and the thought scared me to death.  Good composition and lighting.  Interesting perspective on "childhood". lhall</td>', 'EEK!  I can feel this in the pit of my stomach.  My Dad always threatened to do this and the thought scared me to death.  Good composition and lighting.  Interesting perspective on "childhood". lhall', '2002-08-27 06:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113680, 5028, 3080, '<td valign="top">yup.  I relate.  when I was really little dad tried everything he could to yank them teeth out, but in 5th grade, I still had baby teeth and then they wouldn''t stop falling out in class.  it was aweful.  anyway, I love the angle here and I think black and white fits pretty good, considering all attention is on that door.  Great idea. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'yup.  I relate.  when I was really little dad tried everything he could to yank them teeth out, but in 5th grade, I still had baby teeth and then they wouldn''t stop falling out in class.  it was aweful.  anyway, I love the angle here and I think black and white fits pretty good, considering all attention is on that door.  Great idea. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113681, 5028, 3480, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea.  The shadow from the flash detracts a little.  Over all this is very good.</td>', 'Brilliant idea.  The shadow from the flash detracts a little.  Over all this is very good.', '2002-08-27 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
