(113730, 5031, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes of the two cans together. Very dark with a bluey colourcast. A closer crop of just the cans might be better, the bit of grass and detritus around the edges doesn''t add anything positive. <br/>Kavey</td>', 'Interesting shapes of the two cans together. Very dark with a bluey colourcast. A closer crop of just the cans might be better, the bit of grass and detritus around the edges doesn''t add anything positive. Kavey', '2002-08-26 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113731, 5031, 1827, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Definitely meets the challenge.  I think this concept could have really been good.  A can as the tool is a good choice and could act as a tool for some pretty cool reflective / light play.  I thought the framing detracted from the photo.  I would have preferred to see one can with the gum stuck on it and framed differently.  Props for the original idea though.  5, just-married</td>', 'LOL.  Definitely meets the challenge.  I think this concept could have really been good.  A can as the tool is a good choice and could act as a tool for some pretty cool reflective / light play.  I thought the framing detracted from the photo.  I would have preferred to see one can with the gum stuck on it and framed differently.  Props for the original idea though.  5, just-married', '2002-08-26 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113732, 5031, 2752, '<td valign="top">great DOF and sharp ....</td>', 'great DOF and sharp ....', '2002-08-26 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113733, 5031, 3080, '<td valign="top">Other than having a truely discusting subject matter, this is a well executed photo.  Visually, the cans should have been centered on the wall.  You did a great job keeping glare and reflection off the metal cans.  The angle is good.  And lighting is good.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Other than having a truely discusting subject matter, this is a well executed photo.  Visually, the cans should have been centered on the wall.  You did a great job keeping glare and reflection off the metal cans.  The angle is good.  And lighting is good.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-27 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
