(113742, 5032, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I really like the angle of this.  Almost like I''m getting ready to blow out the candles myself.  Beautiful focus on the cake and softer focus on the background.  can still tell what it is, but it''s almost like the background could be the "wishes"  Lighting is beautiful.  There is a small glare on the purple balloon in the back, but it does not distract from the photo, and i don''t know if it could be avoided.  Great framing.  The curly ribbon on the right goes right along the side of the photo.  Overall great photo. Congrats and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice.  I really like the angle of this.  Almost like I''m getting ready to blow out the candles myself.  Beautiful focus on the cake and softer focus on the background.  can still tell what it is, but it''s almost like the background could be the "wishes"  Lighting is beautiful.  There is a small glare on the purple balloon in the back, but it does not distract from the photo, and i don''t know if it could be avoided.  Great framing.  The curly ribbon on the right goes right along the side of the photo.  Overall great photo. Congrats and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
