(113753, 5032, 2172, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool work - so colorful.  Oh, just wish that the whole image was in focus....haha JUST KIDDING - Really, I like the choice of dof.  Good angle too.  Nice work all around  9 from me!<br/>Ruthann</td>', 'Pretty cool work - so colorful.  Oh, just wish that the whole image was in focus....haha JUST KIDDING - Really, I like the choice of dof.  Good angle too.  Nice work all around  9 from me!Ruthann', '2002-08-27 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113754, 5032, 3554, '<td valign="top">If the cake were more the focus of the picture I''d score it higher.  The background needs to be more muted I think.  The title is pretty good.</td>', 'If the cake were more the focus of the picture I''d score it higher.  The background needs to be more muted I think.  The title is pretty good.', '2002-08-27 20:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
