(113756, 5032, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot, and the DOF is very nice... I''m afraid the cake gets a little lost in the background, though.  I think this could have worked a little better with maybe a white bear and other light-colored items in the background so that the cake would stand out a little better.  Still a nice shot.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot, and the DOF is very nice... I''m afraid the cake gets a little lost in the background, though.  I think this could have worked a little better with maybe a white bear and other light-colored items in the background so that the cake would stand out a little better.  Still a nice shot.', '2002-08-27 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113757, 5032, 2199, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and wonderful idea! The cake is a little bit lost by the busy background elements (maybe a different angle on the cake would be more effective?)</td>', 'Beautiful colors and wonderful idea! The cake is a little bit lost by the busy background elements (maybe a different angle on the cake would be more effective?)', '2002-08-27 23:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113758, 5032, 2928, '<td valign="top">Great shot... My only suggestion here would have been to get closer in on that wonderful cake Use of DOF is great, lighting is very good  too much would have killed the candle flames  and the idea is good.  I think the overall picture smacks of fun.  (8)  I would have scored it ten if I had gotten more of that cake :) Good luck</td>', 'Great shot... My only suggestion here would have been to get closer in on that wonderful cake Use of DOF is great, lighting is very good  too much would have killed the candle flames  and the idea is good.  I think the overall picture smacks of fun.  (8)  I would have scored it ten if I had gotten more of that cake :) Good luck', '2002-08-28 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113759, 5032, 811, '<td valign="top">This shot really impresses me, though I could not say for certain why.  I like the colors and the focus you have used.  The composition is awesome. karmat</td>', 'This shot really impresses me, though I could not say for certain why.  I like the colors and the focus you have used.  The composition is awesome. karmat', '2002-08-28 16:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
