(113777, 5033, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a shot! You seem to have used a very wide angle lens for this shot which has meant you''ve got barrel distortion at the left and right sides. You''ve also got blue flaring against the white of the sky which is quite distracting. Your framing is good, though and I do love your idea. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Great idea for a shot! You seem to have used a very wide angle lens for this shot which has meant you''ve got barrel distortion at the left and right sides. You''ve also got blue flaring against the white of the sky which is quite distracting. Your framing is good, though and I do love your idea. 7 - floyd', '2002-08-29 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
