(113781, 5033, 806, '<td valign="top">Good idea: Good perspective. Sky is overexposed, and the bars in the foreground should be in sharp focus IMO in order to show that''s what the child is reaching for - therefore eyes are on it first. Good effort.</td>', 'Good idea: Good perspective. Sky is overexposed, and the bars in the foreground should be in sharp focus IMO in order to show that''s what the child is reaching for - therefore eyes are on it first. Good effort.', '2002-09-01 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
