(113790, 5034, 772, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  I don''t have much of a critique for you because I love the image... however, maybe I can help you out anyway :)  I bet you are getting comments about the tree branch on the right being distracting.  If so, it''s hogwash :)  Don''t believe it!  I think the image would be a bit better without it, but It''s not a ''distraction'' for me at all... good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler</td>', 'Great photo!  I don''t have much of a critique for you because I love the image... however, maybe I can help you out anyway :)  I bet you are getting comments about the tree branch on the right being distracting.  If so, it''s hogwash :)  Don''t believe it!  I think the image would be a bit better without it, but It''s not a ''distraction'' for me at all... good work :) = 8 - jmsetzler', '2002-08-27 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
