(113805, 5034, 3320, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everybody for their comments. People seems to be ''split'' about what to do with the little branch on the right. I left it because in my eyes it was ''balancing'' the picture and with the ''clouds  pattern'' it was not tatally ''unlinked'' to the mirror , it makes like an arc from the bottom right side to the top of the mirror.</td>', 'Thanks to everybody for their comments. People seems to be ''split'' about what to do with the little branch on the right. I left it because in my eyes it was ''balancing'' the picture and with the ''clouds  pattern'' it was not tatally ''unlinked'' to the mirror , it makes like an arc from the bottom right side to the top of the mirror.', '2002-09-02 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
