(113812, 5035, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is my second highest of the numerous swing photos.  I liked this one due to the fact that it''s not JUST a photo of a swing.  There was some creativity involved in chosing where to find the swing and which one to shoot to get a good angle in relation to the sun going down.  I like how it it shillouetted and I like how the "edge" of the water is parallel to the edge of the bottom of the frame.  Nice placement, beautiful photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is my second highest of the numerous swing photos.  I liked this one due to the fact that it''s not JUST a photo of a swing.  There was some creativity involved in chosing where to find the swing and which one to shoot to get a good angle in relation to the sun going down.  I like how it it shillouetted and I like how the "edge" of the water is parallel to the edge of the bottom of the frame.  Nice placement, beautiful photo.  Great job and good luck in the challenge.', '2002-08-26 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
