(113818, 5035, 2928, '<td valign="top">Superb shot. Love the colour and the drama.  I really like the composition; it has an emptiness about it, yet it''s not sad.  It looks like the sun is going down on a glorious day and you can almost see the faces of tired, happy kids after a fun filled day The picture may have faults  but I can''t see any (10)</td>', 'Superb shot. Love the colour and the drama.  I really like the composition; it has an emptiness about it, yet it''s not sad.  It looks like the sun is going down on a glorious day and you can almost see the faces of tired, happy kids after a fun filled day The picture may have faults  but I can''t see any (10)', '2002-08-28 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
