(113826, 5035, 3087, '<td valign="top">A lovely swing shot, beautiful background - fabulous colours in that sky and I really like how it graduates to white. Would like to see perspective moved just a little so there was more of a gap between bottom of swing and dark foreground. Sun seems pixelated. <br/>7, Kavey</td>', 'A lovely swing shot, beautiful background - fabulous colours in that sky and I really like how it graduates to white. Would like to see perspective moved just a little so there was more of a gap between bottom of swing and dark foreground. Sun seems pixelated. 7, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(113827, 5035, 2780, '<td valign="top">With the  amount of swings in this challenge I''m tempted to rate you low, but due to the photo being very very nice to look at, what with the silhouette and the sunset i''ll give it a 9. For a 10 score you could sharpen the whole photo up, as nothing is really in good focus.</td>', 'With the  amount of swings in this challenge I''m tempted to rate you low, but due to the photo being very very nice to look at, what with the silhouette and the sunset i''ll give it a 9. For a 10 score you could sharpen the whole photo up, as nothing is really in good focus.', '2002-09-01 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
