(113889, 5039, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! The lighting is so other-worldly: soft, glowing, beautiful colours. Love the soft lines of overlap and the central "sun" (though would like to see it better centred in frame). <br/>Very noisy photo and background not very even.<br/>9, Kavey</td>', 'Wonderful! The lighting is so other-worldly: soft, glowing, beautiful colours. Love the soft lines of overlap and the central "sun" (though would like to see it better centred in frame). Very noisy photo and background not very even.9, Kavey', '2002-08-31 06:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
